window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4101,"title":"Chapter 4101: Prey","paragraphs":["Chapter 4101: Prey","Editor: Henyee Translations","Looking at the furious Cobra, Xia Jinyuan smiled coldly. He was so angry now, but he would have to suffer more.","Cobra, who had smashed his phone into pieces, walked back and forth in the conference room a few times. In the end, he sat down again with a sinister gaze. He leaned his head against the back of the chair and closed his eyes. His chest, which was heaving violently, gradually calmed down.","He needed to enter the Chinese market, and the Chinese ambassador was his breakthrough point to enter the Chinese market quickly. Hence, he could not give up no matter what.","He needed to think of a way.","He needed to think of a way to reconnect with the Chinese ambassador.","...","When Xia Jinyuan saw this, his fingers moved slightly. The coldness in his eyes deepened as Cobra smiled confidently.","Cobra wouldn’t give up on entering the Chinese market because the forces behind him didn’t want that to happen. Hence, he would still think of a way. Qin Xiu rejected him today, but it didn’t mean that Cobra would give up on Qin Xiu.","Based on his observations for almost a year and a half, if Cobra’s gentle approach didn’t work, he would take a tough approach.","It looked like Cobra was resting with his eyes closed, but in fact, his poisonous fangs were already filled with venom. He was waiting for an opportunity to bite his prey.","And Qin Xiu was his prey.","Xia Jinyuan lowered his eyes slightly. His unfathomable black eyes were so dark that there was almost no light in them. In the depths, there was a hint of sharpness. It was the viciousness under calmness.","He needed to remind Qin Xiu. Although this ambassador was indeed very smart, Cobra was too cunning and impossible to guard against. Qin Xiu still needed to be reminded.","However, there was no need to worry that Cobra would do something fatal to Qin Xiu. The cunning Cobra knew how to protect himself. Since he needed to get involved with Qin Xiu, he wouldn’t do anything to harm himself.","There wouldn’t be any lethal tricks. It would definitely be a cheap shot.","Xia Jinyuan needed to think of a way to remind Qin Xiu.","It had to be done in the next few days. A few days later, after Cobra was done dealing with the famous economist who had embarrassed him and ruined his plan, it would be Qin Xiu’s turn.","Xia Jinyuan knew that Cobra would definitely take care of the famous Western economist who gave him a bad declaration, but he didn’t expect Cobra to act so quickly.","The meeting with Qin Xiu in the morning failed, and in the afternoon, Cobra took revenge on the economist.","According to the news channel, at 2:00 pm on May 1st, the famous economist, Jesse Morris, was arrested and investigated by the authorities for accepting bribes. At 4:00 pm, less than two hours after Jesse Morris was detained, scandals about him were reported one after another, including sex scandals.","The bribery didn’t cause much of a stir. When Jesse Morris was caught, he faced the camera and calmly said that it was a misunderstanding. Someone was trying to frame him. He was innocent and was willing to be investigated.","However, when the photos of a few sex scandals were exposed, Jesse Morris was like a small wooden boat sailing on the sea. A huge wave hit him, and the boat was destroyed.","That was because this set of photos starred underage girls.","Jesse Morris had crossed the line and stepped into a minefield. In the morning, he was still able to face the camera calmly. In the afternoon, when he was exposed again, he was like a defeated rooster. He could no longer be arrogant."]},{"number":4102,"title":"Chapter 4102: Distance Between Hearts","paragraphs":["Chapter 4102: Distance Between Hearts","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan, who was sitting in the room, was watching television. On the television, Jesse Morris, who was being transferred to prison, was hit in the head by a few tomatoes. Red juice spurted out. On the screen, Jesse Morris was so disheveled that he looked like a street rat that everyone wanted to beat up.","This was all orchestrated by Cobra. He reported that Jesse Morris took bribes. He then released photos of Jesse Morris toying with underage girls. In just two hours, he pulled Jesse Morris from heaven to hell.","Cobra didn’t just have evidence that could ruin Jesse Morris’ reputation. He also had many such photos in his hands. These photos became Cobra’s chance to grasp some secrets of certain countries.","The reason why the Russian side sent Luke to infiltrate Cobra was because there was a problem with the higher-ups on the Russian side. However, the Russian side didn’t manage to find out which higher-up was the problem. That was why Luke infiltrated.","Since Luke wanted to return to Russia, they must already know which higher-up was the mole.","Xia Jinyuan turned off the television and didn’t pay attention to what would happen to the economist, Jesse Morris. Prey that was targeted by Cobra would never have a good ending.","He only hoped that Luke would act quickly. The faster, the better. That way, he could quickly return to the country and reunite with his lover.","He didn’t know what his little fox was doing at home. It was 4:00 pm. Over here, they were 14 hours slower than in China. That meant that it was already 5:00 am on May 2nd. May 1st was Labor Day. She wouldn’t be on a holiday as she was a military school student. She might be training somewhere now.","Recalling the past, all their holidays were all fake. The normal university students would look forward to May 1st, Labor Day, as well as the arrival of the winter and summer vacations. Military school students were different. Instead, they hoped that school would start soon.","Holiday? What kind of holiday was this?","Besides training, there was only more training. They couldn’t enjoy the joy of the holidays at all. They might as well go to school. At least they could still have weekends off.","Sometimes, during the holidays, they would train till the weekends.","When the students protested, the instructor would pretend to be stupid. He would pat his forehead and say in realization, “Oh my, look at my memory. I forgot that today is the end of the week. I’m sorry, I’m sorry.”","The instructor seemed to think of the students as if they were idiots.","Then, the students who were suppressing their anger would say, “Since you know now, can’t we get time off?”","What did the instructor say?","The instructor, who was full of tricks, then said earnestly, “We’re all soldiers. How can soldiers give up halfway? If you give up half of today’s training so easily, you might give up an inch of land in our country tomorrow.","“Students, perseverance is the most important thing. We can’t give up just like that, understand?”","What else could they say?","With such words, would the students still dare to say that they would rest for half a day on the weekend?","They didn’t dare!","All of them continued their holiday training obediently.","Thinking about what happened in the military school in the past, Xia Jinyuan felt a surge of warmth in his chest. Even the faint smile on the corners of his lips was sweet.","He was personally bringing the lover he loved to walk the path he had walked before. As long as he thought about it, the tip of his tongue would be dripping with honey.","‘Just wait a little longer, little fox. I’ll be back to look for you soon, very soon.’"]},{"number":4103,"title":"Chapter 4103: Dream","paragraphs":["Chapter 4103: Dream","Editor: Henyee Translations","The person whom Lieutenant Colonel Xia missed deeply was still hugging her pillow and sleeping. No one knew what she was dreaming about, but there was a sweet smile on her lips that was moistened by the dew.","He Jing looked at Ye Jian, who woke up later than her for the first time. She reached out her hand to push Ye Jian awake, but she slowly retracted it in the end. Ye Jian was smiling so sweetly even in her dreams. He Jing couldn’t bear to wake her up.","She didn’t know what kind of dream Ye Jian was having, but it must be sweet like honey.","During outdoor training, there were only a few mouthfuls of rations. The other students were all worried about how they would spend three days and two nights. They were frowning even in their dreams. But Ye Jian was smiling sweetly even in her dreams.","It was obvious who were the ones with strong mental fortitudes.","He Jing was a little envious.","Ye Jian dreamed that Xia Jinyuan was wearing a well-ironed military uniform. He was so handsome that he looked like he had walked out of a painting. Every part of him was filled with unparalleled elegance. He stepped on the sunlight and walked toward her step by step. Every few steps, he would call her ‘little fox’ in his clear voice. It was sweet and doting.","Ye Jian looked at the man who was getting closer and closer to her. She listened to his voice that was filled with love until she saw him looking at her with a smile in his eyes that was as vast as the stars. Ye Jian, who had not woken up, started to laugh.","That was indeed the case.","He Jing looked at Ye Jian, who was laughing even in her dreams. She was dumbfounded.","What kind of dream did she have? Ye Jian was even laughing out loud!","“F*ck! F*ck! Hurry, hurry, help me pat them off. Help me pat them off.”","Not far away, the sound of a male student stomping his feet could be heard. He Jing turned her head and looked. Ye Jian, who was having a sweet dream, suddenly opened her eyes and stood up.","“What happened?” She had just woken up, and her voice was still a little hoarse.","He Jing turned around and looked at Ye Jian, who woke up instantly. She suddenly couldn’t tell whether Ye Jian had really been asleep just now.","Did she wake up just because of that small commotion?","“A nest of ants crawled on him. He got a fright,” the student in front replied to Ye Jian with a smile. When he woke up, he realized that his arms were covered with ants. He was indeed a little frightened.","Ye Jian woke up from her dream. When she heard that it was just a nest of ants, she didn’t ask further. It was common for snakes, insects, ants, and rats to appear in the forest at night.","Alas...","Ye Jian turned around and sighed silently. She reached out her hand to her lips, and a sweet smile appeared on her face again.","Just now, she had a dream about Captain Xia. In her dream, her Captain Xia was back. Then... he was preparing to kiss her.","He was so close to kissing her. In the end... she woke up.","What a pity.","She sighed again. What a pity. He almost kissed her.","She unconsciously raised her wrist and looked at the time. The sweetness brought by her dream was instantly hidden in the depths of her heart. It was already five in the morning!","Everyone only had ten minutes to reorganize. Ten minutes later, they would leave immediately.","At night, the students who were camping and resting near the creek had already woken up. They carried their rifles and started tidying up.","Ye Jian, who was squatting by the moss-covered rock, unscrewed her water bottle and went to the clear stream. When she heard the empty bottle fill up, Ye Jian picked up the water bottle and said to He Jing behind her, “Come, give me your water bottle. We’ll continue our journey after filling it with water.”"]},{"number":4104,"title":"Chapter 4104: Beautiful","paragraphs":["Chapter 4104: Beautiful","Editor: Henyee Translations","He Jing, who passed the water bottle over, was still thinking about the sweet smile that Ye Jian revealed in her dream just now. They had been classmates for three years, but He Jing had never seen Ye Jian smile so sweetly. He Jing really couldn’t resist her curiosity. She half-squatted and moved to Ye Jian’s side with her knees bent. She nudged Ye Jian with her shoulder and asked with a small voice and a smile, “What kind of sweet dream did you have just now? You were laughing until your teeth were revealed. It was as if you had drunk honey. It must’ve been a sweet dream, right?”","The stream flowed into the bottle. After a while, the entire bottle was filled. Ye Jian picked up the wet bottle and twisted the lid. She turned her head and looked at He Jing. Her fair face turned pink like the tip of a lotus flower. “Did you laugh? Did you make a sound?”","...","It couldn’t be. She hadn’t reached the stage where she would laugh in her dreams, right?","Ye Jian thought of the sweetness of reuniting after a long time in her dream. She thought of the man she loved deeply in her dream holding her face gently with both hands. He had been looking at her deeply with his dark eyes that were filled with love. Then, he slowly lowered his head and leaned closer. Ye Jian felt her cheeks burning.","He Jing saw that Ye Jian was blushing shyly. She suddenly understood.","She said teasingly, “Amazing, amazing. Did you have a wet dream?”","A wet dream?","Ye Jian was so embarrassed that her face felt hot. “What are you talking about? That’s not true.” He didn’t even kiss her. How could it be called a wet dream?","Besides, wasn’t a wet dream something like... that? Even if he kissed her and didn’t do anything else, that wouldn’t be considered a wet dream.","“Not true? There’s clearly something going on. Look at your eyes. They’re filled with love. Look at your smile. You look like a young lady in love.” He Jing had been in a relationship before. As someone who had been in a relationship before, she guessed that Ye Jian must have dreamed of her mysterious boyfriend.","She smiled teasingly. Ye Jian was so embarrassed that the faint pink on her cheeks became more vivid. Her beauty stunned He Jing for a moment.","Amidst the green mountains and rivers, Ye Jian’s beauty was like a flower blooming in the wind. She was so beautiful that she seemed to have stepped out of a painting. She was so beautiful that she was enticing. Every frown and smile of hers was gorgeous.","He Jing couldn’t help but swallow her saliva. She wanted to touch Ye Jian’s face.","And she did.","Ye Jian looked at her comrade who was in a daze as she reached out to touch her face. She blinked and asked He Jing, “Why? Is there something on my face?”","“Your face, it’s so stunning. I feel that I’ve been blessed when I touch it. This feeling... is too good. It’s just like a peeled egg. It’s tender and smooth.” He Jing sighed as she touched Ye Jian’s face. “Little Jian, your boyfriend is so lucky. Your skin is a treasure!”","He Jing had always been steady and rarely said such teasing words. Ye Jian, who was suddenly taken advantage of by her, hurriedly grabbed He Jing’s hand that was still touching her face and glared at her. “There are many peeled eggs in the cafeteria. I’ll peel them for you later and let you touch them as much as you want.”","“No, no, no. Touching the eggs won’t be the same as touching you.” He Jing knew when to stop. When she saw Ye Jian’s face turning red, she knew that if she continued teasing her... they would definitely attract Xu Wen, who would want to stir up trouble."]},{"number":4105,"title":"Chapter 4105: Solidarity","paragraphs":["Chapter 4105: Solidarity","Editor: Henyee Translations","She cleared her throat and looked serious. She then smiled as if she knew everything. “What’s there to be shy about? It’s normal to have wet dreams.”","“There hasn’t been any news from your boyfriend for a long time, right? How can you not think about him after not seeing him for a long time? I understand, I understand.” He Jing carried her water bottle and stood up. She patted Ye Jian’s shoulder. “Wash your face. Wen is smarter than me. She’ll definitely notice something amiss if you look like this. I’ll go over there to wash my face since we’re filling the water here. I don’t want the dead skin on my face tontaminate our drinking water.”","He Jing snickered and left, leaving Ye Jian squatting alone in a daze. Then, Ye Jian lowered her head and saw her reflection in the flowing stream.","The stream was very clear. The water flowed slowly. Through her reflection, sheuld see therners of her mouth curling up.","Just like what He Jing said, she was smiling brightly.","Ye Jian looked at the face reflected in the stream anduldn’t help but purse her lips and smile.","It wasn’t a wet dream. It was a beautiful dream that she yearned for deeply.","The feeling in the dream was too sweet, too gentle, and too beautiful. It was as if it had really happened. That was a good dream. Perhaps... Her hands reached into the stream. The ripples messed up the water and blurred her reflection. The only thing that didn’t change was the sweet smile on her lips.","Maybe her Captain Xia would be back soon.","He had told her to wait for him and that he wouldme over soon.","A gentleman’s promise would definitely be kept!","Ye Jian washed her face with theld mountain stream water. Theldness of the water suppressed the embarrassment on her face bit by bit. It also melted the honey-like smile on her lips.","Xu Wen didn’t see the smile on Ye Jian’s face, but she had seen He Jing talking to Ye Jian for a few minutes. It was normal for them to talk for a few minutes. What was abnormal was the smile on He Jing’s face.","Her dark eyes darted around. She leaned over and asked He Jing with a smile, “What did the two of you talk about just now? There’s something wrong with the smile on your face.","“Were you teasing our captain? Did you catch him doing something embarrassing? Can you share it with me?”","Although Xu Wen was unreliable sometimes, she was terrifying when she was meticulous. She was like a detective whould catch even the slightest hint.","He Jing, who had deliberately restrained the smile on her face, thought to herself, ‘This is bad.’ She pretended that nothing happened and glanced at Xu Wen. She said calmly, “There’s nothing to share.”","She even deliberately pointed at Xu Wen’s eyes and said in disdain, “You have gunk in your eyes. Hurry up and wash them clean.”","“No, something’s fishy here. You must have said something unspeakable just now. Fine, you want to hide it from me, right? Hahaha, ut Xu didn’t get her name for nothing. Just wait, He Jing.”","Xu Wen rubbed her eyes and wiped away the non-existent eye gunk. Her smile made He Jing raise her hand and flick her forehead. “ut Xu? In your dreams! I’ll wash my face. We’ll leave in five minutes.”","Song Zhiqiu, who had put away the damp-proof mat, happened to see this scene. He raised his voice and said to He Jing, “Student He Jing, we have to be united and friendly.”","...","So, he was protecting her, huh?!","He Jing smiled and glanced at Song Zhiqiu. ‘Wen has a man she likes. You’re too late.’","Xu Wen looked at Song Zhiqiu and narrowed her eyes slightly. She seemed to understand something and said with a faint smile, “Student Song Zhiqiu, don’t worry about me.”"]},{"number":4106,"title":"Chapter 4106: Play","paragraphs":["Chapter 4106: Play","Editor: Henyee Translations","“I’m not worried about you. I’m asking He Jing to hurry up and put away the damp-proof mats. Also, we need to be united and friendly,” Song Zhiqiu replied with a faint smile, instantly dissolving the slightly different atmosphere.","Below, a male student picked up a small stone and threw it at hismrade who was washing his face. He laughed and lded him, “Can you have some shame? We’re allllecting water below. You came here alone to wash your face? Gosh!”","“Hahaha, do you think that there’s only my dead skin in the water? Maybe there’s even the animals’ morning pee! Hahaha...”","“F*ck, you’re disgusting!”","“Their urine is cleaner than the dead skin on your face!”","“I’m already showing mercy by not washing my feet. If I knew this would happen, I would have washed my feet.”","“If you want to be beaten up, just say it. I’m waiting to give you a punch.”","Xu Wen thought of the water she got just now and glanced at the ground. She dug out a small rock from the moss and threw it at the leg of the male student who was washing his face. “Liu Yang, try saying that again!”","Liu Yang, who was washing his face, laughed. “Hahaha, let’s not talk about it anymore! I’m about to vomit!”","Ye Jian silently wiped her hands and erased the evidence.","Sorry, she had also washed her face at the top alone just now.","The ten minutes of reorganization was done in a very relaxed manner. After ten minutes, everyone gathered under Ye Jian’s sternmmand.","The young faces, which were filled with the aura of the rising sun, revealed unwavering determination. They looked ahead with fearless eyes. The jungle camouflage on their bodies seemed to have merged with the surrounding mountains, protecting this lively land with every blade of grass and tree.","As the captain, Ye Jian stood at the front with a stern andld facial expression. Afterunting, she glanced at all hermrades and gave the order in ald voice.","“Let’s go!”","At 5:11 am, the 15 students of Group 3 started a new day of outdoor training. In the vast forest, they followed the designated route and took over the river in the mountains. Together, they climbed over the mossvered rocks that would make them fall if they were not careful. Together, they climbed the steep hill and headed toward their destination.","“From here to here... there’s a very steep suspended mountain. If we don’t go this way, we have to go around here.”","At two o’clock in the afternoon, Ye Jian, who had been marching for more than half a day, discussed with the students of Group 3 about how to move forward.","The routes in the forest were extremelymplicated. If they were not careful, they would get lost even if they had ampass. Moreover, there were legends of savages here. There were all kinds of creepy and mysterious legends.","However, they didn’t enter the depths of the forest, nor did they enter the deep forest that no one had ever entered. They had always been in the part of the forest where villagers would enter the mountains to buy things.","“If we go around here, I’m afraid it’ll be dark by the time we reach the village. It’s easier to get lost in the dark. My suggestion is to place an escape rope on the suspended slope of the mountain. Everyone will slide down the escape rope. What do you think?”","“Although the detour is a little further, it’s safer.”","“No, it’s a long detour. It lengthens the time. Just now, Ye Jian said that if we don’t reach the village before night, the risk of getting lost is higher. This is a forest area. Even the local villagers don’t dare to venture to many places. If we get lost, thempass won’t be able to guide us out. We might not even be able tome out alive.”"]},{"number":4107,"title":"Chapter 4107: Cooperate","paragraphs":["Chapter 4107: Cooperate","Editor: Henyee Translations","Song Zhiqiu didn’t agree with what the previous student said. It seemed safe to take a detour, but the unpredictable risk was greater.","“But this is a suspended slope. It’s almost three stories high. If you fall accidentally, you’ll fracture your bones.”","“I think Song Zhiqiu’s words make sense. There’s too big of an unpredictable risk after dark. At least we know the dangers if we go down the elevated slope. I choose to go down the elevated slope.”","Aerial slope meant that the mountain was cut off from the base of the mountain. The top was solid, and the bottom was empty. Theyuldn’t walk. They had to lower the rope to pass.","Xu Wen looked at the mountain village where they would be staying for the night and whispered, “Before we left, a senior told me that if we didn’t reach the village, weuld go here...”","She pointed at a spot on the electronic map. Her face was pale, and her voice was even softer. “This is the resting place of the villagers in the mountains. It’s said that there will be will-o’-the-wisp. I choose to take the elevated slope.”","She was most afraid of spending the night at a cemetery. She would rather choose a shortcut that looked dangerous but in fact, she only needed to pay extra attention to it.","Xu Wen’s words made the male students’ expressions change slightly. Although they were soldiers and didn’t really believe in ghosts, theyuldn’t get over the hurdle in their hearts.","Song Zhiqiu looked at Ye Jian. In the end, the decision was with Ye Jian. He believed that with Ye Jian’smmanding ability, she must have an answer in her heart.","“Let’s choose the shortcut. Vice-Captain Song Zhiqiu and I will go down first. Then, you guys willme down. The seniors have taken this path before. We’ll just take it again. We just have to be careful. It won’t be a problem.","“Also, it’s a test to see if we pass our usual training. It’s not a wise choice to choose a long path to avoid using an escape rope.”","Ye Jian slowed down her speech and spoke word by word. Herld voice was penetrating. She expressed her opinion and let the students understand which choice was the wisest.","This was the young diplomatic ambassador from China. Cobra looked down on this ambassador before meeting him, so he paid a heavy price!","Cobra wanted to enter the Chinese market like a savior?","Dream on!","The young diplomatic ambassador was full of doubts about Cobra’s declaration. He didn’t care about such a declaration at all. If Cobra wasn’t the most outstanding entrepreneur and philanthropist in Molaban, the Chinese ambassador might not have met him at all!","He thought that he would be able to enter the Chinese market smoothly, but his expression was much more serious than before.","The expressionless Xia Jinyuan’s lips curled up slightly. He had heard thenversation between Cobra and the nomist. The nomist’sntempt for China meant that it was impossible for Cobra to enter the Chinese market through the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.","A few male students were still tightening the rope around the fir tree. Everyone stared intently at the two people who were starting to descend. They held their breaths.","This was their first outdoor survival training. They had to rely on themselves. If anything happened, they had to solve it themselves. No one wanted anything to happen in a desolate place."]},{"number":4108,"title":"Chapter 4108: Hold On","paragraphs":["Chapter 4108: Hold On","Editor: Henyee Translations","This survival training was not difficult for Ye Jian. It was the simplest primary training. After trying to fasten the escape rope, she started to speed up and descend.","Ye Jian pulled the escape rope and took a deep breath. As she exhaled, she started to slide down.","At this moment, her legs were still kicking the mountain. When the escape rope went vertically down the suspended layer, her legs lost their kicking power. She relied on the strength of her upper limbs and her usual training skills to complete the landing.","At first, Ye Jian’s speed was neither fast nor slow. She was parallel to Song Zhiqiu, who was descending with her. When she was almost in the air, Song Zhiqiu then moved his descending device. When he looked down again, Ye Jian, who was descending with him just now, had instantly dropped more than a meter and disappeared from his vision.","The students gasped slightly.","They lowered their heads and looked down. Ye Jian had already fallen to the suspended level and was descending at an extremely fast speed.","She pulled the rope, tightened it, and slid the lowering device. To her, it was as simple as eating and drinking. All her actions were completed consecutively without any pause. She was as skilled as if she had undergone thousands of such lowering training.","Song Zhiqiu couldn’t help but raise his eyebrows. He said to the students who couldn’t see Ye Jian anymore, “Three meters in ten seconds. I’m still above. She’s already on the ground.”","In other words, Ye Jian didn’t even use a minute before landing from a three-story high mountain.","The students who were still standing on top silently wiped the sweat on their foreheads that hadn’t been dried by the mountain wind. Ye Jian from their class... was destined to be a legend that was difficult to surpass.","Ye Jian, who had landed on her feet, untied the deceleration device and grabbed the escape rope with both hands. She shook it forcefully and looked up at the top of the mountain that was illuminated by the light. She raised her voice and said, “I’ve landed safely. Next person! Hurry up!”","Since she was safe, it meant that everything was fine below. All the students could start descending.","Female students took priority. Xu Wen was the first to start descending after Ye Jian. She had improved very quickly in the past two years. Her basic skills had been trained by Ye Jian until they were very solid. Even so, this was the first time she completed a three-story descent in the wild. She was still a little afraid.","She took a deep breath and gave an ‘OK’ sign to the male student who was pulling the escape rope. Then, she started to descend rhythmically.","“All the best!” He Jing, who was the second to prepare, encouraged her good friend and comrade in a low voice.","“Yes, I’m fine. I can do it,” Xu Wen replied. She kicked her feet down and leaned back slightly. As the deceleration device slid, Xu Wen had already started to descend.","Song Zhiqiu landed safely below. He stepped on the escape rope with one foot and held it tightly with both hands. He smiled at Ye Jian, who was in the same position to ensure that the escape rope wouldn’t shake. “You’re really amazing. Are you really planning to enter the front line in the future?","“The last time, the instructor said that with your current physical performance, it’s not a problem for you to participate in the special forces election. The biggest problem is that our country doesn’t have an official female special forces military unit yet.”","The instructors in charge of physical training in the military school saw Ye Jian’s results and agreed that she could participate in all kinds of selections.","The only pity was that there was no female special forces unit at the moment.","Ye Jian, who had been staring up against the light, smiled and said, “If there’s no female special forces unit, I can enter the male special forces unit. As long as it’s a military unit, there’s no need to differentiate between men and women.”","“Sigh, are you really planning to go to the special forces after graduating from the military school? To the field military unit?” Song Zhiqiu was shocked when he saw the seriousness in Ye Jian’s smile."]},{"number":4109,"title":"Chapter 4109: Survival","paragraphs":["Chapter 4109: Survival","Editor: Henyee Translations","Against the light, Ye Jian saw Xu Wen descending steadily. She retracted her gaze and turned to her shocked comrade. “Is that very strange? No, it’s normal.","“I really want to go to the front line field military unit. It’s exciting. There’s still a year before graduation. It’s time to plan for the future.”","“It looks like you’re really planning to go to the field military unit. It’s not easy for a female soldier to go to the field military unit.” After the shock, Song Zhiqiu felt that it was quite suitable for Ye Jian to enter the special forces.","He admired her courage. To be honest, even he, a male soldier, was afraid of going to the field military unit or the special forces.","The experience wasn’t just bitter. It was so bitter that one couldn’t even retreat when the time came. If one didn’t have the courage and guts, one shouldn’t even think about trying.","“Ye Jian, you’re my most admired comrade. I don’t think I’ll be able to meet a powerful comrade like you in the future when I enter the military unit,” Song Zhiqiu said seriously. “We’ve been classmates for three years. You’ll always be number one. You’re saying that you’ll go to the special forces after graduation, and I believe you.”","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled. He had guessed correctly.","After graduation, she might really go to the Xueyu unit and become a member of the Xueyu unit.","“We’ll talk about it when the time comes. I have an idea, but I need to be accepted first. They’re coming down. Tighten up.” Ye Jian raised her head and looked up.","This topic could end now.","Song Zhiqiu understood what she meant. He tightened the escape rope in his hand. The male student on it had already begun to hang in the air. He was slightly faster than Xu Wen.","Xu Wen was very fast. Ye Jian could feel that she wasn’t shaking uncontrollably when she grabbed the escape rope. It could be seen that Xu Wen had a good grasp of the tempo.","The male student landed safely while Xu Wen completed the descent a minute later.","Xu Wen’s time on the three-story suspended slope, which was about ten meters high, was within the passing range.","She came down and took off the lowering device. Then, she high-fived Ye Jian and said in high spirits, “How is it? Am I worthy of praise?”","“Not bad, your control is very stable. You passed.” Ye Jian was not stingy with her praises. She had seen Xu Wen’s improvement. She had gone from not having any basic skills to being able to complete every physical fitness test. It was all thanks to her hard work and perseverance.","Xu Wen wiped the sweat off her forehead and smiled until her eyes seemed to be welling up. She patted her cheeks that were red from nervousness and replied with a smile, “I feel good about myself too. Come, let me step on the rope. You rest.”","“Okay, I’ll leave it to you.” Ye Jian didn’t reject her. This was how they usually cooperated. There was no need to reject her.","While training could improve one’s ability, it could also greatly increase the chemistry between comrades. This outdoor survival training was even more intense.","However, in Ye Jian’s eyes, this wasn’t outdoor survival training. It was just outdoor survival. It had nothing to do with training.","The real outdoor training was like the Xueyu unit’s training. They would bring one day’s worth of food and survive in the wild for seven days. They had to break out of the encirclement, carry out counter-encirclement, conduct reconnaissance of the enemy, climb cliffs, and so on... That was the real outdoor survival training. It wasn’t like now, where they only needed to march on foot. Occasionally, they needed to deal with dangerous situations.","Ye Jian handled it with ease without any pressure, but the students who were having their first outdoor survival experience were having a much harder time.","It was already 4:30 pm. The sky got dark early in the mountains. There was still some light, but the forest was starting to darken. There were still students who hadn’t completed their descent. They needed to hurry."]},{"number":4110,"title":"Chapter 4110: Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 4110: Danger","Editor: Henyee Translations","There were still three students. The three of them tied the two escape ropes together again and wrapped them around the fir tree. They formed an ‘n’ shape and threw the two ends of the escape rope down. This way, the last student could put away the escape rope after completing the descent.","“Alright, I’m preparing to descend. The two of you, get ready.”","A male student grabbed one end of the escape rope and shouted down, “I’m starting. Pull tight below.”","“I’m pulling it tight. I guarantee that you won’t fall.”","“There are a few people helping you. Don’t be afraid. Come down!”","Xu Wen raised her eyebrows at Ye Jian and said proudly, “Am I bolder than the male students now? Oh my, I admire myself more and more.”","“Forget it. You’re being rash again. How bold of you to say those things. Do you want to sleep in that place tonight?” He Jing liked to hit Xu Wen, who was always arrogant. She didn’t want her to get too complacent and start regressing again.","Ye Jian didn’t comment on this.","Occasionally, He Jing needed to step on Xu Wen’s tail.","The students who landed safely below smiled wantonly. The sunlight scattered, and the three students were laughing.","The male student coming down wasn’t afraid. However, he was careless when he was lowering the buffer. Before the buffer was completely buckled, it was lowered. In an instant, he slid down the escape rope.","“Xu Lin!”","“F*ck!”","“Quick, tighten it!”","Seeing this scene, the male students below roared with widened eyes. Something big was going to happen!","Ye Jian, who had been standing at the side and staring at the scene, had a sharp look in her eyes. She quickly pulled the escape rope and swung it back. The escape rope wrapped around the male student like a snake.","When the students who had witnessed the entire process saw this, their hearts were in their throats, and their eyes were filled with shock.","The shock was still in their eyes when they saw the escape rope suddenly come to life and wrap around Xu Neng tightly. Their comrade, who had been falling, stopped in mid-air. At that moment, all the students felt as if they had escaped the bullet.","Ye Jian grabbed the escape rope with both hands and pulled it tightly. Then, she ran toward the mountain. She pulled the vertical escape rope to form a slope.","The male students immediately reacted. Liu Yang and a few other male students rushed up and pulled the escape rope with Ye Jian.","Song Zhiqiu shouted, “Xu Lin, lock the buffer!”","He shouted so loudly that the veins on his neck popped out.","Damn it! He was hanging five to six meters above the ground. If he fell, he would break a few bones!","These were all hard and sharp rocks!","The careless male student, Xu Lin, had scared himself half to death. Cold sweat instantly broke out all over his body.","He didn’t expect to make such a mistake!","Fortunately, he was calm enough and didn’t lose his composure. He hurriedly buckled the buffer in his hand onto the escape rope. When he buckled it, he was a little nervous. His hands were trembling.","“Damn it, it’s too tight. I can’t fasten it!”","Xu Lin, who was tied up by the escape rope, didn’t manage to buckle the buffer that was tightened into his camouflage uniform. Ye Jian said to the male student who was pulling the escape rope with her, “Pull it tightly. Don’t sway! I’ll go over and help him now!”","“Okay, you can rest assured on our side!”","The guys flexed their arms until their muscles were tense. They had to tighten the rope. If they didn’t, the escape rope would loosen and Xu Lin, who was five to six meters in the air, would fall!","Ye Jian nodded slightly. She released her grip and rushed to the other end."]},{"number":4111,"title":"Chapter 4111: Weak Legs","paragraphs":["Chapter 4111: Weak Legs","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian said to the male students, “Hold on to the escape rope tightly and go in one direction. Try your best to close the two ends together. I’ll climb up and tie it tightly for Xu Lin.”","“I’ll go up,” Song Zhiqiu said in a low voice.","“No, you’re a man. You’re heavier than me,” Ye Jian replied. She gestured for the male students to hurry up and put their escape ropes together.","Xu Wen was so nervous that she grabbed He Jing’s wrist tightly with one hand. Her teeth were chattering. “You really can’t afford to be distracted! Don’t fall, don’t fall!”","“It’s good that you know. Shut up and stop talking! Our captain is preparing to go up and save them.” He Jing didn’t even feel how much pain her wrist was in when Xu Wen grabbed it. She was so nervous that she didn’t know how painful it was.","The students on the other end of the escape rope gathered around Liu Yang and the other male students. Xu Lin, whose forehead was dripping with sweat, tried countless times, but he still couldn’t successfully buckle the buffer onto the escape rope that was so tight. His body seemed to be about to break.","Ye Jian, who was below, said to him calmly, “Xu Lin, relax your body. I’ll come over now. Don’t worry, it’s fine. The tighter it is around you, the safer it is.","That was true. The tighter it was, the more Xu Lin wouldn’t fall.","At least, they didn’t have to worry about Xu Lin falling down. At least Xu Lin was safe now.","“Hold on tight. Don’t let go!”","The students who were holding onto the escape rope reminded each other. The two male students who hadn’t come down knew that something had happened to Xu Lin. The slope on their side was too steep. They couldn’t see where Xu Lin was hanging at all. The two of them didn’t ask further. Their backs were tense as they waited for their comrades below to save Xu Lin.","Ye Jian stepped on the shoulders of two male students who were squatting down. Then, she pulled the escape rope tightly with both hands and hooked her body up. She twisted her legs and pulled the escape rope onto her calves. The students who looked up saw that Ye Jian was as agile as a monkey. She didn’t need any help as she climbed up quickly.","“Amazing, Captain!”","A student who was dumbfounded couldn’t help but sigh. He was the only one who voiced out, but he spoke the thoughts of all the students who were watching.","Ye Jian was really amazing!","“Tighten, tighten!”","“Move closer to Xu Lin. Slow down!”","As Ye Jian kept climbing up and got closer and closer to Xu Lin, the students below were once again nervous.","When Xu Lin saw Ye Jian, he was drenched in cold sweat. The moment he saw her, it was as if he had found someone to rely on. He felt safe.","Ye Jian wrapped the escape rope around her right calf. She grabbed the escape rope tightly with her right hand and reached out her left hand to Xu Lin. “Give me the buffer in your hand. Don’t tense your body too much. It’ll strain your muscles.”","“Okay, okay... Be careful.” Xu Lin passed the buffer that looked like it had been fished out of water to Ye Jian. His fingers were trembling because he used too much strength.","Ye Jian was very calm. She pulled the buffer forcefully onto the escape rope that was wrapped around Xu Neighbor. With a click, Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief. “Alright, Xu Lin, I’ll ask them to let go of you.”","When the students below saw Ye Jian’s hand signal, they slowly released the escape rope that was wrapped around Xu Lin. Only then did everyone heave a sigh of relief.","He Jing closed her eyes gently before opening them slowly. If it wasn’t for Ye Jian just now... Xu Lin would be lying on the ground now.","“It’s okay, it’s okay...” Xu Wen panted as she spoke. Her legs were so tense that they had gone numb."]},{"number":4112,"title":"Chapter 4112: Even The Results","paragraphs":["Chapter 4112: Even The Results","Editor: Henyee Translations","All the students heaved a sigh of relief. It was too dangerous just now. If their captain, Ye Jian, hadn’t reacted in time and known how to save Xu Lin, he would have been crippled.","Xu Lin, who was still above, was panting heavily. His chest was heaving up and down. It was obvious that he was frightened. His face turned pale, and Ye Jian said, “It’s okay, Xu Lin...” His blood flow started to slowly recover, and the fear on his face faded a lot.","The wind in the mountain was getting colder and colder. Xu Lin couldn’t help but shiver. He swallowed his saliva with difficulty. After his nervousness, his voice was a little hoarse. “Thank you, Captain. It’s all thanks to you just now. If not, I might have died.”","They weren’t wearing helmets. They were just wearing training caps. Once their heads hit the ground, they would die.","Ye Jian saw that he was so frightened that he was trembling when he said ‘thank you’. After thinking for a while, she reached out and patted his shoulder. “Don’t be afraid. It’s normal for accidents to happen during training. Learning from lessons and increasing your experience will help you improve. Next time, you’ll know that you can’t be careless at any time. Even if it’s a sure thing, there will be ‘what ifs’.","“Go down and take a breather. There are two more comrades who have to come down.”","Xu Lin nodded. His arm muscles were still twitching. He took a few deep breaths and felt that he had calmed down a little. He wiped the sweat that was about to reach his eyes.","Ye Jian said to her two comrades above, “Hong Wenlin, Zhu Xuan, be careful when you come down! Everything is fine below.”","The two male students who were waiting above heaved a sigh of relief when they heard that everything was fine. They hurriedly replied to Ye Jian, “Roger, Roger!”","After receiving her comrades’ reply, Ye Jian started to descend. She didn’t descend to the bottom in one breath like before. Xu Lin was frightened, so his speed was quite slow. She was just a little above Xu Lin. If anything happened, she could reach out and grab him immediately.","Song Zhiqiu wiped his eyes that were red from the sweat. He couldn’t care less about the discomfort in his eyes and stared at them without blinking. He was afraid that something would happen again.","When Xu Lin came down, his hands were still trembling. Even the company buffer was unbuckled by the vice-captain, Song Zhiqiu.","“Alright, alright. You’re fine. Take a breather. Take a breather.” Song Zhiqiu, who had unbuckled the buffer for him, could feel that Xu Lin’s muscles were still tense, especially his arms. They were as hard as rocks.","This fellow must’ve been so frightened just now.","While Xu Lin was still recovering, his shoulder had already been punched countless times.","“What were you thinking about up there? You rushed down without buckling it properly. If it wasn’t for our captain, you’d be lying on the ground now!”","“We were so frightened by you that we couldn’t breathe!”","“Did you feel that you were about to die? Hurry up and thank our captain!”","Song Zhiqiu and Ye Jian, who were the first to come down, looked at each other. He said to his comrades who were surrounding Xu Lin and concerned about him, “Help Xu Lin to the side to rest. Let the two people above come down.”","Xu Lin, whose knees were tense, didn’t let his comrades hold him up. It was too embarrassing.","He waved his hands and placed them on his knees. He gritted his teeth and stood up. He took a few steps forward and stood in front of Ye Jian. He saluted her.","“Captain, thank you!” If it weren’t for the captain just now, he wouldn’t be so lucky to be able to stand up and speak.","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows and smiled. “You’re welcome. You’ll definitely be punished when you go back. Thank me after that.”","With such a serious mistake, a punishment would definitely await him after they returned."]},{"number":4113,"title":"Chapter 4113: Silence","paragraphs":["Chapter 4113: Silence","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xu Lin didn’t think that the punishment was terrifying. With a serious expression, he lowered his arm and said, “I do deserve to be punished! I accept all punishments!”","“Yes, go to the side and rest.” Ye Jian nodded slightly and said to the comrades standing behind him, “Help him. Massage his legs and arms. They look very stiff.”","Were they stiff?","When they massaged his limbs, they were as hard as rocks. They were so hard that they didn’t have any elasticity.","None of the students felt that it was inappropriate for Xu Lin to be punished when he went back. The punishment was not just a simple punishment. It was to let Xu Lin remember this mistake and never make the same mistake again.","The two students above started to descend. With Xu Lin’s accident, Song Zhiqiu stared at them as they buckled the buffer. From time to time, he would remind them, “Buckle up the buffer! Don’t be anxious!”","Due to the previous accident, everyone was tense and afraid that something would happen again as they watched their comrades come down.","Ye Jian raised her head and looked at the sky. The sky was still bright, but it wasn’t as cold as before. The wind had stopped, and the trees were quiet. Only they were there.","The weather forecast said that it would start to drizzle in the forest on the 2nd of May. It looked like it was going to rain.","The last two students came down safely. The students who had been raising their necks and staring at them heaved a sigh of relief. Some students told them about the accident that happened to Xu Lin just now. Hong Wenlin and Zhu Xuan, who didn’t know anything, were shocked too.","The other students took off the escape ropes, untied them, and put them away. Hong Wenlin and Zhu Xuan ran to Xu Lin who was still getting his muscles massaged to ask about the situation. They were only relieved when they knew that he was safe.","It was all thanks to Captain Ye Jian. If not, the consequences would’ve been unimaginable.","The escape ropes were untied one by one and put away. The 15 students took a few minutes to adjust and make use of the time to walk toward the village where they would be sleeping tonight.","Due to the need to exert strength in their upper limbs and the nervousness in their hearts, their arms were so sore that it was a little difficult for them to raise them. In the end, everyone helped each other. They had to race against time to reach the village before dark.","The village wasn’t big. If it wasn’t for the high-voltage wire fence on the mountain, the students would have thought that the villagers in the village were living in isolation.","It was already 5:30 pm. If one were standing on the mountain, one would still be able to see daylight. However, now that the students had entered the forest, the sky was already dark and the figures were blurred.","“Each group of five will hold on to the escape rope. We can’t be too far apart!”","The vice-captain, Song Zhiqiu, started to organize the descent. In order to prevent the students from being separated, he took out the escape rope and tied it to the backpacks of the students in front and behind. The three students in the middle used buffers to fasten it. In this way, the five of them were like grasshoppers on a rope. Everyone would follow them down the mountain.","Teamwork like this was something that they would definitely encounter during outdoor survival training. If someone was fast, the others would be fast. If someone was slow, the others would be slow. If a student fell, they would be able to react quickly and stabilize themselves.","The tacit understanding was not formed in a day or two. It was formed through years of accumulation, training, cooperation, hardships, and happiness.","When they reached the foot of the mountain, a heavy rain suddenly came and drenched the students who were caught off guard. Ye Jian was sending their latest location to the command center for the third-year outdoor training when the heavy rain suddenly exploded above her head with a thunderclap. Her heart tightened for some reason."]},{"number":4114,"title":"Chapter 4114: Courage Training","paragraphs":["Chapter 4114: Courage Training","Editor: Henyee Translations","Although the weather forecast had said it would be a light rain, the current rain was not a light rain.","Ye Jian wiped the rainwater off her face and turned to the students behind her. “It’s raining, and the mountain is slippery. Hurry up. Let’s speed up now. Watch your feet.”","“Okay!”","The students who were on the same escape rope as her nodded. Ye Jian led the neighboring team down the mountain.","The two groups of students at the back also started to speed up. They followed the five-person team led by Ye Jian at the front. The group of 15 people braved the rain and went down the mountain.","It was said that it was easy to go up the mountain but difficult to go down. However, this time, there was no mountain path to go up and down the mountain. It was a path that they had to find themselves. It was especially difficult to go down the mountain.","They walked for an hour from the mountainside to the foot of the mountain. At this moment, the sky was completely dark. The rain didn’t decrease. It hit their faces until they felt a faint pain.","“Gather, gather!”","The three groups of five went down the mountain safely. They stood in the heavy rain and untied their escape ropes. Then, they took the time to put them away. When the command was given, the 14 of them formed two rows of seven people. Under Ye Jian’s command, they counted from one to 14.","There were 14 students and Captain Ye Jian. There were 15 of them. They gathered.","Now, they needed to enter the village and sleep.","Xu Wen leaned close to Ye Jian. Swallowing the rainwater, she asked in a low voice, “It’s raining so heavily. Will we have to train our courage tonight?”","Courage training was also a form of outdoor survival training. It mainly tested the courage of the students.","Ye Jian glanced at Xu Wen, who was holding her arm tightly. She said with a faint smile, “Why? Are you so afraid that I’ll have you guys do courage training? Don’t you know that the more afraid you are, the more I’ll test you?”","“No way, Captain Ye. It’s raining so heavily. Did you really arrange for us to do courage training?” Xu Wen’s lips twitched. Damn, if she had known, she wouldn’t have come over to ask!","What a loose mouth!","It was indeed impossible to train their courage in such heavy rain. According to the mission given to her by the school, after entering the village, they would rest in the primary school in the village for the first half of the night. At 11:00 pm, three students would walk around the hill where the cemetery was. It would take about an hour to walk around and back, and it would take exactly five hours for all 15 people to complete the courage training.","This was the field training of the third-year students last year.","It was said that a few male students were so frightened that their knees turned weak and they almost fainted.","Ye Jian had discussed it with the vice-captain, Song Zhiqiu. They had been planning to carry out the same courage training as the third-year students last year. Unfortunately, the weather didn’t favor them. It was hard to make such arrangements in such a heavy rain.","“What will come will come. No matter how afraid you are, you can’t avoid it. Do you understand?” Ye Jian patted Xu Wen’s tightly clenched hands and said calmly, “If you can’t avoid it, why bother worrying?”","Xu Wen’s lips moved. Then, she laid on Ye Jian’s body and started acting coquettishly.","Unfortunately, she was doing this to the wrong person.","Who was Ye Jian?","She was Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s soldier. He was a man who would even deal with his girlfriend when she made mistakes during training. No matter how coquettish Xu Wen was, it was useless in front of Ye Jian.","She was unmoved."]},{"number":4115,"title":"Chapter 4115: Scared Off","paragraphs":["Chapter 4115: Scared Off","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was definitely impossible to go to the villagers’ houses. They were not allowed to disturb the villagers during outdoor survival training. Sleeping at the villagers’ houses would be disturbing the villagers.","Ye Jian’s fingers, which were so wet from the rain, became wrinkled as she drew on the map. She decided to stay at the elementary school that was about five kilometers away.","There were a total of three villages in this mountainous area. The children in the villages all studied at Wang Jia’ao Hope Primary School. The village they were in now was called Liu Jia’ao. Hence, the villagers here had the surname Liu. The villagers in Wang Jia’ao had the surname Wang.","When Xu Wen heard that they were going to the elementary school tonight, she was very happy even though her legs were sore and swollen.","In that case, there was no need for courage training!","After passing through a few village houses with white limestone peeling off and exposed mud bricks, Xu Wen, who came from the capital city, couldn’t help but take a few more glances at the mud brick houses. They were commonly seen in the villages in the early 1990s.","While looking at the dim tungsten lamps, a bolt of lightning flashed in the dark rain. Under the pale lightning, Xu Wen saw the appearance of the entire place and trembled. She didn’t dare to look anymore.","The greenish-black tiles and the mottled limestone walls revealed large amounts of mud bricks. There were even a few cracks on the main wall that rats could enter. It didn’t look like there were villagers living here. It was terrifying.","Ye Jian was very familiar with mud-brick houses like this. Her hometown in Shuikou Village still relied on mud bricks to build houses. However, Uncle Chen later painted their house with white paint and polished the floor with colored stones. It was much brighter than the mud-brick houses Xu Wen saw.","This was the first time Xu Wen saw houses like this. She patted her chest lightly. She really didn’t know that such houses existed. The main wall was cracked. Wasn’t this a dangerous house?","Why were people still living here?","Holding her flashlight, Xu Wen walked with her head lowered. She didn’t dare to look around anymore.","Strangers had come to the village, which alarmed the dogs raised by the villagers. The barking of dogs could be heard in the heavy rain, adding to the desolation of the rainy night. A few barking sounds came from afar.","Ye Jian, who was walking along the muddy path in the village, raised her head and saw two small green dots that looked like an animal’s eyes. She swept her flashlight over and saw a yellow and black dog in their way. As the flashlight shone, the dog clamped its tail and barked loudly at the strangers who had barged into the village.","Ye Jian bent down and picked up a rock by the roadside. She threw it at the dog and shouted, “Go!” The dog, which was barking fiercely a second ago, wilted instantly and ran away with its tail between its legs.","Dogs were famous for their sharp noses. Ye Jian’s actions of throwing a rock at it made the dog feel that there was a murderous aura on Ye Jian, who had walked out of the battlefield. Dogs and babies could feel it the most.","Hence, Ye Jian never carried babies. She was afraid of scaring them.","Principal Chen had reminded her before, and so had Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan had never hugged the twins Xia Yiwei gave birth to.","The students at the back didn’t notice anything. The dogs in the village were making a bit of a fuss. A few villagers opened their doors and shone flashlights around their houses. They didn’t see anything, so they returned to their houses.","The mountain roads were much more difficult to walk on than the flat roads in the city. Every day, the students of Liu Jia’ao would follow the path that Ye Jian and the rest had taken to reach the school.","It was common knowledge that it was difficult for children in the mountains to go to school."]},{"number":4116,"title":"Chapter 4116: Soldier","paragraphs":["Chapter 4116: Soldier","Editor: Henyee Translations","When they arrived at the school, the students’ military boots were filled with rainwater. With every step they took, they could hear the sound of water sploshing about. The flashlight swept across the most imposing four-story elementary school in the village. It had red bricks and white walls. Xu Wen whispered to Ye Jian, “It’s the best building in the village.”","It was indeed the best building.","After passing through two villages, they saw mud-brick houses from the 1970s and 1980s or red brick houses. There was no paint on the outside. They were very simple red brick buildings. This was a huge visual impact for the students from the big cities.","Just like Xu Wen.","If not for this outdoor training in the forest, she wouldn’t have known that there were mud-brick houses in this era. The mud-brick houses she had seen before were only recorded in videos.","Now, they were in the forest area named by the founder of China. The 45 students in the class were divided into three groups for three days and two nights of outdoor training. Ye Jian was leading one of the three groups for outdoor survival training. The other two groups would complete their outdoor survival training separately.","Tonight was the second night of outdoor survival training. Ye Jian’s group’s accommodation was much better than the other two large groups.","The other two teams had to brave the heavy rain and temporarily build awnings to make do for the night.","Ye Jian and the rest walked into Wang Jia’ao’s Hope Primary School, which was built two years ago. It was built from the donations of the philanthropists from Harbor City. It was four stories high, and the classes ranged from grade one to grade six.","“This is the classroom for grade one. Do you need one or two rooms?” The person who brought the students in was an old man who was guarding the school in Wang Jia’ao Village. He was in his early 60s and had white hair at his temples. His forehead was deeply wrinkled, but his steps were very agile. The old man turned on the two tungsten wire lamps in the classroom and said in a bright voice, “There are many classrooms. You soldiers can sleep wherever you want.”","As the old man spoke, he sized up the soldiers who suddenly appeared in school curiously. He didn’t know who these soldiers were. One moment, they said that they were students, and the next moment, they said that they were soldiers. They were already soldiers, so why were they still students?","The classrooms in the elementary school weren’t very big, but one was enough for 15 students to sleep in. Song Zhiqiu smiled and said, “Mister, we’ll just stay in one classroom. We’ll move the desks to the side first. When we leave tomorrow morning, we’ll move them back to the same place. I guarantee that we won’t destroy the tables or chairs. Don’t worry.”","“I’m not worried at all. You’re soldiers, so I’m at ease.”","The old man laughed as he spoke. When he saw that none of the young soldiers were dry and their footprints were wet, his heart ached. “Why did you come over in the heavy rain? I didn’t know that there was a military unit on our mountain.","“Rest for a while. I’ll bring two pots of hot water over. Have you not had dinner? I’ll go to the cafeteria to light a fire and cook for you!”","When the students heard that, they all said that they had eaten and were full. After all, they couldn’t trouble the villagers.","Song Zhiqiu thanked the old man again and again before the old man left skeptically.","“Eat? What did you eat? Are you full from the rain? Did you eat tree bark? Leaves?” The old man was still talking to himself when he left the classroom.","The students outside the corridor heard this and looked at each other in confusion.","The moment they entered, they asked their comrades, “The mister said that we ate tree bark and leaves. What did you say just now?”","“Eating tree bark and leaves? We didn’t say anything.”","“Does the mister think we’re doing a long march?”"]},{"number":4117,"title":"Chapter 4117: Scared","paragraphs":["Chapter 4117: Scared","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian didn’t know whether to laugh or cry when she heard her classmates’ conversation. “The mister heard that we were full and made a casual joke, but you took it seriously. Move the desks and chairs to the side. Just now, I saw that the classroom is a little dirty. After we change out of our clothes, let’s clean it up.","“Xu Wen, He Jing, go to the classroom next door and see if it’s locked. If it’s not, let’s clean the classrooms tonight.”","“Yes!”","“Yes!”","Hearing that, the two of them immediately turned around and went to the classroom next door to check.","From the first floor to the fourth floor, everything was locked. In that case, they would just sweep the corridor.","The three female students first turned on the lights in the classroom and changed their clothes. Then, when the male students came in to change their clothes, Ye Jian, Xu Wen, and He Jing started cleaning the stairs from the first to the third floor.","After a few minutes, the male students walked out and started cleaning the corridor from the fourth floor to the first floor.","There was strength in numbers. After a while, the corridors and stairs on the fourth floor were all cleaned up. They were just short of mopping the floors.","It was the same in the classroom. Even the spiderwebs in the corner of the ceiling had been swept away. The shoe prints on the wall that were left by the children were also wiped with a wet towel until there were only faint marks.","After cleaning up, the students sat on the chairs and finished their dinner.","Everyone had two compressed biscuits and the mountain stream water in their bottles as their dinner.","At ten o’clock, the students went to bed. Ye Jian and Song Zhiqiu stood outside and discussed how to carry out the courage training.","“It’s raining heavily now. I went to take a look over there just now...” Ye Jian pointed in the direction where they came from. “There’s a tea garden over there. I’ll go over with you and place a few items there. Later, we’ll split into two groups. We’ll go to the tea garden to complete our patrol and look for things. Then, we’ll pick two catties of old tea leaves. What do you think?”","“It’s just a tea garden? Nothing else?” Song Zhiqiu didn’t believe that Ye Jian would only use this simple trick to test their courage. He smiled and asked, “There are other tricks, right?”","Ye Jian smiled. “Didn’t you notice it when we came over just now? There’s a small hill beside the tea garden. They have to pass through that small hill to get to the tea garden. I saw many tombstones.”","That meant that there was no way to avoid what Xu Wen was afraid of.","Song Zhiqiu rubbed his arms in panic. “Can I say that I’m a little afraid too?”","“Hahaha, even I’m not afraid. What are you afraid of? We can just take out the waterproof clothes and let them wear them. Then, they can go over directly.” Ye Jian laughed softly. One could tell that she wasn’t afraid at all.","Song Zhiqiu couldn’t help but laugh. After a while, he asked, “Is there anything you’re afraid of?”","“Of course, there are things I’m afraid of.” Ye Jian turned around and returned to the classroom. She paused in her footsteps and replied, “Everyone is afraid of things. However, there’s nothing to be afraid of when walking at night.”","She had things she was afraid of, such as... her comrades sacrificing themselves and the man she loved the most getting hurt. These were the things she was most afraid of, but she had to face them.","“Then you can walk in front later. I’ll walk behind.” The vice-captain, Song Zhiqiu, could only follow. It couldn’t be helped. It was raining heavily, but they needed to carry out courage training. Doing it when it was raining made it even scarier.","This was the courage training tonight. In Ye Jian’s words, “There’s rain tonight. There’s no need to ask for too much.”"]},{"number":4118,"title":"Chapter 4118: Classmate","paragraphs":["Chapter 4118: Classmate","Editor: Henyee Translations","Venturing up the mountain in heavy rain and darkness with each step as a test, especially having to pick two pounds of old tea leaves to bring back, was simply a torment and interrogation of the body and mind.","Ye Jian, who had slept less than an hour, looked at her waterproof watch as the first batch of trainees stepped out of the classroom, and she had already started timing.","With two hours allocated, the trainees were to complete patrolling, searching, and picking tea leaves as part of their courage training.","Vice-Captain Song Zhiqiu hadn’t slept either, following Ye Jian back from the mountain. Something unidentified emerging from the graves they passed had startled him. Returning to the classroom, his soul still shaken, he felt no inclination to sleep.","Now, as the first batch of trainees departed, his worry grew, and sleep was even further from his mind.","“These are just the most basic courage training exercises. The seniors who came before us were a bit luckier, they didn’t encounter rainy days, but they camped overnight around the graveyard. Although we have rain, at least we can stay in the classroom.”","“Once you overcome the psychological barrier, there’s really nothing to it.”","Ye Jian saw Song Zhiqiu occasionally glance at his watch and look outside, appearing much like a worried father watching his child venture out.","Having undergone intense psychological challenges, Ye Jian didn’t find tonight’s courage training difficult. The main challenge was to overcome her fear of the dark and graveyards, defeat the psychological suggestions born from terror, and treat the night as if it were day—which then made it all seem unimportant.","Song Zhiqiu, recalling how she had confidently walked the mountain path as if it were a broad avenue, each step steady and her breath unchanged, couldn’t help but ask, “I can’t understand how you aren’t afraid. Humans have an innate fear of darkness, yet it seems ineffective against you. Why?”","After thinking for a moment, Ye Jian replied, “It’s because I’m not influenced by you all. Carl Jung’s concept of the ‘collective subconscious’ explains well why fear arises. When one or several people in a group become frightened by the dark, imagining a wind-swept graveyard filled with ominous shadows...these perceptions breed fear and can influence others around them to feel afraid as well.”","“I specifically assigned Xu Wen to this group because there are three trainees who slept soundly through last night without fear of the dark. I wanted their courage to help Xu Wen overcome her fear.”","“Of course, it’s also possible that Xu Wen could end up scaring them instead—for example, if a little creature suddenly rushes out, Xu Wen gets a fright, and her comrades, already tense, might also get startled.”","“As for me, by stepping outside the framework of the ‘collective subconscious’ and focusing on my own tasks, and by thinking about things scarier than walking at night, I hardly feel any fear.”","“Simply put, it comes down to a lack of courage training. When I return, I plan to suggest to the academy the establishment of a psychological education training group linked with combat research. Regular training sessions could include courage and behavioral psychology training, which I think would be greatly beneficial for the trainees.”","As captain, Ye Jian was not only responsible for arranging the trainees’ activities, but she also had to note down every performance during their wilderness survival training—individual strengths and weaknesses, team challenges that needed to be overcome, areas for improvement—all of which she needed to remember, understand, and detail in reports to submit to the academy."]},{"number":4119,"title":"Chapter 4119: Amazing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4119: Amazing","Editor: Henyee Translations","What Ye Jian said had already touched on the flaws in the command core. It was to find effective ways and means to carry out the command correctly. Just from this outdoor survival training, she had thought of a solution. This required not only experience but also sharp observation.","Song Zhiqiu fell silent because of Ye Jian’s words. After a while, he said, “We’ve been classmates for three years, but you’ve left us too far behind. For instance, now, I’m only thinking about how to let the students complete the mission you set. I don’t want anything else to happen.","“As for you, you’ve already thought of an effective way and solution regarding the command system. Ye Jian, you’ve become the core figure of our class, of the school, and even the entire National Science University. You really didn’t rely on luck. You relied entirely on yourself.","“Strategy, military, tactical... Are you already involved in them?” If not, how could you think of a solution immediately after looking at the situation?","Ye Jian was stunned. She didn’t expect Song Zhiqiu to be so sharp. That made sense. Song Zhiqiu had always been at the top of the class. His intelligence, physical fitness, discipline, comprehension, and other aspects were all outstanding. If he said that, he should have gone to the systematic auditorium and learned on his own like her.","Ye Jian nodded slightly. She didn’t deny it. She smiled and said, “At the start of my first year, someone told me that if I had extra time, I could go and understand strategy. In the first half of the first year, I started exposing myself to it and started understanding it. As long as I had time, I would study it. At night, I’d take an hour to learn on my own. Now, I’m studying tactics.","“I plan to understand more about tactics in my fourth year. After I enter the military unit, I can start learning more systematically from strategy. Now, I’m just exposing myself to these things. I don’t have any specializations.”","...","From the start of her first year, she planned to understand strategy, battle studies, and tactics. However, she still thought that she only understood a little. Well... Even if she only understood a little, it was already impressive!","Song Zhiqiu sized up Ye Jian from the corner of his eyes. He saw that her facial expression was so calm that it seemed like she was only talking about the most ordinary thing. Song Zhiqiu, who had fallen silent, held his forehead and sighed with a gentle smile. “Hard work can be rewarded. I’ve seen the best example in you.","“Ye Jian, your goal is really strong. Technically speaking, most women are emotional. They’re easily influenced by their personal emotions.","“As for you, I don’t see any emotions in you. You’re ten thousand times more rational than a boy.","“It’s not easy to take down these three subjects. We usually have our own professional classes, training, and so on. But you persevere and take an hour to study every day. Ye Jian, only you’re able to do such a thing in the entire class.”","Strategy was the study of the overall guiding laws of military struggle. It occupied a primary position in military academics and could directly affect operational science and tactics.","Campaign science was a discipline that studied the laws of battle and guided the practice of battle. It occupied the middle position between strategic science and tactical science.","For instance, the most famous ‘Sun Tzu’s Soldier Technique’ contained many rules used in battles.","The country’s military school was formed and developed during the long-term revolutionary wars. Since Ye Jian understood battle science, it meant that she had basically understood all the large and small battles that happened in the country’s recent history."]},{"number":4120,"title":"Chapter 4120: Looking Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 4120: Looking Up","Editor: Henyee Translations","As for tactical science, it was based on combat practice and theory. The content of our soldiers’ tactical science was mainly reflected in the combat rules, regulations, and teaching orders.","They were all rich theoretical content.","Ye Jian had already exceeded the requirements. No wonder... No wonder Ye Jian could never be found in school. Even when she was found, she was never idle. She was always doing all sorts of things.","She really treated the four years in the military school as a huge platform to absorb military knowledge. She didn’t want to waste a second. It was as if she had double the time of an average person.","However, Ye Jian didn’t think that she was impressive. She had too many outstanding talents around her.","For instance, the man she loved deeply, Xia Jinyuan; her elder cousin, Demon King Li, who carried the burden and established the first amphibious team in the country; and the diplomat, Qin Xiu, who stood alone and fought with the ministers.","There was also her grandpa, who was part of the older generation of aerospace scientists. For the sake of an experiment, he could lose contact with the outside world and his family for years.","Her father was the same. He was as loyal to the country as her grandpa. She knew what he and her grandpa talked about sometimes, but she didn’t understand what it meant.","There was also Uncle Chen, the world-class King of Sniper Rifles, and Grandpa Gen, a Class A Master Sergeant who still fought at work even at 70.","There were too many outstanding elders and peers around her. Sometimes, if she was just a little lazy, she would feel that it was a sin. She would feel that she had wasted her time.","The best way to live was to chase after the outstanding people around her and motivate her to enrich herself.","She was reborn and granted a second life. Hence, no matter what, she could not let go of this second chance.","Even if you were tired, you were still alive. You wouldn’t close your eyes and sleep forever in the cold, dark, and humid ground.","In her previous life, Ye Jian had completely disappeared. The current Ye Jian was a brand new person. She needed to constantly enrich herself and make up for all the disappointment she had in the past.","After thinking for a moment, she smiled and said, “It’s not difficult to persevere. The main point is how far you want to go.","“The reason why I persevere is because I want to be more useful. I want to be able to stand up for myself and protect my comrades at critical moments.","“The idea is very simple. Learn and apply it. Protect yourself and protect the people you care about the most.”","Ye Jian didn’t have much ambition. She never thought about what position she wanted to achieve and what kind of person she wanted to become even after learning so much.","Song Zhiqiu said, “How can I let you guard this place alone? Let’s do it together. You don’t mind us chatting, right? I really want to chat with you. I can learn a lot from you.”"]},{"number":4121,"title":"Chapter 4121: A Soldier","paragraphs":["Chapter 4121: A Soldier","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian laughed. “I don’t mind. Just don’t mind me if I talk too much.”","“What are you talking about? You don’t know that many students want to talk to you and learn from you.” Song Zhiqiu smiled too. He wasn’t flattering her. One could indeed learn a lot by chatting with Ye Jian.","That was because she was standing at a height that they had yet to reach. She could guide them and let them learn from her experience so that they could reach a higher height faster.","In the next two hours, Song Zhiqiu chatted with Ye Jian. He talked about her studies, military discussions, and her personal opinions on the future development of the military.","Many years later, when Song Zhiqiu saw Ye Jian appearing on the news broadcast, he could still remember what he and Ye Jian talked about that rainy night.","Two hours seemed to pass by very quickly. Ye Jian saw a row of flashlights appearing at the school gate. She saw the students who were returning in formation in the wind and rain.","This was the first time that the students didn’t even have a company instructor. They participated in the entire outdoor survival training, and the weather was so bad. When Song Zhiqiu saw them coming back, he wanted to get up and welcome them but was stopped by Ye Jian’s cold voice. “There’s no need to go over. They’re soldiers, not children.”","She retracted her raised leg and stood in the corridor on the first floor, waiting for the six people to come over.","The group of six people had already seen two figures standing in the corridor. Their military boots stepped on the rainwater-covered ground, and they quickened their pace.","“Line up!”","“Attention!”","“At ease!”","“Count!”","...","“Two catties of tea leaves, escape rope, and patrol trajectory... Report, our team has completed the courage training. Please give your instructions!”","Liu Yang, who was in charge of leading the team, stood in the rain and reported to Ye Jian and Song Zhiqiu, who had been waiting for their return.","Ye Jian walked from the corridor into the heavy rain. Her military boots stepped on a puddle of water. The mud slightly splattered. She, who was dry, was drenched in the rain like the returning students.","Ye Jian walked by the six of them and saw the old tea leaves in their hands. She randomly picked a student and grabbed the old tea leaves he picked.","Not bad. They were all leaves. There was not a single tea stem. It could be seen that he was very calm when he plucked them.","Just think about it. The small hill beside them was a cemetery. It was raining at night, and everyone was picking tea leaves at a distance of five meters. The fear brought about by the environment was already deep enough. They even had to pick two catties of old tea leaves. This kind of courage training was definitely difficult without a certain amount of courage.","In the end, Ye Jian walked in front of Xu Wen and stopped in her tracks. She asked Xu Wen to turn on the flashlight in her hand and shine it on her face. Her face had been drenched by the rain for a long time, so her skin was a little pale. However, she didn’t look pitiful. All Ye Jian could see was Xu Wen’s tenacity against the wind and rain.","Especially when she pursed her lips. Ye Jian felt at ease.","“Not bad, well done,” Ye Jian said softly as she put down the tea leaves picked by Xu Wen.","The woman from the capital city didn’t cry no matter how frightened she was just now. However, when she heard Ye Jian’s words, her eyes turned red.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile when she saw this. She reached out and hugged Xu Wen’s shoulder. She smiled and said, “You’re still like a child. Your eyes turned red after a compliment. But it’s not embarrassing at all. Alright, alright, calm down. I just said that you’re brave, but you’re letting me eat my own words now.”","Xu Wen was stubborn. She lowered her voice and replied, “I’m not crying. I’m just excited.”","Just as Ye Jian was about to praise her, she saw a few swaying flashlights coming from outside the school gate. Then, the people shouted loudly in the rain. No one understood what they said."]},{"number":4122,"title":"Chapter 4122: Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 4122: Danger","Editor: Henyee Translations","The people who spoke were all villagers from Wang Jia’ao. Their voices were loud and anxious. Almost everyone was shouting. No matter how loud the rain was, it couldn’t cover up their voices.","Song Zhiqiu glanced at the school gate and said to Ye Jian, “I’ll go over and take a look. Something seems to have happened.”","“Okay.” Ye Jian let go of Xu Wen and watched as Song Zhiqiu stepped into the rain. She retracted her gaze and whispered to Xu Wen, “Go back to the classroom and have a good rest. There’s still one more day tomorrow.”","Without waiting for Xu Wen’s reply, Ye Jian took a step back. Her clear voice penetrated the rain curtain and entered the ears of the six students. “Dismissed! Go rest!”","The two hours of courage training had a huge impact on the six students. They conquered themselves and defeated their fear. When they heard Ye Jian’s words, the six of them relaxed.","Today, they were exhausted. During the day, they had to go down a suspended escape rope. At night, they even went to train their courage in the heavy rain. Previously, they guessed that Ye Jian would hide the escape rope in the place they were most afraid of. Fortunately, she didn’t. She hid it under a tea tree. Even so, they held hands for half an hour without letting go.","Later on, when they looked at the time, they really had no choice but to separate.","Now, they had finally survived!","The second batch of students who came in to train their courage applauded. He Jing even gave Xu Wen a big hug. She always liked to hit Xu Wen, but now, she was hugging Xu Wen tightly. There was obvious excitement in her voice. “Impressive, Wen! From tonight onward, I have a whole new level of respect for you!”","Xu Wen, who had always been able to do whatever she wanted, immediately became proud when she heard that. “Of course. Who am I? I’m not afraid of anything. There’s no difficulty I can’t overcome!","“It’s a small matter to get drenched in the rain at night!”","He Jing was speechless. She took a deep breath and resisted the urge to strangle Xu Wen. She quickly retracted her hands that were hugging her.","She was afraid that if she continued to hug Xu Wen, she wouldn’t be able to control herself and would strangle Xu Wen’s neck.","Ye Jian stood at the door of the classroom and saw the joy on the faces of the students who had completed their courage training. They didn’t look too frightened. The smile on her face deepened.","She raised her hand and knocked on the wooden door that was painted with dark green paint. After three knocks, the noisy classroom immediately fell silent. The seven students who had not completed their courage training stood in front and waited for Ye Jian’s order.","Song Zhiqiu, who had understood the situation, ran over with the waterproof clothes. He stepped over the gutter of the teaching building and arrived in front of Ye Jian in two steps.","The sound of running footsteps came hurriedly in the rain. Ye Jian had already turned around to look at Song Zhiqiu. “What happened?”","“The houses of two families collapsed, and they’re buried inside. There’s also an old man in one of the villages who was worried that the rain would collapse the pond. He went out with an umbrella and hasn’t returned. The village official is asking for our help. He wants us to save the villagers buried in the ruins and search for the old man.","“I just took a look. There’s no one in their prime. The village official said that the young people in the village are all working outside. Those in the village are children and elders.”","Song Zhiqiu finished speaking in one breath. He wiped the rainwater off his face and asked Ye Jian in a low voice, “The village official knows that we’re here and wants us to help. What do you think? They’re still waiting for our reply outside.”","What did she think? There was no need to think. They had to help."]},{"number":4123,"title":"Chapter 4123: Sudden Disaster","paragraphs":["Chapter 4123: Sudden Disaster","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian said in a low voice, “We have to go over. We’re not familiar with the old man, so we don’t know where he went. Let the villagers look for him. We’ll save the villagers buried under the collapsed house.”","Soon, the village official waiting outside saw more than ten soldiers with flashlights appear. At that moment, he heaved a sigh of relief. He knew that the villagers buried under the house were saved.","The older generation had always said that the most reliable people were soldiers!","He believed in the ten soldiers in front of him now!","“The first household has four people—two grandparents and two children. The eldest child is in the fourth grade while the youngest child is only in the first grade. The second household has five people in the second household—two grandparents and two grandchildren. One child is four years old and one is two. The fifth person is an elderly who’s 80-year-old.","“A disaster came out of nowhere. All of a sudden, the houses collapsed! Everyone is buried inside. I wonder if they’re still alive!”","The village official was so anxious that he couldn’t speak properly. They were all acquaintances. During the day, they even greeted each other. In the end, when the houses collapsed at night, everyone was buried!","There was still a distance between the two households. Ye Jian immediately divided the 15 people into groups. She led eight people and Song Zhiqiu led seven people to the two families whose houses had collapsed.","It was raining heavily, and the mud brick houses had suddenly collapsed. In the past, similar things had happened in Shuikou Village, and it wasn’t just once or twice.","“First, you have to ensure your own safety. Leave two people to observe the surroundings. If you see signs of a second collapse, retreat immediately! Don’t force yourself!","“When you reach the destination, you have to confirm the exact location of the villagers. For instance, the villagers are already asleep at this time of the night. The location they’re buried in is most likely in the bedroom. First, search the bedrooms. Pay attention to the beams of the house. The beams of old houses are all built from fir trees in the mountains. They’re quite heavy. You have to be careful of the beams.”","There was no time to gather and remind them. Ye Jian ran as she reminded the students around her. The villagers needed to be rescued, but their safety was also important!","When Song Zhiqiu left with his team, he said to Ye Jian seriously, “You need to be careful. Don’t put yourself in danger. Nothing must happen to you!”","“Nothing must happen to any of us. No one. Vice-Captain, I’ll leave the safety of the students to you.”","Ye Jian didn’t expect to encounter such a dangerous emergency during the outdoor survival training. She couldn’t help but feel worried. However, the students were not useless. After all, they were trained in the military school. In the future, they would all become primary level military officers in the military unit. They all had their own capabilities. She felt more at ease thinking this.","They parted ways on a narrow path. Ye Jian brought her group of students and continued walking up. Song Zhiqiu brought his group of students to their destination.","The village official could tell who was the leader now. He panted as he led the way and said to Ye Jian, “This family is pitiful. Their daughter-in-law thought that the family was poor, so she ran away after giving birth to the second child. The son went out to look for her, but he never came back even though the son is already in the first grade.","“The old couple has to raise their two grandchildren now. They don’t have much to eat and wear. If Harbour City hadn’t sponsored the two children to go to school, their family would have had a harder time.","But now, she wasn’t concerned about how difficult life was for that family. Ye Jian asked calmly, “Did the villagers hear anything? Did they call out to the family? Did they respond?”"]},{"number":4124,"title":"Chapter 4124: Empty Step","paragraphs":["Chapter 4124: Empty Step","Editor: Henyee Translations","“The house is in such a state. The neighbors are already in their 50s. Even if they were close by, they would’ve come and looked for me immediately,” the village official said anxiously. He was extremely flustered. “Nothing must happen. Nothing must happen.”","Ye Jian’s heart sank.","That meant that they didn’t know if the four people buried in the house were dead or alive.","She reminded the village official, “Please run faster. The faster we go, the sooner we can save them. If we delay for a minute, the villagers buried below will be in danger for another minute.”","“Okay, okay, okay. I’ll run faster. The roads in the mountains are not easy to walk on. Be careful of your feet.”","They took a shortcut. They were all walking on the farmland. The farmland was uneven, and it was raining heavily. If they were not careful, they would fall from the farmland into the paddy field below. Ye Jian looked at the farmland under her feet and said to Xu Wen, “Be careful. Don’t miss a step.”","“I know, I know. Don’t worry about me. Saving people is more important.”","At this moment, Xu Wen couldn’t care less about herself. When she thought of the two elders and the two children whose fates were unknown, she wished that she could grow two pairs of wings and fly over.","Even though they were careful, given their speed, a male student slipped and fell from the high farmland to the paddy field below.","Fortunately, it was a paddy field. The soft mud protected the student. The student only fell into the mud, and his ankle muscle was tugged. It didn’t affect his ability to walk normally.","They arrived at their destination safely. A few villagers stood around them. When they saw that the village official had brought soldiers, they surrounded them.","“Soldiers, you came at the right time. Hurry up and save the old couple. They’ve been buried. We shouted for a long time, but there was no response.”","“The house has collapsed. We don’t dare to approach it. We’re afraid that if we step on it, we won’t be able to save the people underneath and these bricks will collapse further.”","“Soldiers, you make the arrangements. How do you think we should help? We’ll listen to you! We have to save them. There are still two children. Nothing must happen to the children.”","“We just took a look. Two bed frames have been buried by bricks. I wonder if anyone was lying on them.”","The villagers around ye Jian spoke one after another. Ye Jian shone her flashlight, and her heart turned cold.","Besides the left wall of the living room, the entire house—from the kitchen to the living room to the bedroom—had collapsed!","Even the shack that the family used to feed their livestock had collapsed. They could hear the cries of pigs below.","Pig squeals!","If those pigs could live, the humans could too!","Ye Jian gathered her thoughts and gave a few instructions. Then, she started rescuing the villagers. “The pigs are still alive, so the people must still be alive too. If they didn’t make a sound, they probably fainted from fright. If I need the villagers’ help, I’ll definitely ask for it. We have to go over and confirm it now. Please be quiet. I’m afraid that I won’t be able to hear the voices below.”","“Okay, okay, okay. We won’t talk. We won’t talk.”","The anxious villagers seemed to have gained a pillar of support now. Especially when Ye Jian said that the pigs were still alive, they really started to believe that the people buried were still alive as well. t","According to the village official, the two elders slept in two bedrooms with the two children. One was on the left side of the living room while the other was on the right side. Under the nervous gazes of the students, Ye Jian and Liu Yang slowly stepped toward the cave-in of the bedroom on the right."]},{"number":4125,"title":"Chapter 4125: Alive","paragraphs":["Chapter 4125: Alive","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian carefully walked past a few beams. She used her flashlight to scan the area. She first scanned the area where the wooden bed frame was. She couldn’t see the bed anymore. She only saw two pieces of wood that looked like bed frames.","Ye Jian pursed her lips. If they were really sleeping on the bed, the odds were against them.","The flashlight shone around and swept across a black hole that was left empty by the beams and mud bricks. Ye Jian slowly approached and shone the flashlight at the black hole. She shouted, “Is there anyone below? Anyone there? Answer me if you hear me. Answer me if you hear me!","Liu Yang also shone his flashlight down and shouted, “Anyone there? Answer me if you hear me. Do you hear me? Answer me if you hear me.”","They all held their breaths and waited for someone to respond.","After waiting for a while, Ye Jian pursed her lips tightly.","Liu Yang shouted again, afraid that the people there couldn’t hear him. His voice sounded like it was being torn apart. Finally, he heard a very faint sound from below. It sounded like something was knocking on the ground.","Liu Yang heard the sound and laid down carefully. He seemed to have heard the sound just now!","“Is there someone there? Is someone knocking on something?”","Liu Yang, who heard the sound again, raised his head and shouted excitedly at Ye Jian, “Captain, Captain, over here! There’s a sound over here! I heard it, I heard it!”","Someone was there!","This was great!","This was great!","The villagers who were waiting in the rain were overjoyed. They shouted at Liu Yang, “That’s the room where the eldest child and the grandfather sleeps. It must be the eldest child and the grandfather!”","What about the second child and the grandmother?","Ye Jian shouted again. She didn’t hear anything. She could only try her best to save the eldest child and the grandfather in the bedroom on the left.","They needed to move the mud bricks away one by one. Then, they needed to carefully move the broken beams away. They couldn’t move them casually. They needed to be very careful.","The rain was falling. From time to time, thunder and lightning would flash across the pitch-black sky. The villagers who were moving mud bricks saw their most trusted soldiers moving and digging with their bare hands. Their faces... looked younger than their children and grandchildren.","Although they looked younger, they made the villagers feel at ease.","Or rather, it was the military uniform on them that made them feel at ease.","Time passed slowly. More and more mud bricks were moved out. They were getting closer and closer to the place where Liu Yang heard the knocking.","Ye Jian moved the two beams at the top and the broken mud bricks away. She saw a collapsed cabinet. The cabinet hadn’t completely fallen to the ground. There was an empty space between it and the ground. When the flashlight shone over, she saw a child’s shoe and... a small hand.","At that moment, something seemed to have exploded in Ye Jian. She turned her head and shouted sternly, “Hurry! Move the bricks! Move the bricks!”","That small hand was a child’s hand. The child was sandwiched under the cabinet!","There was an old-fashioned cabinet in the bedroom that was used to store all kinds of dry goods. Previously, they didn’t notice it because it was enveloped by the collapsed beam. As the beam was lifted and moved away and the mud bricks on it were moved away as well, a few low groans of pain entered their ears.","It wasn’t the voice of one person. It was the voice of the old couple!","“Lift the beams! Slow down! Slow down!”","“Give me the escape rope! Tie it to the largest beam and pull it tight. Don’t let it collapse a second time!”","Two hours into the rescue mission, the grandmother was carried out. The old woman’s head was covered in blood. The rainwater drenched her face.","“The children are in the cabinets... The children are in... the cabinets. Save my family... My family... The children, there are two of them.”","She almost used all her strength to finish her sentence.","Ye Jian held the old woman’s hand and said in a low voice, “Don’t worry, we’ll definitely save the children. Don’t worry!”"]},{"number":4126,"title":"Chapter 4126: Rain","paragraphs":["Chapter 4126: Rain","Editor: Henyee Translations","The entire rescue process affected the emotions of everyone present. The villagers saw soldiers who looked even younger than their children and grandchildren carrying heavy mud bricks with their bare hands. They saw them using their shoulders to carry the fallen beams. Their faces were covered in mud. The rain couldn’t wash their faces clean.","“Pull! One, two, three... Pull!”","“Dig up all the mud bricks at the top! Bring a piece of waterproof cloth over to shelter the children from the rain!”","“The two of you, move the mud bricks on the cabinet! The two of you, pick them up below! Villagers, thank you for helping us move the mud bricks away!”","The clear voice of the female soldier, who had been standing at the top and moving the mud bricks, penetrated the rain curtain. Every word floated into everyone’s ears clearly. She was very calm and didn’t panic at all. She was the only one commanding the entire event location. Everyone listened to her command. No one would make decisions on their own.","At this moment, the village official was cooperating with Ye Jian outside. He took the mud bricks from above and threw them to the side. Everyone was working hard to save the two children.","The grandmother, who was rescued, was carried by a student and a villager. They shone their flashlights on the road and walked quickly toward a neighbor’s house.","The old woman, who was bleeding profusely, kept talking about her two grandsons. One moment, she was talking about her eldest grandson. The next moment, she was talking about her younger grandson. The low cries of pain made the students carrying her cry.","“Don’t worry. We’re here. With us around, we’ll definitely save the two children. Don’t worry.” The student comforted her in a calm voice. He was afraid that the old woman wouldn’t understand, so he enunciated the words very slowly.","Holding an umbrella and a flashlight, the villager said, “That’s right, that’s right. Don’t worry. The two children are lucky enough to meet these soldiers. Don’t worry, we’ll definitely be able to save them.”","The old woman didn’t know how to speak Mandarin. Her accent was heavy as she spoke intermittently. The student who was carrying her could vaguely hear her say ‘thank you’.","When the grandmother was placed in the neighbor’s house, Ye Jian had already jumped into the pit. She was already holding the small hand that was exposed outside the cabinet. Her fingers pressed on the thin wrist, and the pulse seemed to penetrate her body. p","The child was fine!","The child was fine!","Now, they needed to lift the collapsed cabinet. Besides Xu Wen, who was standing at the periphery and staring at the broken wall, the five students were all standing on the mud bricks. They sped up and moved the mud bricks around the cabinet away.","No one spoke. They could only bury their heads in their task. They were all focused on the small hand under the cabinet. The grandmother had said that the two children were hiding in the cabinets. It just depended on which cabinet it was.","Finally, the mud bricks around the cabinet were moved away. Then, they used their bare hands to dig away the pieces of mud that were formed by the rainwater. It was finally time to lift the cabinet.","Ye Jian held the small hand that was a little cold from the rain. She laid down and used the flashlight to look at the corner of the closet.","With this look, Ye Jian finally understood why there was an empty corner in the cabinet.","That was because the child’s grandpa had used his body to block the cabinet. The mud bricks had stopped the cabinet from pressing down. Hence, it formed a gap between the two.","“Lift the cabinet. One, two, three! One, two, three!”","..."]},{"number":4127,"title":"Chapter 4127: Gone","paragraphs":["Chapter 4127: Gone","Editor: Henyee Translations","The heavy cabinet was finally lifted by the students to the point where Ye Jian could enter and carry the child out. The students who were carrying the cabinet heaved a sigh of relief and gestured to Ye Jian. Ye Jian immediately let go and crawled into the gap...","The cries of a child could be heard in the rainy night. The villagers outside could tell that it was a child’s cry. They cried tears of joy.","“Child, nothing will happen to you!”","“The heavens have shown mercy. Nothing will happen to the child!”","“Quick, quick, go and fetch the child! Come out, all three of you!”","Ye Jian climbed out of the gap with the crying child in her arms. Just as she was about to climb out, there was a loud bang from the cabinet. Someone was knocking on the cabinet. Right on the heels of that, the sound of crying could be heard.","“Grandpa, Grandma... Grandpa, Grandma...”","The child in the cabinet was extremely afraid. He cried loudly and knocked on the cabinet door. He wanted to go out. He wanted to go out and look for his grandparents.","Ye Jian carried the child out. She climbed onto the mud bricks and rushed over. She handed the child to a villager who had reached out his hand earlier.","“There’s another child in the cabinet. I’m afraid the children’s grandfather has met with misfortune.”","The person who took the child was a village woman. Hearing that, her eyes darkened and she hugged the child tightly. “Fortunately, nothing happened to the two children.”","That was right. At least nothing happened to the two children and their grandmother. It was a blessing in disguise.","Two students used the beam to lift the top of the wooden cabinet. Ye Jian and the other three students used their shoulders to lift the heavy cabinet bit by bit. In the end, the entire cabinet was facing the sky. Liu Yang opened the cabinet door and saw the eldest child that the villagers were talking about.","“Come to me. I’ll bring you out.” Liu Yang reached out his hand and smiled at the child, who was crying loudly. “I’ll bring you out to look for your grandmother. Come... stand up carefully.”","The eldest child, who was in the third grade, got up and rushed into Liu Yang’s arms. He hugged Liu Yang’s neck tightly and cried even louder than before.","Liu Yang pressed his head and climbed out without stopping.","Ye Jian squatted beside the children’s grandfather. She lowered her eyes slightly and released her clenched fists. She said to the students beside her, “He has already passed...”","In order to protect his two grandsons, the grandfather used his side to block the falling cabinet. His head was hit by the collapsed mud bricks. In the end, his entire head was buried by the mud bricks. He used his curled up body to protect the children so that they wouldn’t be injured at all.","In order to save his grandsons, the grandfather gave up on himself.","The students stood at the side and bowed deeply.","“Come, let’s lift the grandfather up.” Ye Jian stood up straight. Her voice was a little suppressed as she said to her comrades, “We have to let him lie in a clean place.”","“Okay...”","The students’ noses were a little blocked. They started to carry the old man out.","Xu Wen, who had been standing outside, stared at the only broken wall that had not collapsed. Her mission was to keep an eye on the surroundings to prevent another collapse. She kept an eye on it and saw a mud brick suddenly smashing down on the broken wall.","“Ye Jian, dodge!”","Ye Jian and the rest were carrying the old man out when they suddenly heard Xu Wen’s tearing roar. Ye Jian looked up and saw the remaining wall swaying...","She shouted sternly, “Move, Xu Wen!”"]},{"number":4128,"title":"Chapter 4128: Sky Collapse","paragraphs":["Chapter 4128: Sky Collapse","Editor: Henyee Translations","The five of them could escape. The person in real danger was Xu Wen. She was the closest to the broken wall!","After Ye Jian finished shouting, a black shadow suddenly rushed over and hugged Xu Wen. The two of them rolled out a few times. Amidst the sound of collapse, the broken wall collapsed. A few heavy mud bricks hit the spot where Xu Wen was standing just now.","The villagers were so shocked that their hearts were in a mess.","“Don’t you have a brain? Don’t you know how to move?”","An angry shout exploded above Xu Wen’s head. It was Song Zhiqiu, who had come over to take a look at the situation after his group’s rescue mission was completed.","The rescue on Song Zhiqiu’s side was much smoother than on this side. He got the students to settle down the adults and children who had been rescued. Then, he got the villagers to lead the way and rushed over to Ye Jian’s side.","He walked a few steps faster and saw the extremely dangerous scene just now.","Xu Wen was also a little stunned. Just now, she was so focused on reminding Ye Jian and the rest to be careful that she forgot if she was safe.","She blinked at Song Zhiqiu’s shout. She gasped when she tried to speak. Her shoulder had hit something, and it hurt a little.","After shouting, Song Zhiqiu got up. With an ugly expression, he picked up the flashlight that he had thrown out just now and aimed it at Xu Wen’s face. He gritted his teeth and said, “You were almost hit by those mud bricks that weigh 20 catties just now!”","“I know.” Xu Wen frowned and pushed herself up with one hand. She asked Song Zhiqiu if he was alright. Before Song Zhiqiu could answer, Xu Wen had already run away.","She went to ask Ye Jian how she was doing. She had been doing manual labor with her bare hands for the past few hours. Her fingers must have been scratched.","Seeing this, Song Zhiqiu gritted his teeth.","She cared about Ye Jian. Why didn’t she think about herself just now?","The village official, who was shocked, hurriedly ran over and asked Xu Wen if she was alright. Xu Wen smiled and said, “I’m fine, I’m fine. It’s all thanks to my comrades just now.”","“It’s good that you’re fine. If something were to happen to you, we’d become sinners...” Hearing that she was fine, the village official’s rapidly beating heart gradually calmed down.","He was the one who asked the soldiers to save the villagers. If something happened to them, he wouldn’t be able to answer to the military unit or the families of the soldiers even if he committed suicide.","The entire rescue mission ended. The two children were placed in the neighbor’s house. The grandmother, whose head was simply treated by the bandages in the students’ sanitary bags, saw her husband’s cold body. Her turbid eyes were fixed on him as she fell down in a daze.","The house was gone, and his husband was gone. To her, her world had come crumbling down!","The other group of students who had completed their rescue mission were led by the villagers. They rushed over to Ye Jian. Before they went up the slope, they saw a light source flickering on the path hidden among the trees. It was Ye Jian and the rest returning to the school after the rescue.","He Jing and the rest, who came up to welcome them, wanted to ask about the situation. As they approached, they realized that the atmosphere was oppressive. Their comrades had their heads lowered slightly, and their moods were a little low.","Something... had happened.","Everyone’s mood was heavy when they returned to the school. The students, who had changed their clothes, lay on the waterproof mat. Although their eyes were closed, their minds were filled with thoughts.","This was not the first time Ye Jian had been in a life-or-death situation. She felt Xu Wen’s shoulders twitching as she slept beside her. She turned her body and said to Xu Wen, “Sleep. We still have to travel tomorrow morning. There are only two more hours left to rest.”"]},{"number":4129,"title":"Chapter 4129: At Any Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 4129: At Any Time","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xu Wen couldn’t get rid of the look of despair on the grandmother’s face from her mind. As long as she closed her eyes, she would think of that scene.","The grandmother was in so much despair that it was as if the sun wouldn’t rise the next day. She was in so much despair that it was as if her entire life had turned gray. It was too heavy and sorrowful. It pressed down on Xu Wen until she couldn’t breathe.","“Captain, how do you think the eldest child, the youngest child, and the grandmother will survive? The grandfather is gone, and the house has fallen...”","Xu Wen asked softly with a nasal voice.","“There will be a solution. Go to sleep.” Ye Jian wasn’t just saying this to Xu Wen. She was also saying this for her other comrades to hear.","No one spoke or mentioned what had happened. The two hours of rest passed quickly.","The students woke up punctually at five in the morning. They packed their backpacks and arranged the desks and chairs in the classroom in straight lines. The group of 15 people then turned around and entered the rainy forest.","Today was the last day of their outdoor survival training. They had to reach their destination at six in the evening. They had to hurry.","After a night of chaos, the village official finally managed to settle everything. He rushed to the school at six in the morning. He wanted to invite the soldiers who helped them last night to his house for breakfast, but when he rushed over, the school was already empty. There were no traces of them left.","Looking at the neat desks and chairs in the classroom, the village official turned around and closed the classroom door again. He returned to his house.","At critical moments, the soldiers were still the most reliable.","That was what the village official told his wife when he went back.","In times of crisis, it was always the people’s soldiers who stood up and used their bodies to defend the nation and its people. They protected the people on this land that they loved so much.","It was the same for Xia Jinyuan, who was overseas.","It was four o’clock in the afternoon on the 2nd of May. Xia Jinyuan was wearing sunglasses and standing behind Cobra expressionlessly. He was observing the transaction between Cobra and a black man.","The television in the room was playing the latest news. The famous economist, Jesse Morris, had committed suicide in prison by stabbing the handle of his toothbrush into his throat.","Cobra took a look and smiled coldly. He said to the black man who was in the midst of making a deal with him, “What a poor fellow. He crossed the bottom line of a kind person.”","“He has seen God. Everyone is very happy.” The black man finished the transaction and picked up his wine glass. He raised his glass to Cobra and took a sip.","“Yes, I’m happy too,” Cobra replied with a smile. He raised his glass and took a big sip of red wine.","Half an hour later, Cobra personally sent off the client who had bought a large amount of drugs from him. When he returned to his room, he stopped smiling and revealed his usual gloomy expression.","He said coldly to his bodyguards, “Ask the people below to get ready. I saw the Chinese diplomat walking into the elevator just now. He’s already staying here.”","“Everything’s ready, sir. We’re ready to act tonight.”","“Very good.” Cobra nodded and said to Xia Jinyuan, “Xia, you and Luke will guard outside tonight. I’m worried that the Chinese diplomat will recognize you.”","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say anything. He just nodded lightly.","Tonight, Cobra would attack Qin Xiu. Tonight, Luke would attack Cobra. Similarly, it was time for him to leave."]},{"number":4130,"title":"Chapter 4130: Secret","paragraphs":["Chapter 4130: Secret","At night, the beach was still filled with people. Countless young people were chasing each other on the soft beach. The night was getting darker, and the laughter on the beach was still present.","Someone started playing the electric guitar, and then another started beating the drums. There were also people playing the harmonica and harp. A few even started singing. It was a group of young people who were singing and dancing. It was very lively.","However, it didn’t last long. Very soon, someone came and chased them out. Yes, they were chased out. But there was no reason for them to leave.","Some of the young people wanted to resist, but they were pulled away by their companions because the people who were chasing them away had guns on them. Someone saw the guns on their waists.","The lively beach suddenly quietened down. The crowd of onlookers dispersed in twos and threes. The salty wind blew past the sea rocks. The seawater hit the beach and made a rustling sound. When Cobra saw the crowd on the beach, he closed the curtains that blocked the sun.","He hated the liveliness and the endless energy of those people. He hated the lively smiles on their faces. He hated everything that had to do with sunlight, including people!","The room with the curtains closed was pitch-black. Cobra, who liked to live in the dark, enjoyed it very much. He sat on the soft couch, and his body sank. He seemed to have merged with the couch and the darkness.","There was a faint fragrance of wine in the room. As Cobra tasted the expensive red wine sent by the winery, he waited quietly for dawn.","In Qin Xiu’s room, two armed police officers dressed in plain clothes and pretending to be staff stared at the door vigilantly. Even though they were sitting, their backs were straight.","In addition to the two armed police officers in the room, there was also a hotel worker who was talking to Qin Xiu in standard Mandarin.","Xia Jinyuan had disguised himself as a hotel worker here to deliver food and entered Qin Xiu’s room.","“Tonight, the Russian side will only act after Cobra attacks you. Two of Cobra’s men have disguised themselves as staff members at the front desk of the hotel. One of the doormen outside is also a subordinate of Cobra’s, as well as the staff beside the elevator. When the rioters rush into the hotel, they’ll cooperate with the entire riot and cause the entire hotel to fall into fear. As for you, Cobra will take the opportunity to approach.","“The Russian side doesn’t want to expose themselves, so they’ll disguise themselves as rioters and sneak in. They’ll take the opportunity to kidnap Cobra and bring him back to the Russian side. My mission is to stop the Russian side from bringing Cobra back to their country and kill him on the spot.”","Xia Jinyuan told Qin Xiu Cobra’s plan and what he had figured out about Luke’s plan.","Cobra had too many secrets in his hands. He even planned to kidnap two nuclear bomb experts. In the end, because their country was quite cautious, his plan was ruined.","Such a person would be a bomb to any country. Only by destroying him would they feel at ease.","After listening to the entire plan, Qin Xiu’s handsome expression was as calm as before. He didn’t panic.","He pursed his thin lips slightly and said in a low voice, “In other words, I’ve become the most important chess piece in the game. I’ll be the one causing tonight’s riot, right?","“Tsk...” Qin Xiu sneered. He placed his slender fingers on the blue folder and stared at Xia Jinyuan with his dark eyes. His voice became colder. “This Mr. Cobra really thinks highly of me. He’s making me responsible for such a big thing.”","He actually became the fuse for the riot that was about to happen tonight."]},{"number":4131,"title":"Chapter 4131: Facing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4131: Facing","Xia Jinyuan could see the coldness in his eyes. Unmoved, he said calmly, “Because he’s in a hurry to enter the Chinese market and the coastal areas of our country. Because in the past two years, our country’s counter-espionage has made it harder for him to know too much about the movements of the various military bases in China. Hence, he’s in a hurry to enter the Chinese market and urgently come into contact with relevant people.","“He once kidnapped a few scientists from our country. Among them was an expert in airborne weapons. He was so close to succeeding. Later, the pirate who was working for him had a huge appetite and increased his chips. Cobra was so angry that he wanted to send people to secretly kill this pirate. That was when our country’s military saved a few scientists.","“After that, our country’s counter-espionage got stricter and stricter every year. Cobra’s spies were finally uprooted by our country. He lost the ability to understand the Chinese military base. The forces supporting him are urging him to accelerate his progress into the Chinese market. And you’re the best threshold for him.","“He thinks that it’s worth it to start a riot to gain your attention and trust.”","“Tsk...”","Qin Xiu put the folder aside. He was holding a few documents from the National Assets Commission regarding the plans of the country’s companies to enter the tourist city. As a diplomat, he came to meet with the local officials before making further progress.","Unexpectedly, Cobra, who was under the alias of Krone, had his eyes on him.","A person who tried to steal the country’s military secrets and even kidnapped scientists who worked on the country’s military weapons... Moreover, he had the secrets of some countries in his hands. Such a person would be a scourge no matter which country he landed in.","He might harm China one day.","“I want to know if there’s anything I need to help out with? For instance, helping you leave.” Qin Xiu’s clear gaze was fixed on Xia Jinyuan. Ha, the two of them were love rivals. In the end, they had to help each other.","This was a serious matter, while their love lives were not. The country was the foundation.","Xia Jinyuan said calmly, “No, I came to tell you that there’ll be a riot after midnight. Protect yourself well and don’t let Cobra succeed.","“He’s a lunatic. He might change his mind midway and turn the riot that’s supposed to gain your trust into a riot that will really kill you.","“There are too many rioters in this country. It’s common for a few officials to die. If something happens to a diplomat from another country, it’ll be a matter between countries. It’ll have nothing to do with Mr. Krone, who would also be a victim of the riot.","“Since he arranged such a plan, he has enough retreat routes prepared. He won’t be involved in any trouble.”","Xia Jinyuan stood up. He had been here for five minutes. Now, he needed to return to his room and wait for midnight.","“Be careful, Major Xia.”","Qin Xiu stood up and reached out his hand.","The moment the two of them shook hands, Qin Xiu pursed his lips slightly and said, “Don’t forget that there are still people waiting for you to go back. For her sake, I wish you peace and success.”","Xia Jinyuan looked at the young diplomat who was around his age and nodded slightly. “Thank you for your concern.”","After he finished speaking, he turned around and walked toward the door. When he reached the door, he stopped and turned around. He asked him, “You’ve seen her, right? Is she okay?”"]},{"number":4132,"title":"Chapter 4132: Gentlemen","paragraphs":["Chapter 4132: Gentlemen","The usually calm diplomat was stunned by Xia Jinyuan’s words.","After a while, Qin Xiu, who didn’t know that Xia Jinyuan was a lieutenant colonel, laughed and asked, “Major Xia, don’t you even know if your girlfriend is doing well? Why are you asking me this... I can be considered a suitor of hers. Don’t you think it’s funny?”","He really didn’t expect Xia Jinyuan to ask him about his girlfriend.","Xia Jinyuan turned around and looked at the mocking Qin Xiu with his clear eyes. “It’s been a long time since we last met. I can’t help but want to ask about her when I meet someone I know in a foreign country.”","It had been a long time since they last met...","Qin Xiu suddenly remembered his call with Commander Xia. Commander Xia told him that Xia Jinyuan wouldn’t contact the country easily, so... he definitely couldn’t contact Ye Jian at any time.","For the sake of his responsibility and the mission he carried out, Xia Jinyuan cut off all ties with the country. If something really happened, the country wouldn’t know immediately.","Qin Xiu’s jaw tightened. “I’m sorry. I was rash. Ye Jian...” ‘She isn’t doing well.’ Those words were already on the tip of his tongue, but Qin Xiu slowly swallowed them.","He said calmly, “She has returned to the capital city. I met her at Dan Gui Garden. She looks like she’s doing well. Everything is fine. You... don’t have to worry.”","Xia Jinyuan was on a high-risk mission. If he knew that Ye Jian wasn’t doing well in the country, he would definitely be worried. If he was worried, he would be distracted. Xia Jinyuan, who was on a high-risk mission, couldn’t be distracted because of this.","In the end, Qin Xiu chose to hide it. “After that, I met her at the airport. I came to Molaban while she went back to the military school.”","Qin Xiu’s reply made Xia Jinyuan frown. Dan Gui Garden, the capital city... No, why did she suddenly return to the capital city?","Since she was transferred to a grassroots company, she should go back to school directly after returning from Myanmar. Why did she go to the capital city?","“Is Old Master Fu in good health? Where’s Uncle Fu?” Xia Jinyuan didn’t ask directly. Instead, he tried to probe with his questions. It was impossible to guard against him.","Qin Xiu replied, “The old man went to the laboratory of the aviation base. Uncle Fu has been at the Northwest Aviation Missile Base. He didn’t even come back for New Year’s.”","It meant that everything was fine and there was nothing to worry about.","Then why did his little fox return to the capital city?","“Ye Jian didn’t know that the old man went to the laboratory. She called home, but no one answered. So she rushed back to the capital city.” This was Qin Xiu’s explanation to Xia Jinyuan. It made Xia Jinyuan calm down.","There were no flaws at all. It was very similar to Ye Jian’s style of doing things.","Xia Jinyuan frowned before relaxing. He leaned forward slightly to express his gratitude to Qin Xiu. “Thank you. Be careful tonight. Bullets are cruel. Goodbye.”","“Take care. Goodbye.” Qin Xiu nodded. He accepted Xia Jinyuan’s thanks.","Why wouldn’t he accept it?","He accepted it with a clear conscience.","After the door closed, Qin Xiu sat back on the couch. When he was about to pick up the glass of water on the coffee table and drink it, he took out his phone from his pocket.","He probably took out his phone unconsciously when he sat back down on the couch.","Who did he want to call?","Qin Xiu didn’t grab the glass of water. He lowered his head and rubbed the buttons on his cell phone with his slender fingers. Who did he want to call?","The face that appeared in his mind was the person he wanted to call.","He wanted to tell her that Xia Jinyuan, who was far away overseas, was fine and that she didn’t have to worry."]},{"number":4133,"title":"Chapter 4133: Politeness","paragraphs":["Chapter 4133: Politeness","Qin Xiu wanted to tell Ye Jian... that the man she loved deeply would return to the country soon. If she had any difficulties, she could soon tell her boyfriend about them. She didn’t have to bear everything alone.","Ye Jian’s name and phone number appeared on the screen. It wasn’t her personal cell phone. It was the school’s number.","After staring at the name ‘Ye Jian’ for dozens of seconds, Qin Xiu threw his phone on the coffee table and raised his hand. He pursed his thin lips and tugged at his tie in frustration. Lifting his head, he swallowed his saliva. He unbuttoned the top button of his shirt and loosened his tie. He even unbuttoned the cufflinks, revealing his smooth muscles. He looked very strong and didn’t look like a government official at all.","However, it was hard to ignore his handsome face.","At this moment, the young diplomat, who had always maintained a strict and elegant image, revealed a hint of decadence that he had never shown before.","“Damn it!”","He cursed in a low voice. His voice was a little loud, causing the two armed police officers protecting him to look at him in shock.","Just now... they didn’t hear wrongly, right?","The strict ambassador actually cursed?","This was the only curse word Qin Xiu knew. He couldn’t think of any other curse words that could express his current mood. That was why even he said a curse word that even a child knew.","It could be seen that Qin Xiu was a diplomat who never swore.","As for why he suddenly cursed, only Qin Xiu knew.","“Ambassador, if what the major said just now is true, we suggest that you be equipped with a pistol to protect yourself.” The armed police officer retracted the shock on his face and entered the topic directly. He seriously suggested, “Although the north is a tourist city, the country is famous for being chaotic internationally. Gangs, riots, guns... These are the labels on this country. If there’s really a riot tonight, you need a gun to protect yourself.”","Qin Xiu pursed his lips and said in a low voice, “There are no ifs. It’s 100% confirmed that there’s going to be a riot tonight.” He believed Xia Jinyuan’s words and didn’t suspect anything.","Commander Xia had reminded him that he couldn’t disturb Xia Jinyuan, lest he arouse the suspicion of Cobra. When he saw Xia Jinyuan here for the first time, no matter how shocked he was, he controlled his gaze.","After verifying it with the country, he was even more glad that he had restrained herself.","Xia Jinyuan took the risk of being exposed to inform him of such a dangerous mission. Hence, he believed that there would definitely be a riot tonight.","When Xia Jinyuan came in disguised as an attendant, Qin Xiu was as shocked as when he first saw Xia Jinyuan.","He took the risk to inform him that there would be a riot tonight. There was no reason for Qin Xiu not to believe him, let alone question the sincerity of a soldier who was loyal to the country.","“You’re right. I do need a pistol for self-defense. The two of you will be in my room tonight. If anything happens, we can deal with it together.”","“Yes!”","The two armed police officers agreed in unison and gave Qin Xiu a pistol filled with bullets.","It wasn’t midnight yet, so Qin Xiu went back to his room to rest. The two armed police officers rested in the room outside to prepare for the upcoming chaos tonight.","The night was getting darker, and the sound of the waves on the seaside was louder. There were huge waves hitting the reefs, and the water splashed high before falling back into the sea. The tides rose and fell endlessly.","Luke, who had opened the window and was listening to the sound of the waves hitting the rocks, had already smoked countless cigarettes. There were at least five cigarette butts in the glass ashtray.","The smell of smoke was strong in the room."]},{"number":4134,"title":"Chapter 4134: Eve","paragraphs":["Chapter 4134: Eve","He took two puffs of the cigarette between his fingers. The red dot flashed for a long time. Before he finished the cigarette, Luke extinguished it in the ashtray with all his might. He left his room that had the smell of smoke and knocked on Xia Jinyuan’s room door.","Cobra didn’t let Xia Jinyuan be on duty tonight, nor did he let Luke be on duty. The two of them were his path of retreat. When he needed them, he would naturally let them appear.","Hearing the knock on the door, Xia Jinyuan looked through the peephole and smiled. He opened the door, and the smell of smoke wafted over. Xia Jinyuan revealed a disdainful expression and blocked Luke’s way with his long legs. “If you have anything to say, say it here.”","His disdain made Luke touch his forehead. “Buddy, can you be a little more like a man and not be as clean as a woman? I want to sit in your room.”","“You should go to the woman’s room, not mine.”","Xia Jinyuan was unmoved and continued to stop him.","The closed door opposite opened. The bodyguard who was always by Cobra’s side was standing at the door. He said to Xia Jinyuan, “Mr. Cobra said that you guys should rest. Xia, let him in. Don’t cause trouble.”","Only then did Xia Jinyuan raise his long legs and let Luke in.","The bodyguard then closed the door.","“Xia, I feel a little uneasy about the riot planned tonight. The Chinese ambassador won’t be so stupid as to fall for it so easily, right?” After entering, Luke frowned and said uneasily, “He has two staff members with him. Why do I feel that they don’t look like ordinary staff members? They look like bodyguards.”","Hearing this, Xia Jinyuan glanced at him and thought to himself, ‘This fellow is indeed a soldier. He’s always so sensitive to people with the same temperament.’","“Are you afraid that something will happen to you?” Xia Jinyuan sat on the couch and looked up at Luke, who was leaning against the bar counter. “Such things have happened too many times. You don’t have to worry.”","“What I want to say is that if something really happens, you should protect yourself. To tell you the truth, Cobra seems to trust you, but if he finds out that he’s in danger, he’ll definitely push you out to take the bullets for him. Just like that time in Myanmar, he chose to give up on you without hesitation.","“If such a thing happens again, Xia, you have to live for yourself. Do you understand?”","It turned out that Luke was reminding Xia Jinyuan that he had to protect himself during the Russian mission tonight.","They had been partners for more than a year, and they shared a friendship.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say anything, but his gaze turned colder. He stared at Luke without blinking. “I’m working for Mr. Cobra now. He’s in control of my life. I’m sorry, but I can’t do what you just told me to.","“There’s still a fierce battle tonight. I need to rest early. Goodbye.”","Xia Jinyuan, who didn’t plan to reveal his identity, stood up and walked into his room. Behind him, Luke’s facial expression changed. He stared at Xia Jinyuan’s back for a long time. Just as Xia Jinyuan entered the bedroom and was about to close the door, he raised his voice and said in a low voice, “I hope you can live well, my partner. Live well for yourself.”","“You’re acting very strangely tonight. Find a woman to sleep with you and everything will be normal again.” After Xia Jinyuan finished speaking, he closed the door.","Standing behind the door, he heard the sound of the main door closing after a while.","Luke wanted to tell him that Russia had put him on the must-kill list. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have emphasized ‘living well’.","This was a little tricky.","It was a little difficult to escape unscathed from the hands of the special forces.","Xia Jinyuan sat by the bed and cleaned up the bullets while thinking about how he could escape safely."]},{"number":4135,"title":"Chapter 4135: Revenge","paragraphs":["Chapter 4135: Revenge","It was easy for Xia Jinyuan to get rid of Cobra in the chaotic battle and escape. What was not simple was... figuring out a way to return to the country unscathed.","It was the holidays in the country. Xia Jinyuan planned to report back to the military first and rush to the National Science University to see the woman he loved.","He knew that Ye Jian was worried about him and that she had been waiting for him to return to the country. He couldn’t let himself get hurt. He needed to return safely.","It was a little difficult to return to the country unscathed.","After putting the bullets back into the magazine, Xia Jinyuan opened the closet and wore the bulletproof vest. He turned off the lights and lay on the bed. He was thinking about escaping as he waited for the riot to happen.","Upstairs, Qin Xiu had already fallen asleep. The alarm clock on his cell phone beeped, and at the same time, an armed police officer knocked on his door.","Qin Xiu suddenly opened his eyes and quickly reached under the pillow. Then, he got out of bed and opened the door.","“Ambassador, there’s a situation outside.”","The armed police officer who knocked on the door spoke in a low voice.","Under the dim light, he saw that the armed police officer had already tightened his grip on the pistol. Qin Xiu loaded his pistol skillfully and asked calmly, “Has it started?”","“The entire hotel is under control. There are people lying in ambush outside.”","Qin Xiu walked out and saw the other armed police officer standing at the door. His back was slightly arched, and he was like a ferocious beast that had come out of its cage. His sharp gaze observed the situation outside through the peephole.","The armed police officer, who was observing the situation outside, slowly returned to the room and said in a low voice, “We’ll move the couch and coffee table in front of the door to block it. We’ll also put the safe at the top and tie it by the bed. If anything happens, escape from the bathroom inside.”","The two armed police officers were in charge of protecting Qin Xiu’s safety. When they checked into the hotel, they wouldn’t just observe the room. They would also habitually observe the exits and other possible retreat routes.","Qin Xiu joined in the pushing. The three adult men quickly erected the couch to block the door. There was a rather heavy safe at the top. Once someone forcefully broke the door, the safe would smash outward. It might be able to smash one or two disguised ‘rioters’ to death.","If it fell toward the inside, it would block the couch and force the people outside to spend some time pushing it away.","The coffee table was pressed against the corner of the couch. An armed police officer quickly removed the steel pull cables from the bathroom curtains. One end was wrapped around the DVD control, while the other end was wrapped around the television cabinet. The cable was straightened and hooked under the door. The other end was buckled under the closet. This was a simple but lethal defense. If someone rushed in, they might be strangled.","The defense at the door was done. Qin Xiu had already tied the bedsheets into a knot and placed it in the bathroom. Everything was ready. He was just waiting for the chaos to break out.","The clock ticked. Time passed slowly. Xia Jinyuan, who was standing beside Cobra, waited for the most exciting moment of the night to come.","Luke, who was standing beside him, pursed his lips. He lowered his eyes and glanced at the people around him. When he looked at Cobra again, there was undisguised hatred in his eyes.","Six and a half years ago, his real partner from Signal Flag was brutally killed by Cobra at a port on the Mekong River in Myanmar because his identity was exposed.","That day, when he got off the ship, he immediately recognized the port. It was the port where Cobra cruelly killed his comrade back then.","Cobra killed his comrade. He even took a photo of him being tortured at that time. He openly provoked Russia by hacking into the official website of the Russian government and sending the photo. The moment Luke saw the photo, he swore that he would find Cobra and take revenge for his comrade."]},{"number":4136,"title":"Chapter 4136: Chaos","paragraphs":["Chapter 4136: Chaos","Tonight, the time had finally come!","He would not let Cobra return to Russia alive. Tonight, he would kill Cobra and make this bastard disappear forever.","There were still 16 minutes before midnight. The people working for Cobra had already completed their infiltration. Then, some of them fell to the ground with their heads and bodies in a strange arc before they even started moving.","In the dark, at least 20 agile special forces soldiers disguised as hotel staff were moving quickly.","This was the special forces that specialized in counter-subversion and guarding against foreign targets. They started their immersion-style combat. This time, Russia sent a squad of soldiers to infiltrate Molaban and end the six-year-long campaign.","They were all between 25 and 35 years old. They were very young, and their combat ability was very strong. Even though there were only 20 of them, their combat ability was still strong.","According to the information provided by Luke, they quickly approached two breakthrough points and silently killed the people guarding there. Then, they replaced them with their own people.","“Scatter.”","They led the way in sign language. Hiding in the dark, they crept toward the floor where Cobra was. Their mission was to catch the target alive and bring him back to the country at the fastest speed.","The clock struck midnight. Cobra, who was staring at the time, smiled.","Tonight, the show prepared for the Chinese ambassador and the Molaban officials had begun.","Gunshots sounded without any warning. It was sparse at first before the firepower suddenly increased. Then, there was the sound of chains being twisted. It woke up all the passengers in the hotel.","Those who heard the gunshots knew that they were gunshots and reacted quickly. The first thing they did was to block the door. Those who had never heard gunshots before reacted a little slower. They wanted to push open the window to see what was going on.","The fire alarm in the hotel rang loudly, letting out a sharp and ear-piercing sound to remind all the guests that danger was around them. This was deliberately sounded by Cobra’s subordinate who was disguised as a front desk staff member. It was to alarm the guests in every room and make them run in a panic.","Then, the rioters started kicking a fuss.","There were indeed guests who woke up with a start. They didn’t even change their clothes before immediately pulling open the doors to escape. These people thought that there was a fire.","As soon as they pulled open the doors, cold and dark muzzles were already waiting at the end of the corridor. People ran out of their rooms. After running a few steps, the bullets had already hit their bodies. In less than two minutes, there were more than ten people lying in a pool of blood.","“Ahhhhh!!!”","Screams sounded from all floors, including the floor where Qin Xiu was.","Hearing the gunshots and screams outside, Qin Xiu clenched his fists.","Chaotic footsteps sounded, and dense gunshots filled the entire floor. Under the cover of two armed police officers, Qin Xiu retreated to the room inside and started to leave through the inner window.","Gunshots swept across the door lock. In less than a minute, the lock was all broken. Someone started kicking the door.","The door wasn’t as easy to kick open as they thought. The people outside instantly understood that their target had planned for this.","Cobra quickly learned that his subordinates didn’t manage to kick the door open and kidnap the Chinese ambassador immediately. Just as his eyes became gloomy, gunshots sounded on his floor.","This floor was filled with his men. Gunshots would never sound on the floor where he was.","Without waiting for Cobra’s instructions, Xia Jinyuan rushed to the door. He opened the door gently and looked out quickly. Then, he closed the door and returned to Cobra’s side. He said calmly, “Someone is rushing over from outside. It’s not one of us.”"]},{"number":4137,"title":"Chapter 4137: Cold To The Bone","paragraphs":["Chapter 4137: Cold To The Bone","Not one of them? Who was it, then?","Cobra didn’t have the time to think about who was outside. He only knew that he was in danger and had to leave immediately.","“Take good care of the Chinese ambassador. I hope that I can meet the Chinese ambassador again tonight.” Cobra stood up and instructed Luke and Xia Jinyuan. He waved his hand and gestured for the four bodyguards beside him to cover him and leave.","The gunshots outside were especially chaotic. The guests in the various rooms were already trembling in fear. They didn’t dare to go out or stay in their rooms. Countless people started to think of ways to protect themselves.","Some used the couch to block the door, some hid in the closet, some hid in the bathroom, and some boldly climbed out of the window. Their legs were trembling, and they felt as if they would fall at any moment.","The hotel was already on alert. The government forces in the city rushed to the hotel. They needed to rescue the local officials and most importantly, the ambassador from China.","The mayor of the city was resting at home. When he heard that there was a riot in the hotel, he rushed back to the government office without even wearing his jacket.","All the armed government forces and police officers rushed to the hotel at an urgent speed. This was a premeditated riot. They needed to kill all the people who started the riot and find the mastermind.","The alarm in the entire city was sounded. All the transportation entrances to the hotel were sealed off. The location was heavily guarded. The entire city was on high alert.","Cobra’s bodyguard looked at the police cars parked below the hotel. The police lights were flashing. He lowered the curtain and ran to Cobra, who was preparing to retreat. He said a few words in a low voice.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t notice it. He had already tightened his grip on the loaded pistol and was preparing to break out.","“Xia, stand beside me.” Luke suddenly said in a low voice, “You cover Mr. Cobra. I’ll break out.”","He thought that he needed to send his best partner out of the hotel. Now, he really regretted not letting his partner leave in advance.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at Luke and silently retreated to the side.","He needed to return to his country safely, and Luke was indeed his best shield.","Luke immediately took over Xia Jinyuan’s position. His cold gaze swept past Cobra, who was sitting on the couch again. The gun in his hand made Luke want to shoot Cobra several times.","He had wanted to do this countless times, but in the end, his rationality would prevail and he would resist the urge.","Outside, the gunshots were especially intense. When the rioters arranged by Cobra realized that they were falling one by one, they immediately understood that a group of people who were against them had infiltrated the hotel.","Cobra, who was sitting on the couch, was talking to the highest-ranking administrator of the city. He was very angry and accused the government of inaction. His voice was almost roaring. “Is this how you manage your city? You’ve put me in danger!","“Do you know why I’m here? I came to the beach because I wanted to invest in a huge tourism project. In the end, such a thing happened. Listen, I want the government forces to come and protect me immediately! Send people over here right now!”","After Cobra finished roaring, he didn’t give the other party a chance to speak. He immediately ended the call. The anger on his face disappeared like a tide, and in the blink of an eye, it changed to a bone-chilling expression."]},{"number":4138,"title":"Chapter 4138: Carve A Path Of Blood","paragraphs":["Chapter 4138: Carve A Path Of Blood","Cobra said to the bodyguard in a gloomy voice, “Tell the higher-ups to hurry up and invite the Chinese ambassador. I don’t want the government forces to invite the Chinese ambassador first. I think that no matter how calm this ambassador from a peaceful country is, he’ll temporarily be obedient in the face of guns.","“Remember, our people are going to save the Chinese ambassador. If the Chinese ambassador doesn’t believe us, we can show him how our people kill the rioters and save him.”","“Yes, sir.”","The bodyguard in charge of arranging these things retreated to the side and informed the person who was responsible for looking for Qin Xiu of Cobra’s orders through his cell phone.","Luke listened to Cobra’s arrangements. When he heard that Cobra had asked his men to kill the rioters, the two people who wanted to break out of the encirclement couldn’t help but smile.","The rioters were also Cobra’s people. If they managed to kill Cobra’s own people... Not bad. This way, the soldiers would have fewer targets to eliminate.","At this moment, the administrators of the government agencies in the city were already extremely busy.","Their own officials were trapped in the hotel, and so was the Chinese ambassador. Now, the most famous entrepreneur and philanthropist, Mr. Krone, was also trapped in the hotel. The atmosphere in the entire admin building was so low that it was as if there was a huge mountain pressing down on everyone.","Xia Jinyuan heard Cobra’s roar and instantly understood what this man wanted to do.","At this moment, there was no safer option than to use the government forces to protect himself and retreat. Cobra could think of this. With Qin Xiu’s intelligence, he should be able to think of this too.","However, things might not go as planned.","There were two armed police officers sent by the Imperial City beside him. Based on the way the soldiers dealt with things, no hope should be placed on them. Before the government forces took action, they would definitely choose to save themselves.","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan didn’t care if the special forces soldiers of Signal Flag lost a few enemies. He was only concerned about Qin Xiu.","There was a heavy knock on the door. Someone shouted the name of a bodyguard beside Cobra. Cobra’s men fought their way out to cover everyone in the room.","The two Russian Signal Flag soldiers quickly dragged their injured comrades behind the fire door. Amidst the smoke, they contacted their comrades guarding outside and told them that their comrades were injured.","The people under Cobra were not a motley crew, especially the subordinates who were arranged to cover the chaos and evacuate the hotel. These people had undergone professional training and were even more powerful than the government forces.","The special forces soldiers from the Russian Signal Flag were intercepted by them just now. They couldn’t get close immediately and lost their chance temporarily.","Luke closed his eyes lightly. Once again, he pretended to be a loyal subordinate to cover Cobra’s retreat.","The tracking signal on his body reminded his comrades who were hiding in the dark. As long as Luke and Cobra were together, Signal Flag would be able to know Cobra’s location immediately.","Cobra left the room and started to retreat downstairs. A few smoke bombs were suddenly thrown out of one of the rooms. Xia Jinyuan shouted in English, “Get down!” The counter-attack had started.","Bang... Bang... Bang...","His quick reaction made the guys covering Cobra’s retreat react. The dense bullets fired in front of them, forcing the special forces soldiers who wanted to rush out of the room to retreat."]},{"number":4139,"title":"Chapter 4139: Intense Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 4139: Intense Battle","“Retreat. There’s an ambush! Cover Mr. Cobra. Leave this to me and Luke!”","Xia Jinyuan, who was almost shot, growled coldly. At this moment, he was still a loyal subordinate of Cobra like Luke. They had to cover Cobra and let him leave safely.","Cobra was shielded by his personal bodyguards. When he heard Xia Jinyuan’s low growl, he rolled to the door frame of a room. His back was pressed tightly against the closed door. His breathing was not messy as he said coldly to one of his personal bodyguards, “Ask Xia to come back. The rest will take over.”","Xia was a very good subordinate. He was loyal and capable. With him by his side, he would feel more at ease.","‘The rest’ would be the ones covering Cobra’s retreat.","This time, it was Luke and another bodyguard who broke out of the encirclement. Xia Jinyuan became the bodyguard. At this moment, Luke was very satisfied that he could break out of the encirclement. He led Cobra step by step toward the corridor where the Russian Signal Flag special forces were lying in ambush.","The two special forces soldiers, who were suppressed by the firepower and couldn’t come out, tied their escape ropes around their waists and jumped out of the window. They stepped on the railings used by the hotel to plant flowers. Then, the two of them nimbly crossed several railings and finally chose the windowsill of a room.","The sound of glass shattering was heard. The two of them used their legs to break the glass. Amidst two screams, they entered a room where there were tourists.","Hearing the gunshots outside, the two young women hiding by the bed screamed when they saw two black shadows suddenly breaking through the window. They were already trembling in fear from the gunshots.","The Russian special forces soldiers who landed on the ground whispered, “Don’t be afraid.” The two of them quickly ran to the door. One of the special forces soldiers placed his ear close to the door and gestured with his hand. “One, two, three.” He suddenly pulled open the door and fired.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The NATO-made rifle bullets tore through the air and mercilessly hit the guys covering Cobra’s retreat, including a personal bodyguard.","“Shit!”","Luke cursed in a low voice. It was unknown who he was scolding, but he finally fired.","Cobra’s expression was dark. This group of people that came out of nowhere had quite a strong combat ability. Moreover, they were clearly coming for him.","“Xia, leave this to them. You cover me as I leave.” Cobra’s cold voice came from behind Xia Jinyuan. “These damned fellows, their target is me.”","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan’s back was pressed tightly against Cobra. He was using his body to protect Cobra’s safety.","The unsightly bullet flashed across his eyes and landed somewhere. The top of his leather shoes was hit by the bullet casing.","Hearing this, Xia Jinyuan said in a low voice, “Luke and I will cover you. Nothing will happen!”","He would definitely not let anything happen to himself. He still had to return to the country unscathed.","Luke, who was in combat, didn’t hear what Xia Jinyuan said. Seeing that several more people who were covering the retreat had fallen, the darkness in Luke’s eyes deepened.","The firepower in front had been cut off. Luke knew that it was time for him to lure Cobra away again. He brought Cobra along and retreated step by step into the trap that the Russians had already laid out.","“Hurry up and leave!”","He said in a low voice and quickly changed to a new magazine.","The Russian Signal Flag special forces soldiers saw their targets gradually approaching. They held their breaths. They were just waiting for them to come down from upstairs."]},{"number":4140,"title":"Chapter 4140: Exposed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4140: Exposed","They rushed into the fire escape corridor and quickly retreated to the first floor. This floor was controlled by Cobra’s people, so the entire retreat was very smooth. However, when they reached the corridor leading to the lobby, they were ambushed again. In a few seconds, four people fell.","Luke shouted, “Xia, go to the back, go to the back! Hurry!” He shouted and pulled Xia Jinyuan with all his might. Xia Jinyuan, who was originally in front, was pulled behind.","They retreated. Behind them... the special forces soldiers from Signal Flag were waiting.","Xia Jinyuan, who was suddenly pulled to the back by Luke, understood why he had to retreat. He didn’t move forward to break out of the encirclement anymore. He kept approaching Cobra so that Cobra wouldn’t leave his sight.","The Russian Signal Flag special forces soldiers lying in ambush watched as the target got closer and closer to them. He tightened his grip on the rifle in his hand. Soon, soon...","Behind them was the back garden of the hotel. Behind that was the parking lot. The government forces had surrounded the entire hotel and started their assault.","Cobra’s bodyguard felt his phone vibrating in his pocket. He took out his phone and answered the call as he retreated with his gun.","In just a few seconds, the bodyguard’s expression changed drastically. He approached Cobra and said in a low voice, “Boss, the Chinese ambassador is not in his room. He left the hotel.”","There was nothing worse than this news!","If it wasn’t for this group of people targeting Cobra, his plan would have been perfect. He just needed to wait for the Chinese ambassador to appear in front of him.","However, his plan was ruined. He, who only needed to wait, became one of the fleeing guests.","“Kill them all. Don’t leave any of them alive!” His entire plan was ruined, and his good mood was ruined too. In that case, he could only let all the guests in the hotel bear his anger.","“The Chinese ambassador must be in the hotel. Since he’s so uncooperative, let him know the consequences of offending me. Kill him!”","Not only did Cobra make all the guests in the hotel bear his anger, but he also wanted to kill Qin Xiu, who was not cooperating with him.","This was Cobra. He was a lunatic who didn’t have any respect for other people’s lives and who did things according to his mood. He was just a demon from hell.","Xia Jinyuan, who was beside him, had a sharp glint in his deep and unfathomable black eyes. A fellow like him didn’t have the right to live. Death was his final destination.","The Russian side wanted to capture Cobra alive and pry out more secrets from him? Dream on!","With Cobra’s power, as long as he didn’t die, he would definitely be able to escape from Russia. The special forces soldiers who would escort him back to Russia would definitely be killed by him.","Whose stupid idea was it to want to catch Cobra alive?","Or was there a problem with the higher-ups of Russia? Was it because they couldn’t contact Cobra that they came up with this idea?","If that was the case...","Xia Jinyuan, who didn’t even flinch when the bullets flew past his ears, broke out in a cold sweat. If something was really going on with the higher-ups of Russia, it would be equivalent to a holiday for Cobra!","After the holiday ended, he would return to Molaban. As for Luke, his identity would be exposed!","Cobra could not return to Russia alive!","“Go, go, go!” The guy who was covering Cobra’s retreat quickened his pace. If they rushed out of the first floor of the hotel now, someone would be waiting for them outside. They could leave the hotel immediately without having to fight with the government forces."]},{"number":4141,"title":"Chapter 4141: Live Well","paragraphs":["Chapter 4141: Live Well","As for the so-called rioters, they didn’t know who was instructing them. To them, this riot was a real riot.","The entire hotel had turned into a battlefield. The people who started the riot were malignants in the city. They hid during the day and moved at night. The more chaotic the entire city was, the happier they were. Human lives were no different from the lives of ants to them.","Cobra made no mistakes in his calculations. With every step he took, he would think about the next ten steps and the results after that. As the most outstanding entrepreneur and philanthropist, how could he reveal his true identity?","He wouldn’t. The rioters were real rioters. They were rioters under Cobra, but they weren’t rioters under the entrepreneur and philanthropist, Mr. Krone.","Now, it was Cobra who was ordering the massacre of all the guests in the hotel. It had nothing to do with the entrepreneur and philanthropist, Mr. Krone. Mr. Krone was one of the victims.","Xia Jinyuan had been watching Cobra for almost a year and a half. Every time he saw Cobra’s meticulous plan in action, he would be more vigilant. He would never allow himself to make even the smallest mistakes. He was afraid that a small mistake would make Cobra suspicious.","If he were Luke, he wouldn’t have mentioned where Cobra should retreat. He would have let Cobra decide how he should retreat.","Because once the Signal Flag special forces soldiers appeared, Cobra would realize that he was in an ambush. With his paranoia, he would immediately think that there was something wrong with Luke.","Luke was the one who shouted for them to retreat!","Xia Jinyuan hoped that Luke could think of something. He didn’t want Cobra to leave the hotel alive and fall into the hands of the special forces. If not, Cobra would know Luke’s identity.","Indeed, Luke had never thought of letting Cobra live past tonight. He was already prepared to attack Cobra at any time, but the time wasn’t ripe yet.","Currently, Cobra still had three top-notch bodyguards with him. There were also six people covering his retreat. If he killed Cobra now, he wouldn’t be able to return to the country alive.","Hence, he wanted to use the guns in the hands of the soldiers outside to kill the guys protecting Cobra first. Then, he would choose to attack.","Luke, who was leaning against the wall, looked at Cobra, who was a distance behind him. It was too dark. Actually, he couldn’t see Cobra at all, but he could sense Cobra’s presence. He pressed Xia Jinyuan, who wanted to continue walking, down with one hand and whispered into his ear, “Xia, you need to follow me. Remember, don’t rush to the front easily.","“I hope that after tonight, you and I will still be alive.” Tonight was the last time he and Xia would be partners. After tonight, there would be no ‘Luke’.","Luke wasn’t his real name.","Xia Jinyuan was grateful for Luke’s reminder. He knew that Luke didn’t want anything to happen to him, which was why he kept reminding him.","Smiling, he said calmly, “Nothing will happen to you and me.”","“That’s right, buddy. Nothing will happen to us. You have to follow me closely, understand? Follow me closely so that nothing will happen.” Luke smiled too. This time, he didn’t whisper so that Cobra, who was behind, could hear him.","That was right. Nothing would happen to them. Cobra believed that nothing would happen to him.","They had already passed through the long corridor that led to the back garden on the first floor. The power of the hotel was cut off, and all their actions were carried out in the dark. It was dark in front, and the back was also dark. No one knew if there was any hidden danger in the darkness. Everyone was tense, and they would shoot if there was the slightest movement."]},{"number":4142,"title":"Chapter 4142: Release","paragraphs":["Chapter 4142: Release","Just like now...","The guy in front suddenly heard sounds of frightened breathing from the corner. Without thinking, he pulled the trigger. After several gunshots, the person in the corner was no longer breathing.","No one specially looked at the person in the corner. Even Xia Jinyuan didn’t look at him much. It wasn’t that he was cold-blooded. It was just that sometimes, he couldn’t be kind.","He couldn’t choose to be kind. He could only choose to be cold-blooded.","He was furious with Cobra’s arrangements to kill the hotel’s guests. As a soldier, he wanted to save the innocent guests too. But could he?","He couldn’t.","He couldn’t save anyone. He couldn’t interfere. The only thing he could do was kill the instigator of all the tragedies so that he wouldn’t harm innocent people again!","A faint green light appeared in front of them. That was the sign for the exit. It was also the sign for people who usually used fire escapes. The guy covering them in front quickened his pace.","Xia Jinyuan stopped and said to Cobra behind him, “Let them take a look first.”","Standing in front of him, Luke frowned a little. It looked like he still needed to think of a way to shake off Xia, who was very loyal to Cobra.","He didn’t want to go against Xia. The best way was to shake him off.","Cobra’s men stuck close to the fire door. Two of them turned their bodies and held their guns while on guard. The other two slowly pulled open the heavy fire door.","Boom!","The fire devoured the two fellows who opened the door. They didn’t even have the time to make a sound... They were killed on the spot.","The heavy fire door was sent flying like a thin wooden door by the airwaves. It hit the other two guys who were on guard with guns. Screams of pain sounded from the flames and echoed to the front of the corridor.","The explosion and screams made the people at the front stop in their tracks. Two armed police officers shielded Qin Xiu and immediately went back the way they came. In the end, they hid under the fire escape corridor.","They climbed out of the bathroom window and slowly retreated to the second floor. They wanted to retreat to the first floor, but they saw five people wearing government military uniforms in the corner below the first floor. They were sneaking in with guns.","It was not safe to look for the government forces!","Qin Xiu made a prompt decision and immediately infiltrated from the second floor. Then, he sneaked back to the first floor bit by bit, planning to leave from the back garden to the parking lot.","Unexpectedly, an explosion came from the exit leading to the back garden.","Qin Xiu and the rest didn’t move anymore. Xia Jinyuan and Luke fired as they covered Cobra and rushed into the back garden. The three bodyguards brought up the rear and retreated to the parking lot.","“Shoot.”","On the rockery in the back garden, the observer told the sniper about the situation ahead. The sniper from Signal Flag started sniping the three bodyguards.","According to the information, Cobra’s personal bodyguards were the first targets to be eliminated.","The sniper, who wouldn’t waste bullets, moved. The first shot hit accurately. A bodyguard shielding Cobra was shot in the head and died.","“There’s an ambush!” Luke growled. Xia Jinyuan, who reacted the fastest, pulled tCobra over and hid under the chair in the back garden.","“There’s only one bullet left. We’ve met a sniper,” he said coldly. His gaze swept around like a hawk. Cobra, who was hunched over, looked around with a dark gaze. Then, he said to Xia Jinyuan, “Xia, did you find anything?”","“I realized that these people are all here for you,” Xia Jinyuan replied truthfully. “Your whereabouts have been leaked.”","That was right. That was what Cobra was thinking now."]},{"number":4143,"title":"Chapter 4143: Massacre","paragraphs":["Chapter 4143: Massacre","“Who do you think it is?” asked Cobra.","Xia Jinyuan shook his head. “I don’t know.”","“Luke, he brought me here just now.” Cobra sneered. At the same time, he pressed the gun in his hand against Xia Jinyuan’s back. “Xia, you discussed this with Luke, right?”","Xia Jinyuan didn’t feel much when the muzzle of the gun was pressed against his back.","Cobra was just testing him. If Cobra really thought so, he wouldn’t have asked at all. He would have shot Xia Jinyuan directly without giving him any chance to explain.","But Cobra had asked, so he was just probing.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t even turn his head back. He stared at every corner like an arrow. He was in even more danger than Cobra now. The special forces soldiers from Signal Flag only wanted to catch Cobra alive. But they would clean up the people around him.","“Boss, there are snipers outside and enemies stronger than us. The probability of us rushing out is very small. What should we do?” Xia Jinyuan wasn’t afraid and spoke calmly as usual.","Cobra narrowed his snake-like eyes. Then, he retracted his gun. “I’ll get everyone inside to come over. It’s not difficult to leave.”","He didn’t suspect Xia anymore. After all, Xia had too many opportunities to attack him.","On several occasions when he went out, Xia kept watch for him alone. If Xia really wanted to kill him, there were too many opportunities. There was no need to go through so much trouble.","It was very likely that it was Luke.","However, he couldn’t think of a reason why Luke wanted to kill him. He had been with him for six years. If Luke wanted to kill him, he had many chances as well.","However, Cobra’s instincts told him that the biggest suspect was Luke, a subordinate who had been with him for six years.","“Luke has retreated to the hotel. He’s probably looking for someone to break out of the encirclement.”","Xia Jinyuan, who was looking around, said coldly. Cobra, who suspected Luke just now, held his breath. Wasn’t it Luke?","Who else could it be but Luke?","“Who leaked my whereabouts?” Cobra asked sinisterly.","Xia Jinyuan remained silent for a while. “We’re not the only ones who know about this trip. People in the company know about it too. The people in the underground market know too. This trip isn’t a secret. Too many people know about it.”","The pressure around Cobra dropped even more.","That was right. His trip this time was not a secret. Too many people knew about it. He instinctively felt that there was something wrong with Luke because he was the one who suggested retreating to the back garden.","Based on the situation at that time, retreating to the back garden was the best choice.","It wasn’t Luke but someone else.","Cobra, who always had a sharp judgment of things, finally put down his suspicion because of Xia Jinyuan’s words. Xia Jinyuan didn’t even defend Luke.","An explanation was a quibble. Since that was the way Cobra thought, why should Xia Jinyuan explain?","Xia Jinyuan, who had learned psychology, always talked to Cobra based on Cobra’s personality. He would apply the things he learned.","The reason why Luke wanted the ‘rioters’ to come out was simple. He didn’t want them to kill the innocent guests of the hotel.","He was a soldier. He could only use his best efforts to save the innocent guests.","Xia Jinyuan spoke up for Luke because they were both soldiers. They didn’t want to see the guests die at gunpoint. If there was a chance to save them, they would.","The rioters in the hotel quickly rushed down from all levels. At this moment, they had already been counter-attacked by the government forces who had barged in. Just when they blocked the corridor and could not rush out in time, the rioters who pretended to infiltrate the government troops shot from behind."]},{"number":4144,"title":"Chapter 4144: Block The News","paragraphs":["Chapter 4144: Block The News","The gunshots and miserable screams from the corridor on the first floor of the hotel were like hell on earth. Bullets were fired at close range, and the smell of burnt meat floated in the bloody smoke. It was nauseating.","For a moment, the Russian Signal Flag special forces thought that their intelligence officer had betrayed them. They only felt slightly at ease when the signal tracker appeared in the back garden again.","They all knew that the intelligence officer who infiltrated the target had been lurking for as long as six years. Six years was too long. Before the mission, the military officer told them vaguely that if they realized that the intelligence officer couldn’t come back successfully, then... they should let him stay in Molaban.","This meant that if they discovered anything amiss with the intelligence officer, they would kill him.","However, the captain firmly believed that there wouldn’t be a problem with his team member and comrade. He asked the rest of his team not to attack blindly no matter what happened. They had to confirm if there was really anything wrong before they could attack.","The sniper saw Luke through his scope. He said in Russian, “Everything’s normal.” Then, he continued to look for their target.","The rioters in the hotel were all bloodthirsty. They only believed in killing, and Cobra was the source of their killing. They didn’t know who Cobra was. Now, they only knew that Cobra was in the back garden and needed them to cover their retreat.","After returning to the hotel, Luke communicated with the person in charge of the riot. His voice was a little loud. The rioters, who didn’t know that Cobra was in the hotel’s back garden, were agitated.","The guy who was commanding the riot said to Luke, “Damn you, brainless fellow. Do you know that you’ve exposed the boss’ identity? I really want to rip off your head and kick it into the sea to feed the fish!”","Luke didn’t care at all. If the communication wasn’t blocked, he wouldn’t have risked returning to the hotel to inform this... fellow who would die soon!","In order to prevent the rioters in the hotel from contacting the outside world at any time, the government forces blocked all communication in the hotel.","They blocked the entire hotel’s communication and... stopped the guests from asking for help. It was equivalent to blocking the news.","Luke had no choice but to return to the hotel to inform the fellow who had been secretly commanding the riot.","The rioters who rushed into the back garden didn’t care if there was anyone in front of them. They fired blindly with their rifles. Behind them was Cobra.","Two more bodyguards beside Cobra were killed. Now, there was only one more bodyguard to cover for Cobra. Xia Jinyuan and Luke protected Cobra on his left and right respectively.","The Signal Flag special forces soldiers wouldn’t shoot blindly. They would only fire at specific targets. When the bullets swept past, a few people immediately fell.","The special forces soldiers, who were all guarding the best shooting positions in the back garden, felt as though they were playing a game of Whac-A-Mole. They fired point by point, destroying the firepower that was protecting Cobra.","Xia Jinyuan noticed that the soldiers were killing the people around Cobra one by one. His black eyes darkened slightly. He knew that his chance was here.","He would leave the small fries to Signal Flag. As for him, he would be in charge of destroying the biggest fish.","Captain Xia finally revealed a familiar roguish smile on his thin lips. As he listened to the dense gunshots that kept flying past his ears, his slender and tall body instantly became abnormally strong. He pulled a fellow who was shouting loudly and used him as a shield. He retreated with his footsteps and went behind the huge rocks planted with tall cactuses on both sides."]},{"number":4145,"title":"Chapter 4145: Perfection","paragraphs":["Chapter 4145: Perfection","From his point of view, Cobra was within his shooting range.","The guy he took over as a shield fell into the low cactus bushes. He was not completely dead yet. His entire body was twitching, and he was vomiting blood. He was making muffled sounds from his throat.","He wanted to say something, but unfortunately, he would never be able to.","Xia Jinyuan bent down and quickly picked up the rifle that had fallen into the cactus bushes. He hid behind a huge rock.","He only had one chance to shoot. He needed to kill Cobra. There was no second chance.","The special forces soldiers from Signal Flag were not to be trifled with. They would not let him have a second chance to shoot.","Luke realized that his partner, Xia, was forced by the firepower to somewhere he couldn’t follow. In the faint night, only bullets were flashing past, and his partner was nowhere to be seen.","He was a little anxious. He shouted amidst the dense gunfire, “Xia, follow me! Hurry!”","Last time, he had already given up on his partner in Myanmar. This time, he wouldn’t give up again!","When Cobra heard this, he turned around abruptly... He thought that he would see his loyal subordinate. Unexpectedly, a bullet passed through his forehead with incomparable precision, shattering his skull and escaping from the back of his head.","The sky seemed to have collapsed. The ground seemed to be spinning. Cobra only had time to blink before he fell to the ground.","There was no time for him to recall the start of his life. He didn’t even have time to breathe. He just fell to the ground. There was no possibility of saving him.","The special forces soldiers from Signal Flag flag saw their main target fall to the ground. This shocked them. How could something that couldn’t happen, happen?","Cobra was dead!","Luke didn’t know if he was seeing things. If not, why did he see a black shadow passing behind the rock that looked so much like his partner, Xia?","Did Xia shoot Cobra?","Was that possible?","No!!!","That was impossible!","Xia was loyal to Cobra. That was why Luke was worried that Xia would be killed by the special forces soldiers from Signal fFag. That was why Luke asked Xia to follow closely behind him.","Xia was so loyal to Cobra. How could he kill him?","Luke must be seeing things. He must be!","Cobra had already fallen, and it was time for the special forces soldiers to retreat. They no longer cared if the bullets would hit Cobra and started to carve a path for their intelligence officer.","This sudden fierce battle lasted for an hour. Blood flowed like a river in the hotel, and it was the same with the back garden of the hotel.","Xia Jinyuan retreated into the hotel. It was time for him to escape.","He took off his bulletproof vest and blended into the crowd of guests who were being taken care of by the government forces. Like the frightened guests, he hurried out of the hotel with footsteps and got into a car under the command of the government forces.","He had an Asian face, so no one would suspect him of being a rioter. However, because he had an Asian face, Qin Xiu, who was passing by the crowd in a car, saw him at a glance.","The car stopped, and an armed police officer jumped down. He took out his work pass and walked past the government forces to Xia Jinyuan’s side.","There were small lights on in the car. When he saw the young soldier whose face and hands were stained with blood, Qin Xiu pursed his lips and took out a packet of wet tissue from his pocket.","He had taken this packet of wet tissue from the front desk of the hotel just now. He only used two pieces to wipe his hands.","“Thank you.” Xia Jinyuan took the wet tissue and wiped his face and hands.","“What can I help with?” Qin Xiu asked.","Xia Jinyuan, who was wiping his face, paused. A faint smile appeared on his clean and handsome face. “The next plane ticket back to the country. Thank you.”","Qin Xiu snorted. Damn it! ‘You’re welcome, Xia Jinyuan!’","“Sure,” was his reply."]},{"number":4146,"title":"Chapter 4146: Peaceful","paragraphs":["Chapter 4146: Peaceful","Qin Xiu had his freedom. If Xia Jinyuan needed to return to the country, he would immediately make arrangements in the car and book a ticket for Xia Jinyuan. After all, he was a staff member of the embassy.","“Yes, take off tomorrow at 9:11 am at Sebe Airport... Yes, make the arrangements as soon as possible. I’ll return to Molaban.”","Qin Xiu, who was on the phone with the embassy, had elegant eyebrows and a gentle aura. His temperament was clearly cold, but his facial expression was as gentle as jade. This was probably the best interpretation of being polite and distant at the same time.","After ending the call, the gentleness in his elegant eyes dissipated. He looked coldly at Xia Jinyuan, who was still wiping his fingers with a wet tissue. He didn’t speak immediately. As Xia Jinyuan’s slender fingers moved, his gaze landed on his fingers.","He seemed to have thought of something and pursed his lips.","These hands...","They could hold Ye Jian’s hands openly and hug her. Xia Jinyuan didn’t have to worry about rejection, unlike him... who didn’t even have a glimmer of hope.","Qin Xiu closed his eyes and cut off his vision. When he opened them again, he looked out of the car window.","“The plane leaves at 9:11 am tomorrow. I’ll rush back to Molaban overnight. You can go back to the country now, Xia Jinyuan.”","You can go back to the country and look for Ye Jian. You can go back and tell her that everything is over and let her feel at ease.","‘You can return to the country to accompany her and share the pressure with her.","‘Xia Jinyuan, you’re the man beside her. Take good care of her. Don’t make her sad. Don’t make her cry. Don’t... let her clench her hands on her knees until her wrists hurt. Don’t give me a chance either. Don’t let me have an opportunity.’","The street lamps were pillars of light that swept past the black sedan. There were shadows of people. Xia Jinyuan wiped the blood off his hands and looked up. From the street lamps, he saw Qin Xiu’s cold expression and the corners of his mouth. From the looks of it... Yes, he was sulking. Perhaps Qin Xiu was still scolding him in his heart for being shameless.","They were love rivals. Before this, they could coexist peacefully with each other. Now that the crisis was resolved, Xia Jinyuan naturally had to climb out of the trench.","Above the trench was Xia Jinyuan, and below the trench was Qin Xiu. One of them could return to the country to look for Ye Jian, while the other would have to continue exploring the trench. He wouldn’t be able to climb out for a while.","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and didn’t comment.","However, the smile on his face had already revealed what he was thinking. He was happy.","He had foresight. He noticed that even the small provincial city couldn’t trap Ye Jian. He also noticed that the little fox that he watched grow up would definitely shine in the future. He noticed her intentions and confirmed them. Hence, he immediately made a move to prevent himself from missing the first opportunity.","Brilliant, too brilliant!","If he hadn’t wooed the little fox in advance, he might not have won against Qin Xiu.","Qin Xiu was outstanding in all aspects. His demeanor, boldness, appearance, family background, academics, career... He was truly an outstanding man who had all the right advantages. Such a powerful love rival really made Xia Jinyuan nervous.","Fortunately, he was a gentleman. Qin Xiu didn’t do anything to take advantage of the situation. Even though he was flustered, he still took the big picture into consideration and immediately prepared a plane ticket for Xia Jinyuan to return to the country.","After putting aside all the dirtied wet tissue, Xia Jinyuan smiled and said, “Thank you.”","“No need.” Qin Xiu turned his head and glanced over. He replied in a cold voice, “I’m not doing it because of you. It’s because of the country behind us.”","“I know, but I still have to thank you,” Xia Jinyuan replied elegantly.","Qin Xiu decided not to say anything else. It was tiring."]},{"number":4147,"title":"Chapter 4147: Vanished","paragraphs":["Chapter 4147: Vanished","The car arrived at a blockade. The armed police officer who was driving took out his work pass and handed it to the police. After a careful inspection, the police officer used the flashlight that was too bright to open his eyes and politely knocked on the window of the back seat.","“Hello, Mr. Ambassador. We need to inspect your vehicle. Please cooperate with us. Thank you.”","Qin Xiu glanced at him and raised his hand to lower the window. His handsome side profile was revealed. He looked straight ahead and said calmly, “Two staff members plus me. There are three people in total. Please check.”","There was only one armed police officer driving in the car and one sitting in the front passenger seat. Qin Xiu was sitting alone in the back. He looked a little cold and didn’t seem to be in a good mood.","The policeman could feel that the Chinese ambassador was in a bad mood. It was understandable that he was in a bad mood after he saw rioters killing the hotel guests.","Understanding the reason for his bad mood was one thing. But the inspection had to continue.","The inspection had to continue, but the policeman couldn’t ask everyone in the car to come down and cooperate with their inspection like what he did with everyone else. The policeman said, “I’m sorry to disturb you.” Then, he asked his colleagues to continue checking the car.","If he really asked the Chinese ambassador to get out of the car, he had a feeling that things would take a really awful turn.","Qin Xiu finally turned his head and looked at the policeman. The coldness on his face dissipated a little as he nodded slightly. The policeman, who received Qin Xiu’s gaze, couldn’t help but heave a sigh of relief. He hurriedly smiled apologetically again.","The two police officers who were checking the car didn’t miss any corner. They even opened the trunk of the car and checked carefully. After confirming that there were no abnormalities, the police officers walked to the car door again and saluted Qin Xiu. They waved the electric police baton in their hands and let the car pass.","The car slowly drove away from the blockade and drove for at least 500 meters. After confirming that there were no police officers following them, the car drove to a dark place on the street. The door to the back seat opened, and Xia Jinyuan returned to the car from under the chassis.","The car door closed, and they drove through the night to Molaban.","The country had already received the latest news. Cobra had been successfully killed. Special forces soldier, Xia Jinyuan, who had been undercover for almost a year and a half, would return to the country tomorrow at 9:11 am.","There was no direct flight. He would first go to Wenhua Airport before flying back to the capital city. The entire journey would take 14 hours.","It was now the 3rd of May. In China, it was 4:00 pm on the 3rd of May. There were still three hours before Ye Jian’s three days and two nights of outdoor survival training ended. The students needed to reach the finishing point before 6:00 pm.","Ye Jian, who was undergoing outdoor survival training, didn’t receive the news that Xia Jinyuan had returned to the country. Luke, who had returned to the hotel, was looking for his partner.","From the back garden to the hotel, he searched every corner from three in the morning to six in the morning. He didn’t find his partner.","He wasn’t one of the survivors, wasn’t one of the corpses lying in a pool of blood, and wasn’t one of the patients in the hospital.","Nothing. Nothing at all.","His best partner had disappeared into thin air. He couldn’t be found at all.","Was he the one who shot Cobra?","Luke just wanted to ask if he was the one who shot Cobra.","Luke just wanted to ask who he was.","Luke just wanted to ask if he knew his identity and cooperated secretly.","Luke just wanted to ask... There were too many things he wanted to ask. Luke, who had returned to the car to reunite with his comrades from the special forces, looked a little blank."]},{"number":4148,"title":"Chapter 4148 Irony","paragraphs":["Chapter 4148: Irony Chapter 4148: Irony Editor: Henyee Translations Luke thought that he would be very excited after everything was over.","Yes, he was very excited now, but there seemed to be a corner of his heart that was empty.","He felt a little cold and disappointed.","He wanted to ask his partner and understand each other better.","Perhaps he could also confess his identity.","From the moment his partner raised his gun and killed Cobra, they could have a chat like that.","Unfortunately, Xia didn’t give them a chance to chat.","He disappeared just like that.","In the car, the special forces soldiers from Russia had already contacted the country.","They changed their equipment in the car and were inspected like ordinary passengers before leaving the blockade.","Outside the car, the bright sunlight shone on the city.","The sky was as blue as water.","Everything was so peaceful under the clean sky.","It was as if the riot in the early morning never happened at all.","The pedestrians on the street came and went.","The cars on the street were endless.","There were still smiles on the pedestrians’ faces as they walked leisurely on the street.","They were not affected by the riot.","Perhaps they were used to it.","The north was the most chaotic place in their country.","There would always be a few riots every month.","The citizens of the entire country were already used to them.","There were the least riots in the south because that was the central image of Molaban.","Although riots occasionally made people afraid, they believed that the military would settle them appropriately.","However, they didn’t expect the most famous entrepreneur and philanthropist, Mr.","Krone, to die in this riot.","When the people heard the news, they raised their flags and protested.","They asked the government to find all the rioters who killed Mr.","Krone to serve justice.","Sitting in the car, Luke’s gaze landed on the two women who were holding the photos of Cobra.","He suppressed the disappointment in his heart and smiled coldly.","If they knew that the so-called philanthropist, Mr.","Krone, was actually a demon, they would be very sad.","They only saw what Cobra was like on the surface and were deceived for so many years.","Now, it was clear that they had gotten rid of a huge problem, but the unsuspecting citizens still wanted to seek an explanation for that bastard.","It was ironic.","Fortunately, Cobra was dead.","This was the happiest thing for him now.","Luke was so happy that he could temporarily fill the hole in his heart.","Xia! A mysterious fellowâ€”Asian, tall, handsome, money-loving, silent, cold! This was the Xia he knew.","In that case, what would the real Xia be like?","Luke exhaled softly.","He didn’t know what kind of person the real ‘Xia’ was.","He was too mysterious.","Luke probably never really understood Xia.","Not in the past, and definitely not in the future.","Perhaps he and his partner, Xia, would never meet again.","“Cobra was killed by a stray bullet and died on the spot.","All the bodyguards around him were killed.","The Signal Flag intelligence officer, Luke, completed his infiltration and will be returning to the country.” When the Russian side received the news from the frontline, they were both happy and regretful.","A certain someone’s eyes were so gloomy that he even broke the fountain pen in his hand.","He was dead.","Cobra wasn’t sent back to Russia alive.","He was dead!","“Damn it!” The information Cobra had in hand also included underground businesses in various other countries, and he needed to find someone to take over!","The death of Cobra not only angered the high-ranking Russian official, but also the president of a certain Western country who had always supported Cobra.","He was so angry that he smashed the folder."]},{"number":4149,"title":"Chapter 4149 Sick","paragraphs":["Chapter 4149: Sick Chapter 4149: Sick Editor: Henyee Translations At eight in the morning, Xia Jinyuan took the passport and plane ticket that the embassy had prepared for him.","He also carried the luggage that was prepared for him.","As he walked, he raised his hand and gestured for Qin Xiu, who had sent him to the airport, to go back.","Qin Xiu looked at the departing figure expressionlessly.","He didn’t leave immediately.","He waited until the plane took off.","When he didn’t receive any news from Xia Jinyuan, he left the airport.","The documents that the embassy prepared for Xia Jinyuan were all real.","Besides his personal information, the documents and materials! were all real.","At 9:11 am on the 3rd of May, the commander of the Xueyu unit, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had left the country for almost a year and a half, successfully completed his mission and returned to the country.","The third-year students from the National Science University completed their three days and two nights of outdoor survival training.","They took a train back to school at 10:00 pm on the 3rd of May.","The night was very quiet.","The sound of the train didn’t wake up the students who started sleeping after getting on the train.","They were too tired.","They hadn’t been eating or drinking well during the three days and two nights of outdoor survival training.","They hadn’t been sleeping well either.","A few students even fell sick halfway through the training.","They had to grit their teeth to complete the training.","For the students who had never undergone such training, this was a mental training.","Now that they were on the train, everyone felt relieved.","They leaned on each other and slept soundly.","Ye Jian, who wasn’t sleeping, paid attention to the four sick studentsâ€”including He Jing.","It was strange that Xu Wen was fine and He Jing, who had always had a good physique, fell sick.","She started having a high fever in the day and a low fever in the afternoon.","Now! Ye Jian reached out and touched He Jing’s forehead.","It was still a low fever.","Their class and another class were in the same carriage.","Each class sent four students to complete the guard duty tonight.","Ye Jian was responsible for the period from 1:00 am to 2:00 am, which was the time when everyone was the sleepiest.","She walked over from one end of the carriage while the male student from the other class walked over from the other end.","When they reached the middle, the two of them smiled and returned.","The entire journey lasted for only five hours.","They got on the train at 10:00 pm and arrived at the train station at 3:00 am.","The bus arranged by the school to fetch the students was already at the train station.","At 3:00 am, the provincial city was exceptionally quiet.","The students who walked out of the exit in an orderly manner stunned the people standing outside to fetch them.","The scene was a little awkward.","The 14 students who were unwell boarded the same bus.","Ye Jian accompanied He Jing, who had a low fever and was coughing.","Song Zhiqiu was in charge of the class matters.","The bus with the sick students left the train station first and went straight to the hospital.","He Jing was a little confused from her fever.","One moment, she was shouting Ye Jian’s name, and the next moment, she was shouting Xu Wen’s name.","It was either her father or mother! As for the name of her boyfriend, she never called him once.","Ye Jian, who was accompanying He Jing on the bed, ran up and down.","She didn’t have time to lie down until He Jing was on the bed.","He Jing only woke up after nine in the morning.","She no longer felt light-headed.","When she opened her eyes, she saw Xu Wen writing something with a pen while Ye Jian was sleeping on the bed beside."]},{"number":4150,"title":"Chapter 4150 Happiness","paragraphs":["Chapter 4150: Happiness Chapter 4150: Happiness Editor: Henyee Translations Although she was a little muddle-headed from the fever, He Jing still knew that Ye Jian had been taking care of her.","Xu Wen, who seemed to have noticed something, looked up.","He Jing shushed her softly and asked Xu Wen to lower her voice so that she wouldn’t wake Ye Jian up.","Ye Jian had always been vigilant.","Even the slightest movement could wake her up.","As the captain, she was even more tired than the students these few days.","She didn’t rest at all and came to the hospital to take care of He Jing.","The green shadow under Ye Jian’s eyes was so heavy that He Jing’s heart ached.","Xu Wen nodded and stood up.","She mouthed, “I’ll call the doctor.","Lie down.” She tiptoed out of the ward.","Ye Jian, who didn’t wake up, continued to sleep.","She only woke up when the doctor pushed the door open.","Seeing the doctor enter, Ye Jian stood up from the bed.","She looked at He Jing and saw that her cheeks were a little rosy.","Even her eyes were clearer.","She knew that He Jing had recovered.","After all, Ye Jian had been in medical school before, so she more or less knew a little.","Seeing that Ye Jian was woken up, Xu Wen leaned over and asked in a low voice, “Did you sleep well?” “I slept well.","I’m energetic,” Ye Jian replied softly so that she wouldn’t disturb the doctor.","The doctor listened to He Jing’s heart and lungs.","Then, he smiled and said, “It’s good to be young.","After a few bottles of IV drip and a good sleep, your condition has improved greatly.","Continue the IV drip this afternoon and stay in the hospital for three days.","I’ll then examine you again to see if you can be discharged.” As the doctor spoke, he wrote furiously in the medical record book.","When He Jing heard that she would be hospitalized for three days, she immediately started calculating.","Fortunately, this wouldn’t affect her classes.","The doctor gave some instructions and left with the nurse.","After closing the door, Xu Wen poured a glass of water for each He Jing and Ye Jian.","She said, “What do you want to eat?","I’ll go downstairs to buy it.","You can only eat light food.","I think plain porridge will do.” This was directed at He Jing.","She said to Ye Jian, “Do you want something spicy?” “I’ll have the same.","If I eat anything else, she’ll be tempted,” Ye Jian said with a smile.","There was no food in the ward now, but He Jing was already craving for good food.","The two girls stayed in the hospital for two days.","Xu Wen was so relaxed that she didn’t want to return to the military school.","Commander Xia called Ye Jian a few times consecutively, but her cell phone was turned off.","He only knew that Ye Jian had gone to the hospital to take care of the sick students when he contacted the department.","After hanging up, Major General Yang, who was also in the office, smiled and said, “It doesn’t matter if they can’t contact each other.","After Ah Yuan comes back and reports to the military, he’ll immediately fly straight to the National Science University to look for Ye Jian.” Although Major General Yang didn’t expose the relationship between the two young people, he had already seen everything.","There was nothing that made him happier than this couple.","They were a strong combination.","They complemented each other.","Not only did they not allow themselves to fall behind just because of their relationship, but they were also able to improve together and climb the peak.","Major General Yang felt that if he stopped such a relationship, he would become a heinous sinner.","It was already 1:30 pm on the 5th of May.","Q King, who had left for almost a year and a half, was almost at the military headquarters.","Xia Jinyuan arrived at the capital city at 1:00 am on the 5th of May.","He got off the plane and stood in this familiar land that he loved deeply.","Even someone as calm as him felt his heart flutter.","After hundreds of days and nights, he had finally returned.","Familiar buildings, familiar crowds, familiar cars, familiar environment! Even the blue sky was so familiar.","He came back alive to feel the ‘familiarity’ of everything in the country."]},{"number":4151,"title":"Chapter 4151 Good To Be Alive","paragraphs":["Chapter 4151: Good To Be Alive Chapter 4151: Good To Be Alive Editor: Henyee Translations It was good to be alive!","There was hope, challenges, a future, sunlight, wind, and rain! One could only feel everything when one was alive.","And he had come back alive again.","How great!","Outside the airport, the two guards looked at the time and glanced around to avoid missing the important person they were picking up today.","They didn’t know who the important person was or what the other party had done.","They only knew that they had to pick him up and bring him back to the military immediately.","Xia Jinyuan walked out of the exit and went straight to the parking lot.","He knew that two guards were here to pick him up and knew the car’s license plate number.","Before he got on his transfer flight, he called the country and was informed in advance.","The guards couldn’t find Xia Jinyuan, who was wearing casual clothes, and didn’t have a contact method.","The best way was to stand at the agreed location and wait patiently.","Soon, they saw a man wearing an ordinary white shirt and black pants.","Even though the man was still standing on the stairs, his familiar aura could not be concealed by his casual clothes.","That was the important person they wanted to fetch.","He was a very young soldier.","He wasn’t even 30 years old.","Xia Jinyuan, who was coming down the stairs, looked up slightly and saw the two guards who were greeting him.","As they looked at each other, their identities were confirmed.","At 1:45 pm, Xia Jinyuan stood under the military building.","The bright red flag fluttered in the wind in front of him.","A row of golden words flickered under the sunlight.","Xia Jinyuan took a deep breath and suppressed the tears in his eyes.","He strode into the military building with his head held high.","Then, he took the elevator to the corresponding floor.","Entering the floor required fingerprint and facial verification.","After getting the green light, the guard with a gun saluted and allowed him to pass.","After walking through the quiet and stern corridor, he arrived at the door of an office.","He raised his hand and knocked lightly.","When he retracted his hand, Xia Jinyuan vaguely heard the sound of a chair overturning.","His gaze tightened.","He held the door handle and pressed it down.","When he pushed the door open, he saw his father standing behind the long and wide desk with two bright red flags.","From the looks of it, he wanted to welcome him personally.","As for overturning the chair! Major General Yang had already walked over.","He was a little excited as he raised his hand and patted Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder heavily.","He couldn’t hide his joy and said, “Good, good, good!","Well done this time!” Commander Xia had a smile on his face too.","He sat back on the chair that he overturned when he was not paying attention.","His soldierly eyes were filled with a rare gentleness as he looked at his only son who had returned safely.","Little Six was back.","He came back safe and sound.","Commander Xia, who was sitting back in his chair, placed his trembling hands under his desk to avoid being seen by the two of them.","Old Yang was fine, but the bastard at home might bicker with him again.","Xia Jinyuan saluted Commander Xia and Major General Yang.","He stood straight like a spear and gave a simple report.","He picked the main points, including the participation of the Russian Signal Flag unit.","In the end, he said, “I still need to rest first before completing the written report.","Please give me five days to complete the written report.” Major General Yang raised his eyebrows and exchanged glances with Commander Xia.","Look, he had guessed correctly.","Rest?","Yes, he would rest.","However, he would never stay in the capital city to rest.","He was just in a hurry to look for Ye Jian."]},{"number":4152,"title":"Chapter 4152 Time Stops","paragraphs":["Chapter 4152: Time Stops Chapter 4152: Time Stops Editor: Henyee Translations Commander Xia glanced at Xia Jinyuan, who was in a hurry to leave and didn’t want to stay by his father’s side for another minute.","He drank his tea unhurriedly.","Oh, his cup was empty.","He needed to refill it.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had always been tactful, didn’t need his father’s instructions.","He hurriedly picked up his cup and poured more tea for Commander Xia.","Then, he poured a cup of tea for Major General Yang as well.","He smiled and said, “You guys aren’t so petty that you won’t give me five days of leave.","I really need to rest.","If not, I’m afraid that I’ll suffer from the sequela of post-war trauma and it’ll affect my future development.","“You two probably can’t bear to see me sick and unable to carry out missions in the future, right?” Major General Yang took a sip of tea and asked calmly, “You only need five days of leave?” “15 days is fine too.","Let’s see how you guys wanna arrange it for me.” Who was Xia Jinyuan?","When he heard that there was a chance, he felt that he could rest for a while more.","Of course, he had to fight for it!","Commander Xia took a sip of tea and finally opened his mouth.","“I’ll give you ten days of leave.","Arrange it well.","No matter what, you have to drop by home.","As for the others, you can arrange it yourself.” “Yes, Commander!” Xia Jinyuan hurriedly saluted and rushed out of the military.","When he reached the door, he turned his head and smiled at Commander Xia.","“Commander, the tea is hot.","Stop your hand from trembling or you’ll hurt yourself.” After he finished speaking, he opened the door and left.","Xia Jinyuan stayed in the military for an hour, including the oral report time.","His heart was already at the National Science University.","His body was just waiting to join the heart.","Commander Xia put down his cup of tea and scolded him jokingly, “This brat needs a beating.” After he finished speaking, he and Major General Yang laughed loudly.","Wasn’t Xia Jinyuan asking for a beating?","But they wouldn’t beat him up.","Someone else would beat him up.","They would just wait for the good news.","After returning to the old residence, Xia Jinyuan planned to spend the night with the old master and the old madam.","Unexpectedly! an hour after returning home, he was chased out of the house by the two elderly.","They even arranged for a driver to send him to the airport.","The old madam stood outside the car and smiled at the grandson she liked.","“Little Ye will graduate in a year.","Whether you can get married the moment she graduates depends on how capable you are.” She had been looking forward to the young couple’s reunion.","Xia Jinyuan should hurry up and look for his future wife.","Why should he stay at home?","Xia Jinyuan, who was heading to the airport, contacted Ye Jian first.","Her cell phone was turned off, so he called the school to ask around.","He found out that the woman he loved was accompanying her sick comrade in the hospital.","After getting off the plane at 1:00 am, Xia Jinyuan called the hospital directly.","He could finally meet the woman he had been missing day and night!","It was already 2:00 am when he arrived at the hospital.","Xia Jinyuan showed his identification document and found the floor and ward number of the student, He Jing.","He almost jogged into the elevator.","As the numbers on the elevator changed, Xia Jinyuan felt his heart beating faster and faster.","He was getting more and more nervous.","Even his palms were sweating.","Soon, soon, soon! He stared at the changing numbers of the elevator.","Ye Jian, who was sleeping on the bed, rolled over a few times and got up from the bed.","She planned to walk outside.","She probably slept too much during the day and couldn’t sleep at night.","The elevator doors opened just as the ward door opened.","One of them walked toward the ward while the other carefully closed the door and prepared to leave.","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing at the front of the corridor, stopped in his tracks.","He had already seen the person he had been missing day and night.","Ye Jian, who had closed the door, stopped in her action of closing the door.","She felt a gaze on her.","It was deep and familiar.","She slowly turned around until the most familiar figure appeared in her eyes.","At that moment, time stopped."]},{"number":4153,"title":"Chapter 4153 I’m Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 4153: I’m Back Chapter 4153: I’m Back Editor: Henyee Translations At night, the hospital corridor was very quiet.","It was so quiet that they could hear each other’s breathing even from ten meters away.","The moment their gazes met, their hearts pounded furiously.","There was pain, sourness, bitterness, and some feelings that could not be expressed with thousands of words.","In the quiet space, they looked at each other for a long time.","Their gazes seemed to go back countless years in time.","The two of them seemed to have walked through the sandstorm of the Gobi desert.","After crawling through the endless yellow sand, they saw the oasis when they were exhausted.","They also saw each other standing at the other end of the oasis.","Ye Jian felt that her vision was a little blurry.","She even wondered if she was dreaming.","If not, why was she seeing Captain Xia after getting out of bed after not being able to sleep?","She blinked lightly.","Her blurry vision cleared up a little.","The tall figure was still there.","She blinked again.","He was still there.","It wasn’t a dream.","Her lover, whom she had been waiting for day and night, was finally back!","There were still about ten meters between them.","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t see Ye Jian blinking, but he felt that Ye Jian, who was still holding the door handle, couldn’t believe what she was seeing.","She didn’t believe that he had come back.","Right now, Ye Jian believed it.","She could clearly see that the figure standing in front was her Captain Xia, the man she loved deeply.","Time stopped.","Ye Jian smiled when she saw the man walking toward her.","He was mouthing the words to her, ‘Don’t move.","‘Don’t move, my love.","I’m back.","I’m back to find you.","‘Don’t move.","Just stand there.","I told you I’d definitely come back alive to look for you.’ How could he dare to go back on his word?","‘You’ll be here.","As for me, I’ll walk through thousands of mountains and rivers to return to your side safely.","‘Because you’re there!’ Ye Jian didn’t move.","She stood at the door of the ward and waited for her lover to walk toward her step by step.","He said that he would definitely come back, so he would definitely come back to her.","She believed him so deeply.","He had never gone back on his word.","He would definitely return to her side.","Look, he was back.","Her captain, her comrade, her lover! was back!","Ten meters! Five meters! Three meters! His breathing became clearer and clearer.","She seemed to hear his strong heartbeat.","Three meters! Two meters! One meter! She was already enveloped by the refreshing scent on his body.","It enveloped her from head to toe.","Such a familiar aura, such a familiar embrace, such a warm chest! Ye Jian’s entire body was pressed against Xia Jinyuan.","Her cheek was on his chest.","She could hear her heartbeat.","She even heard him whispering to her, “I’m back, little fox.” Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian tightly.","His grip was a little tight.","Their bodies were tightly pressed together, with not a single inch of space left between them.","Even their heartbeats seemed to merge together.","“Yes, I’ve been waiting for you.” Ye Jian closed her eyes.","She hugged his strong waist tightly, as if she wanted to integrate herself into his bones.","‘Fortunately, you’re finally here.","Fortunately, you’re back!’"]},{"number":4154,"title":"Chapter 4154 Returning Lover","paragraphs":["Chapter 4154: Returning Lover Chapter 4154: Returning Lover Editor: Henyee Translations Ye Jian didn’t say much.","She just said, “I’ve been waiting for you.” Xia Jinyuan didn’t cry even when he was stabbed in the chest a few months ago.","Now, his heart hurt, and there were tears in his eyes.","These five words were filled with resignation and worry.","Every word weighed a ton, and every word was filled with sorrow.","The woman he loved deeply had been waiting for him to come back.","Fortunately, he didn’t disappoint her.","He was finally back.","She rubbed her cheek against his chest lightly as if she was still confirming whether he was real or not.","This was great.","This was really great.","Her lover was back.","Xia Jinyuan kissed the top of Ye Jian’s head gently and deeply.","The pain in his heart melted into this kiss, and he didn’t leave for a long time.","Ye Jian knew that he was kissing the top of her head.","The smile on her face got deeper, gentler, and more content.","“I’m sorry to have kept you waiting.” Xia Jinyuan hugged his lover, who had obviously lost a lot of weight.","The pain in his heart didn’t dissipate at all.","It became even more painful.","There were tears in her hair, and his deep voice trembled like the strings of a violin.","“I’m sorry to have made you worry.” Ye Jian, who was buried in his arms, shook her head and replied, “I didn’t wait long.","I was just a little worried about you.","Now that you’re back, I’m very happy.","“There’s no smell of blood on you.","There’s also a faint smell of soap.","You’re not injured and even took a shower before coming to look for me.","Captain Xia, you didn’t go back on your word, so you don’t have to feel sorry.” Waiting for him wasn’t scary because she knew her lover would return.","What kind of waiting was scary, then?","It was waiting for a lover who would never come back.","That kind of waiting was the real horror, the real despair.","Now that Xia Jinyuan was back, there was nothing he should be sorry about.","Ye Jian knew where he went and why he left the country.","That was his responsibility and hers.","Xia Jinyuan, whose eyes were still filled with tears, smiled.","The woman he loved deeply had always been understanding and always gave him her support.","It was perfect to have her in his life.","“If you’re waiting for me to come back, I’ll definitely come back.","When I have to wait for you to come back one day, you’ll definitely come back too.","This is our agreement.","We’ll grow old together.” Ye Jian nodded vigorously.","“That’s why we have to remember our agreement and come back alive for each other.” It wasn’t an extravagant hope.","They were just hoping they could come back alive from every mission.","That way, even if they missed each other dearly, there was still hope.","Xia Jinyuan raised his head and forced back the tears in his eyes.","He turned his head and looked at the ward with the lights off.","Then, he lowered his head and kissed the top of Ye Jian’s head again.","He asked softly, “Do you want to sleep?","Do you want to take a walk outside?” At the nurses’ station, several people were sizing Ye Jian up.","Despite having her back facing them, she could feel the probing gazes.","Although Ye Jian wasn’t wearing a military uniform and was only wearing a set of sportswear, the nurses knew that there were three students from the military school staying in this ward.","Although not many people were around at night, they still had to be careful.","Ye Jian, who couldn’t bear to let go, hummed and whispered, “Hug me for a while more.” It had been too long since they last met.","She had longed for him for so long.","At this moment, she just wanted to hug them properly.","It was rare for her to act coquettishly.","Naturally, Xia Jinyuan would go along with her.","Even when the three nurses on duty at the nurses’ station stood up to watch, he was unmoved.","It was normal for a boyfriend to hug his girlfriend!"]},{"number":4155,"title":"Chapter 4155 Kiss","paragraphs":["Chapter 4155: Kiss Chapter 4155: Kiss Editor: Henyee Translations It was rare for Ye Jian to act coquettishly and hug Xia Jinyuan for this long.","Xu Wen, who was half-awake,got up.","She narrowed her eyes and lowered her head to find her slippers.","Yawning, she shuffled into her slippers to go to the toilet.","After taking two steps, she felt that something was wrong.","She turned her head and looked at the bed opposite her.","After a glance, she took two steps forward.","Only then did she realize that Ye Jian was not on the bed.","Her mind immediately cleared up.","She thought that Ye Jian had gotten up from the bed and went to the bathroom too.","She muttered something in a low voice and shuffled toward the bathroom behind the door.","However, through the glass window embedded in the ward door, her half-squinted eyes widened bit by bit until they became round! What! What was she seeing?","Was she mistaken?","She blinked furiously and rubbed her eyes with both hands.","Her eyes were wide open.","She! wasn’t seeing things.","She really wasn’t seeing things!","At this moment, Xu Wen reacted extremely quickly.","She rushed to He Jing’s side and patted her awake.","“Jing, Jing, wake up!","Wake up!","Something big has happened!” He Jing was sleeping soundly when Xu Wen suddenly woke her up.","She even said that something big had happened.","Her habitual reaction was to get up from the bed.","Bang!","She got up quickly and fiercely.","Xu Wen was very close to her, so their heads bumped hard.","Xu Wen was hit in her eyebrows.","It was so painful that she quickly clenched her fist and stuffed it into her mouth.","Only then did she manage not to scream in pain.","He Jing’s forehead hurt so much that she couldn’t open her eyes.","She wanted to speak, but Xu Wen’s hand had already covered her mouth.","“Don’t talk.","Don’t scream in pain.","Bear with it!","Something shocking is going on outside!” Xu Wen, who was in so much pain that tears were squeezed out of her eyes, rubbed her eyebrows forcefully.","“It’s shocking.","Outside!” It was so painful that she almost bit her tongue when she spoke.","He Jing pried away her hand that was covering her mouth.","“What shocking matter is it?","Why aren’t you sleeping in the middle of the night?","Did you come to scare me?","Don’t you know that the hospital is quite scary?” “Oh my god, hush! Lower your voice.” Xu Wen pointed outside.","Her voice was as soft as a mosquito.","“A man is outside and hugging Jian.","Jian is also hugging the waist of the man who’s at least 15 cm taller than her.","Her head is buried in the man’s chest!","“I bet that he must be Jian’s mysterious boyfriend.","Otherwise, with Jian’s personality, she wouldn’t have thrown herself into the arms of a man.","Besides, she’s not used to interacting with male students.","She doesn’t even usually hug us.","“I’m very sure that the man outside is Jian’s boyfriend!” “! No way.","He came to the hospital in the middle of the night! for a date?” He Jing couldn’t believe it.","Her curiosity was piqued.","She didn’t sit on the bed anymore.","She got off the bed numbly.","The two of them tiptoed like thieves and slowly moved to a position where they could see the outside.","He Jing gasped when she saw the scene.","Xu Wen wasn’t mistaken.","It was true!","Besides Ye Jian’s boyfriend, she couldn’t think of any other identity!","“Right, right?","Her boyfriend is here.","Ahhh, kiss, kiss!!” Xu Wen didn’t just watch.","She was even commentating on it.","She held He Jing’s hand tightly and said excitedly, “Do you think he’ll kiss her?","Kiss her, kiss her, kiss her!” She was so excited that it felt like she was the one in Ye Jian’s shoes.","He Jing glanced at her.","Couldn’t this fellow be more reserved?","Why couldn’t she just think about these things without saying them out loud?"]},{"number":4156,"title":"Chapter 4156 Awesome, Exciting Boyfriend","paragraphs":["Chapter 4156: Awesome, Exciting Boyfriend","Chapter 4156: Awesome, Exciting Boyfriend","Editor: Henyee Translations","Just like Xu Wen, He Jing wanted Xia Jinyuan to kiss Ye Jian too.","However, she didn’t say it out loud.","The couple didn’t kiss.","The two women’s gazes were too hot.","Xia Jinyuan was the first to notice them.","When he lowered his head and kissed Ye Jian’s forehead, he leaned toward her ear and couldn’t help but peck her pink earlobe.","Then, he laughed softly and said, “Your two roommates have woken up.","They’re looking at us now.","“Don’t you need to greet them?","They just woke up.","Let’s go in and greet them before we go down for a walk.”","If they went down for a walk, they might not come back.","It had been too long since they last met.","There were too many things they wanted to say to each other.","They wouldn’t be able to sleep tonight.","As they chatted, Xia Jinyuan wanted to see what else they could do.","Ye Jian was no longer like before, when her face and ears would turn red after getting discovered.","At this moment, the joy of reuniting after a long time prevailed.","Her emotions overrode her rationality.","Although she was a little embarrassed, she held Xia Jinyuan’s hand and walked toward the ward.","Relying on their agility, the two women in the ward jumped back onto their beds the moment they saw the couple leave each other’s embrace.","They turned their bodies and pretended to sleep.","Ye Jian came in and turned on the lights.","She saw the two of them rushing back to the bed and pretending to sleep.","They looked like they wouldn’t wake up no matter how much of a commotion was made.","She touched her forehead and said to her boyfriend, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, “They’ve always been fond of putting on performances.","Now that they’ve been given a chance to show off their acting skills, they’re going all out in pretending to be asleep.”","Xia Jinyuan smiled.","He knew that his lover could interact very happily with all the students in school.","They were even more compatible with her than her classmates in junior high and senior high.","Perhaps because they were like-minded, Ye Jian was like a fish in water after entering the military school.","No student had ever stood up to criticize her.","He Jing knew that they had been discovered for secretly watching them just now.","There was no need to pretend to sleep anymore.","She opened her eyes and sat up openly.","She sized up Xia Jinyuan.","This man, who was able to woo the most famous person in their school who was the crush of countless male students, must have something special about him.","Hence, she needed to take a good look.","He Jing smiled and said, “Hello, I’m Jian’s roommate and comrade, He Jing.","Seeing is better than hearing.","Sorry about before.”","He was! handsome and had the aura of a soldier!","Tsk, tsk, tsk, tsk.","He was top-notch!","With the man standing beside Jian, the couple looked like a match made in heaven.","Just by looking at them, one could feel that they were very compatible.","Xu Wen, who couldn’t pretend to sleep anymore, got up too.","She was reserved now.","She nodded slightly and said generously, “Hello, I’m Jian’s roommate and comrade.","Xu Wen, nice to meet you.”","Xia Jinyuan said elegantly, “Hello, I’m Jian’s boyfriend and comrade, Xia Jinyuan.","Nice to meet you.”","He did a good job of introducing himself.","Xu Wen winked at Ye Jian, indicating that she had a good first impression of him.","There was no need to talk about his good looks.","Ye Jian Jian was a top-notch beauty.","She needed to find a top-notch handsome man.","It was mainly his temperament.","This temperament! Tsk, tsk, tsk.","He was way ahead of all the male students who had a crush on Ye Jian.","No, no, no.","It should be said that even if one lived for another few hundred years, one might not have Comrade Xia’s temperament.","He was elegant, noble, and had the aura of a soldier.","His aura was already above everyone else’s."]},{"number":4157,"title":"Chapter 4157 Get A Room","paragraphs":["Chapter 4157: Get A Room","Chapter 4157: Get A Room","Editor: Henyee Translations","Both of them were smart girls.","They knew that Xia Jinyuan came to the hospital in the middle of the night to look for Ye Jian.","He definitely didn’t just want to take a look at her before leaving.","After introducing themselves, He Jing and Xu Wen exchanged glances.","Xu Wen, who had always been blunt, asked, “Are you going out for a walk?","“Hurry up and go.","The ward is small.","It’s not suitable for chatting.","The two of us are sleepy, so we can’t chat with you.","I’m sorry, but I can only chase the two of you out.”","Ye Jian knew that the two of them were trying to alleviate her awkwardness.","However, these two were different.","They trained and learned together.","Their relationship was extraordinary.","Moreover, she had already brought Captain Xia over.","She had no intention of hiding their relationship from them.","Smiling, she said, “My boyfriend and I haven’t seen each other for a long time.","I’m afraid we’ll have endless topics to talk about.","Jing, I have to count on you to take care of Xu Wen during the day.”","Back then, she was so shy that her face would turn red if anyone teased her a little.","Now, she even dared to go out with her boyfriend for the night.","Also! she didn’t even plan to come back to the ward during the day.","Not to mention Xu Wen and He Jing, even Lieutenant Colonel Xia, her boyfriend, was surprised.","He planned to chat with the two female students for a while before suggesting that he and Ye Jian take a walk outside.","It might take a while, and he didn’t plan to let her come back.","Who knew that the shy little fox would take the initiative to mention it?","Under the teasing gazes of her two roommates, Ye Jian raised her eyebrows with an ‘I’m not shy’ expression.","She held Xia Jinyuan’s hand and prepared to leave the ward.","This was her boyfriend.","It wasn’t like he couldn’t show his face! Cough, it was a little embarrassing.","However, it was nighttime now, so it was fine!","Xia Jinyuan looked at the only empty bed and saw the bed number clearly.","Then, he found the corresponding cabinet and said softly, “You have to take your military uniform.”","He was tall, so when he spoke, he couldn’t help but lower his head slightly to talk to Ye Jian.","From He Jing’s and Xu Wen’s point of view, they could see the doting look on Xia Jinyuan’s face that only belonged to Ye Jian.","The smile in their eyes deepened.","They had been in a relationship before, so they could clearly feel the love this tall and handsome man had for Ye Jian.","It was a deep love.","Even when he introduced himself, he looked at Ye Jian deeply before looking at them out of politeness.","Then, he immediately retracted his gaze and looked at Ye Jian again.","He loved Ye Jian very much and only had eyes for her.","Xia Jinyuan went to the cabinet to take her military uniform jacket.","He Jing and Xu Wen smiled.","He was good.","He was really good.","There was an air of sweetness in the ward they were in.","“Our Jian will be very happy,” Xu Wen said softly as she looked at the closed ward door.","He Jing nodded.","“Yes, she’ll be very happy.","The outstanding Ye Jian deserves to be doted on by an outstanding man.”","“That’s right.","Do you think they’ll book a hotel room next?”","He Jing thought for a moment and replied, “He’d definitely choose a high-class hotel.","Huatian Hotel is probably his first choice.","He definitely wouldn’t choose a small hotel.","His aura is not like that of a man with an average family background.”","She thought that Xu Wen was asking where he was staying.","Xu Wen glanced at her and said slowly, “I mean, will they book a room and sleep together?”","!","After a while, He Jing picked up her pillow and threw it at Xu Wen’s bed.","“What are you thinking about?","Sleep!”"]},{"number":4158,"title":"Chapter 4158 Don’t Think Too Much","paragraphs":["Chapter 4158: Don’t Think Too Much","Chapter 4158: Don’t Think Too Much","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the ward, Xu Wen hugged the white blanket and laughed until she fell backward.","“Oh, Jing, you’re so pure.","One look and you can tell that you haven’t done anything bad.","A high-end hotel versus a small hotel?","Hahaha, I’m about to faint from laughter.”","One could tell that He Jing was someone without any experience.","She was pure.","No matter what, she had been in a relationship for a year.","Didn’t she have any substantial breakthroughs in her relationship?","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian were an adult couple.","It wasn’t easy for them to meet.","When dry wood touched fire, a huge fire would burn.","She didn’t expect He Jing to be so pure.","It was no wonder.","It only took a few months after her break up for her to move on.","This meant the relationship was not substantial.","There were no traces of her first love on her body.","That was why when they broke up, at most, she only felt sad.","One had to know that humans were forgetful.","He Jing’s face turned red from Xu Wen’s laughter.","She grabbed the blanket and rushed to the door to turn off the lights.","She said angrily, “Don’t think too much.","Nothing will happen between Jian and her boyfriend.","“Jian has always had strong self-control.","She’s an outstanding person, so the boyfriend she found must be extraordinary.","He must be exceptionally outstanding in all aspects, even better than Jian herself.","“Didn’t you realize how good Jian’s boyfriend is to her?","Since he knows that we’re still students, how can he do anything bad when he’s in a relationship with Jian?","“Based on my understanding of Jian, she wouldn’t do anything bad even though they’ve reunited after a long time.","She’s an outstanding student with a clear goal.","She wouldn’t make decisions she would regret for the rest of her life.”","He Jing laid on the bed and spoke seriously.","If Xu Wen hadn’t mentioned it just now, she wouldn’t have thought of it.","Although she said that, she was still worried.","“Don’t be so serious.","I think it’s normal.","The hotel provides contraceptives.","Nothing will happen.”","Xu Wen came from a big city, after all.","She was much more open-minded than He Jing.","She didn’t support or object.","That was a private matter between Ye Jian and her boyfriend.","No matter how good their relationship as friends was, they had to avoid talking about some things.","Knowing that He Jing was worried, Xu Wen comforted her, “You said that Ye Jian is outstanding.","The boyfriend she found must be outstanding too.","When two outstanding people get together, they can distinguish the severity of the matter.","“We don’t have to worry about these things.","It’s better to sleep.” Xu Wen stretched herself as she spoke.","She yawned, squeezing out a tear.","She picked up the blanket and closed her eyes comfortably to sleep.","“Sleep, sleep.","This life is too comfortable.","We don’t have to do morning exercises or take attendance at night.","Our time is up to us.","Oh my, it’s even more comfortable than staying at home.","“Jing, why don’t you stay for a few more days so that I can relax?”","In exchange, He Jing said a simple and domineering word, “Scram!”","“Alright, go to sleep,” Xu Wen said with a smile and fell asleep in satisfaction.","As for what would happen between Ye Jian and her boyfriend, they could do it if they wanted.","What was wrong with that?","They just needed to take precautions.","With their intelligence, it was impossible for them not to have thought of contraception.","However, this was hard to say.","If they had had sex a few times, they would know how to use contraception while they were still in the foreplay stage.","If! Cough, she didn’t tell He Jing this.","But if it was their first time, they wouldn’t think of using contraception."]},{"number":4159,"title":"Chapter 4159 Wicked","paragraphs":["Chapter 4159: Wicked","Chapter 4159: Wicked","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was a personal matter.","No matter how good their friendship was, they had to know their limits.","With He Jing’s intelligence, she would definitely be able to get her reminder.","He Jing naturally got Xu Wen’s reminder.","Although she seemed to be the one taking care of Xu Wen more, Xu Wen was the one who always gave her pointers.","He Jing, who was lying on the bed, thought for a moment and felt that Xu Wen was right.","That was a personal matter.","She couldn’t criticize Ye Jian.","He Jing closed her eyes and fell asleep.","Ye Jian walked out of the hospital and elbowed the man who was smiling.","Her face was slightly red as she gritted her teeth and said, “Captain Xia, if you’re going to keep smiling like this, I’ll go back upstairs immediately.","I won’t accompany you anymore.”","What was so funny?","She didn’t say anything wrong.","She just said that she wouldn’t go back to accompany her roommates tonight and would come back late in the day.","However, he seemed to have misunderstood her.","In short, he must have distorted the meaning of her words.","If not, he wouldn’t have been smiling for so long.","Why was Xia Jinyuan smiling?","Just like what Ye Jian had guessed, he had twisted her words into something inappropriate.","Holding her hand again, Lieutenant Colonel Xia smiled until there was a hint of evilness on his handsome face.","“Alright, alright.","I won’t smile anymore.”","He coaxed her, his voice low and sweet.","“I just didn’t expect you, who has always been shy, to suddenly be so bold.","You directly said that we’d book a room tonight.”","“He Jing wouldn’t think too much about it.","As for Xu Wen, she definitely would.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t have reminded you to be careful before we left.”","Ye Jian didn’t think too much about it either.","She glared at him.","“Is there anything wrong with reminding me to be careful?” After she finished speaking, she looked at his naughty expression.","Then! Ye Jian finally understood!","“This fellow!” Ye Jian’s face turned even redder.","She didn’t know where to look.","“I didn’t even say anything.","She just likes to think too much.”","Holding her hand tightly, Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s smile deepened.","“No, no, no.","It’s normal for her to think that way.","You even said we’d get a room.","It’s incredible.","Little fox, I haven’t interacted with you for more than a year.","You’re so bold that you even dare to get a room with me.”","He lowered his head and moved his thin lips to Ye Jian’s ear.","“Well, what do you plan on doing after booking a room?”","His low voice became gentler and softer.","It was like sweet cotton candy and mellow wine.","It enveloped her bit by bit.","The sweet and mellow smell added an indescribable ambiguity to the quiet night.","Ye Jian realized that her words just now could make one’s imagination run wild.","It was hot.","She felt a little hot now.","“Get off.","Don’t get so close to me.","It’s hot.”","She even pretended to be very calm as she spoke.","She reached out her hand and tried to push away the man whose masculine scent was like a heat source beside her ear.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t let her push him away.","She wasn’t pushing him too hard either.","Her shy expression made Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who only wanted to tease her, a little thirsty.","When she said that she was hot, he was hot too.","When he was at Molaban, Luke always said that he wanted to find a woman.","When he went to bars, he would get even wilder.","One day, he booked a private room.","When Xia Jinyuan went out to smoke, he came back and saw that he and a woman had already started doing it on the couch.","Later, he asked Luke why he liked one-night stands.","He said it would relieve the pressure.","Although he didn’t agree with this method of relieving pressure, he didn’t blame him.","It was just that Xia Jinyuan didn’t feel that he would be affected by this.","Now, he knew that it wasn’t that he wasn’t affected.","It was just that this influence! came too late!"]},{"number":4160,"title":"Chapter 4160 Be Good, Continue On This High Sugar","paragraphs":["Chapter 4160: Be Good, Continue On This High Sugar","Chapter 4160: Be Good, Continue On This High Sugar","Editor: Henyee Translations","Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s eyes turned dark.","He reached out his hand and gently rubbed Ye Jian’s red earlobe.","He felt the soft and delicate touch on his fingers.","It instantly turned into an electric current that went straight to his heart.","His willpower was like a peeled wall that fell layer by layer.","In the end, the primitive impulse was like a volcano that had been hidden from the bottom of the sea.","It instantly erupted.","The boiling magma burned his calm heart.","It rolled and boiled, causing the muscles in his arm to tense up.","“A grown man and a woman spending the night together in a room.","Do you think others will really think we’ll just sleep?","Silly, only you would think so.","Do you really want to sleep with me?","Do you really want to hold me tightly?”","His fingers rubbed Ye Jian’s red earlobe.","It was even hotter now.","He looked around and saw that there was no one around.","He leaned over and kissed her earlobe gently.","He sucked and bit it gently.","Ye Jian, who was seduced by his blatant words, was caught off guard by his sucking and kissing.","Under the sudden stimulation, Ye Jian’s entire body trembled violently.","She let out a sweet voice that she didn’t realize, and it made Xia Jinyuan’s eyes turn darker.","This sound was enough to take down Xia Jinyuan, who was a 27-year-old virgin.","If they weren’t on the streets, he might have done her immediately.","“Don’t make a sound.","I’ve endured enough.","If you make another sound, I’m afraid that!” Xia Jinyuan was exceptionally calm when he was acting like a hooligan.","He pulled Ye Jian into his arms and hugged her waist tightly with one hand, making her become a part of his body.","It allowed her to feel the power that represented a man.","It poked her so hard it hurt.","“Don’t struggle.”","Ye Jian instinctively wanted to struggle, but Xia Jinyuan warned her in a low voice, “You’ve always been good at physics.","Don’t you know that friction generates heat?”","In short, now that Ye Jian was in his arms, all she could do was not move.","If not, the consequences would be very serious!","If Comrade Xia Jinyuan was really shameless, he would definitely go all out!","Time passed slowly.","Ye Jian, who didn’t move, was still feeling uncomfortable.","Her hand on his shoulder slowly moved to his ear.","She pulled his ear and asked in a low voice, “How long will it take for you to calm down?”"]},{"number":4161,"title":"Chapter 4161 She’s His Harbor","paragraphs":["Chapter 4161: She’s His Harbor","Chapter 4161: She’s His Harbor","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian couldn’t bear to use too much strength, so she tugged lightly as if she was scratching an itch.","However, that wasn’t enough to stop the shameless Xia Jinyuan.","On the contrary! as a man, Xia Jinyuan felt that this was his girlfriend’s recognition of his male ability.","It had been so long, but he was still hard.","He was helpless.","There was nothing he could do.","No one understood the sorrows of a virgin.","“I know that you’re teasing me and saying those things on purpose.","It’s nighttime, so I’ll let you be, but!” But what?","Ye Jian wanted to say something, but she didn’t expect!","Xia Jinyuan had probably guessed what she wanted to say.","It had been a long time, and he had been influenced by Luke.","“Let me calm down.","I’m a little agitated.","I need to calm down.” Xia Jinyuan released his right hand that was wrapped tightly around Ye Jian’s waist and pulled some distance between them.","Perhaps it was too stimulating, but he felt a little oxygen-deprived.","He placed his chin on Ye Jian’s shoulder like a big bear.","The strong and elegant man revealed his child-like side.","His chin rubbed against Ye Jian’s neck from time to time, making Ye Jian feel ticklish.","She was getting temperamental.","But more than that, her heart ached.","He was too powerful.","He was so powerful that everyone thought that he stood tall and would never be tired.","As the captain, he did have an indomitable image in the team, but he was not made of iron.","He was only human, so of course, he would get tired too.","Only in front of her would he shed his strong side and reveal his soft side, telling her that he was actually tired too.","Just like now, he was really tired.","He was so tired that even his breathing was filled with fatigue.","Ye Jian touched his broad back gently.","She didn’t say anything.","She just accompanied him quietly and allowed him to rub against her like a child.","If he was tired, she would just let him lean on her.","She knew that he was tired.","She was his harbor.","She could let him have a good rest without any burdens.","He could remove all his heavy responsibilities and show her his most tired and vulnerable side without holding back.","He was her harbor, and she was his harbor too.","Xia Jinyuan leaned almost all his weight on Ye Jian, especially his back.","All his fatigue was dispelled by her.","His body and mind were relaxed.","“If you’re tired, just lean on me.","Just lean on me.”","She spoke softly.","Her soft voice was filled with pity and gentleness as she coaxed him like she was coaxing a child.","Xia Jinyuan, who never showed his weakness to others, completely lowered his guard in front of Ye Jian.","He hummed softly, and his agitated blood slowly calmed down.","He was indeed tired.","He was very excited to see her, and what accompanied it was fatigue.","Especially since she was coaxing him like a child now, it made him feel even more tired.","In her eyes, he was definitely not an omnipotent captain.","She knew that he was exhausted.","He just kept his back straight and carried the responsibility on his shoulders.","He didn’t allow himself to fall.","He didn’t even allow his back to bend.","He had always been like this, standing tall like a giant.","Now, it was time to rest.","He had to have a good rest.","He shouldn’t let himself be too tired now that he was home.","Ye Jian’s hand caressed Xia Jinyuan’s back gently.","She used her gentleness and strength to support her tired lover.","This was the most beautiful love.","They relied on each other and waited for each other."]},{"number":4162,"title":"Chapter 4162 Familiar","paragraphs":["Chapter 4162: Familiar","Chapter 4162: Familiar","Editor: Henyee Translations","Actually, he would be tired too.","He just couldn’t let others know that he was tired.","However, in front of his little fox, he could relax, bend his back, and reveal his hidden fatigue.","He didn’t have to worry or worry about anything.","At this moment, the thin shoulders and slender body of the woman he loved the most were his safe haven.","She knew him, understood him, and doted on him!","The cool wind blew gently, and the night became even quieter.","After leaning for a while, Xia Jinyuan let out a satisfied sigh.","He didn’t let himself lean on her anymore.","He stood up straight like a pine tree that didn’t collapse in the snow.","He was straight and tall, making people feel safe.","Ye Jian looked up at the man with bloodshot eyes.","She raised her hand and touched his cheek gently.","Her eyes trembled slightly as she asked, “Find a place to rest.","Since you’re back, have a good rest.","Put everything else aside and rest well.”","Her heart ached for him.","It hurt to the core.","She really wanted to stand beside him as soon as possible.","She wanted to be able to share the responsibility for him and face more dangers with him.","Xia Jinyuan held the hand that was on his face and smiled.","“Okay, let’s go to the hotel to sleep first.","I’m really a little tired.”","“Okay.” Ye Jian nodded.","The man with a smile on his thin lips held the hand of the woman he loved deeply and brought her into a taxi.","Xia Jinyuan was someone who could endure hardships.","However, when it was time to enjoy himself, he would not mistreat himself.","Just as Xu Wen had guessed, the taxi that brought the two of them went straight to the best hotel, Huatian Hotel.","In the ward of the inpatient department of the hospital, Xu Wen, who was clearly asleep, suddenly sat up with the blanket in her arms.","She muttered to herself as if she had come to a realization, “I remember now!","No wonder he looks familiar to me and I felt like I had seen him somewhere before.”","He Jing was groggy.","Suddenly, she heard Xu Wen muttering to herself.","She turned over and asked vaguely, “What do you mean by that?","Hurry up and sleep.","If you don’t sleep now, the sky will turn bright soon.”","“Jing, I finally remember when I saw Jian’s boyfriend!","We met in the past.","At that time, Ye Jian introduced him to us as her cousin.","Do you think the two of them had already started dating then?”","He Jing, who was a little sleepy, sobered up a little.","However, she didn’t open her eyes.","She searched her memory and seemed to remember something.","However, she didn’t remember if it was the same person.","It was probably the first semester of their first year or the first semester of their second year.","“So be it.","What’s there to make a fuss about?","Didn’t you say it yourself?","An outstanding girl like Jian doesn’t lack boys wooing her.”","“No, no, no.","He’s not a boy.","He’s a man.","A very mature man.","A man who’s many leagues above the male students in our military school.","“Hehe, I didn’t expect Jian to keep it a secret so well.","She got a boyfriend early on, which was why she kept ignoring the male students’ interest in her.”","Xu Wen and He Jing recalled the scene just now.","Not bad.","With such a good boyfriend, Ye Jian didn’t need to accept other boys’ goodwill anymore.","The two women muttered to each other for a while before closing their eyes again and falling asleep.","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan had just arrived at Huatian Hotel.","Xia Jinyuan, who was wearing casual clothes, asked Ye Jian to sit on the couch in a corner of the hall.","He took his identification document and went to the front desk to book a room."]},{"number":4163,"title":"Chapter 4163 Sleep, My Love","paragraphs":["Chapter 4163: Sleep, My Love","Chapter 4163: Sleep, My Love","Editor: Henyee Translations","They went straight to the most luxurious suite in the Huatian Hotel.","As soon as the door closed, Ye Jian didn’t have the time to look at the room.","Xia Jinyuan, who came in later, turned on the lights with one hand and used his other hand to hug Ye Jian’s slender waist from behind.","After a beep, the entrance lights and two floor lamps in the room lit up at the same time, illuminating the entire room.","There was an intoxicating atmosphere.","Xia Jinyuan had already carried Ye Jian like a princess.","He didn’t need to turn on any other lights.","He lowered his eyes and looked at the beautiful Ye Jian.","His sexy Adam’s apple moved.","“It’s getting late.","Go to your room and sleep.”","Ye Jian, who was hugging his neck, nodded obediently.","She said worriedly, “We’ll just sleep.","We won’t do anything else.","You need to rest.”","Actually, he really wanted to do something else, but! he was worried about her having to go to the hospital to visit her roommates tomorrow.","With his current stamina, once he started, he could foresee that he wouldn’t be able to control himself.","He would pester her from dawn to dawn.","She wouldn’t even be able to get out of bed.","“I won’t do anything else.","I’ll just sleep.","If you don’t want to sleep, talk about what happened to you in the past year.","I might not answer, but I’ll listen.”","With her accompanying him, he, who had not slept well for almost a year and a half, felt a little sleepy.","They would have a proper talk when he woke up.","The bed in the suite was huge, and the blanket was soft.","Lying on it felt like sleeping in cotton.","Sleepiness came immediately.","Ye Jian lay on his shoulder.","Under the warm light of the floor lamp, she used her gaze to trace his well-defined handsome face.","The more she looked at him, the deeper the love in her heart.","She didn’t say anything.","She just watched quietly as he fell asleep.","She felt his body temperature.","It made her feel at ease.","It was good that he was back.","He had returned to her side safely.","“I’ll let you take a good look tomorrow.","Be obedient and sleep for a while.” Xia Jinyuan hugged her shoulder tightly and brought her closer to him.","She leaned over and placed her hand on his other shoulder.","He closed his eyes and kissed Ye Jian’s forehead.","His voice was intoxicating.","“If you continue looking, I won’t be sleepy anymore.","I might do something bad to you.”","“Be good.","Close your eyes and sleep with me for a while.”","“Okay.” Ye Jian moved her body and kissed his handsome chin.","“Go to sleep.","I won’t look at you anymore.”","He was beside her.","It was real.","He wouldn’t disappear after waking up like in her previous dreams.","Even if the sun rose immediately, he would still be by her side.","Xia Jinyuan turned his body and faced Ye Jian.","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan was completely hugging Ye Jian and letting her bury her head in his arms.","This sleeping position was very warm.","Ye Jian adjusted her posture and closed her eyes decisively.","The corners of her lips were curled up slightly.","It was a sweet smile.","He said that if she continued looking at him, he would definitely do something bad.","It was better to listen to him obediently and stop looking.","This was the soundest and sweetest sleep Xia Jinyuan had in the past year and a half.","It was also the soundest and sweetest sleep Ye Jian had.","The two of them didn’t even dream.","They slept until 10:30 am the next morning.","Their biological clock usually woke them up at 5:00 am.","Ye Jian woke up later than Xia Jinyuan.","She was woken up by a kiss.","But it wasn’t on her lips! It was!","It was a numbing feeling and a little ticklish.","It also made her heart flutter."]},{"number":4164,"title":"Chapter 4164 What Should We Do Now","paragraphs":["Chapter 4164: What Should We Do Now?","Chapter 4164: What Should We Do Now?","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian slept soundly.","She was relaxed both physically and mentally.","Ye Jian, who was always vigilant, didn’t wake up completely even though she was being nibbled on.","Even though there was an indescribable throbbing, she only hummed like a little puppy.","It was lazy and soft.","Xia Jinyuan, who was busy ‘working’, was so excited that he trembled a few times.","She was indeed! a little vixen!","That was not all.","Ye Jian, who felt very comfortable, groaned and hugged Xia Jinyuan’s head with both hands.","!","The air in the room seemed to be boiling.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect to be hugged by Ye Jian! He almost fainted.","The soft and tender touch was really! an extraordinary enjoyment.","His entire face was buried in softness.","Even though he was out of breath, he didn’t want to look up.","Xia Jinyuan was already panting heavily.","He felt so hot as though his body was scalding.","Ye Jian slowly opened her eyes and lowered her head.","Then! she was stunned.","Ye Jian, who was in a daze, stared blankly at the head that she was hugging.","Although she had loosened her grip, it was obvious that the man had no intention of raising his head that was buried in her arms!","!","Ye Jian’s mind was blank.","She felt very comfortable just now, and there was even indescribable restlessness.","Was it all because of! Captain Xia’s actions?","Her face turned red.","She couldn’t help but grab the blanket tightly.","Ye Jian was so nervous that she curled up her fingers.","Ye Jian, who was in a daze, felt that her breathing was hitched.","Her mind was in a mess.","What would Captain Xia do next?","Was he really going to do that?","Should she reject him?","She didn’t seem to know how to.","But if she didn’t refuse, what if! What if something happened?","It was better to reject.","But what if Captain Xia really, really wanted it?","How could she bear to reject him?","Ye Jian was in a dilemma.","She wanted to reject him but couldn’t bear to.","For the first time, Ye Jian felt that she had encountered an extremely difficult problem.","Reject or not to reject?","No matter what she chose, it would be a headache!","Xia Jinyuan, who took the opportunity to cause trouble again, understood what was going on.","His woman had woken up.","However, he didn’t dare to move.","Hence, he took the opportunity to lick.","After licking her, he raised his head from Ye Jian’s arms and looked at Ye Jian with his handsome eyes.","Then, he curled his lips and revealed the evil smile that Ye Jian was most familiar with.","He said, “I almost suffocated just now.","Fortunately, my lung capacity is not bad.","I!”","!","What did he say?","What did he want to say?","What was he hinting at?","Ye Jian, who was still in a dilemma, seemed to have heard what Xia Jinyuan said clearly.","She looked at Xia Jinyuan, who had ‘bad thoughts’ written all over his face, in a daze.","She blinked and pursed her lips.","No one knew what she was thinking.","After a while, Ye Jian raised her hand and poked his forehead with one finger.","She used the strength of her finger to poke the head away from her arms.","What should she say?"]},{"number":4165,"title":"Chapter 4165 Deal With It","paragraphs":["Chapter 4165: Deal With It","Chapter 4165: Deal With It","Editor: Henyee Translations","She looked at him with her dark eyes.","Her red face seemed a little pure.","She pursed her lips slightly as if she didn’t know where she was and what she wanted to do.","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but laugh happily.","It was low, mellow, and exceptionally sexy.","The laughter made Ye Jian’s face burn.","Ye Jian had always known that she was at a disadvantage.","Even though the man she loved deeply was a novice, he had always been in the lead.","“I need to! go to! the bathroom.”","As she spoke in a small voice, her face was so red that it looked like she was drunk.","Danger, danger!","It wasn’t an ordinary danger either.","It was! a high-risk danger!","Xia Jinyuan knew what she was thinking.","His woman wanted to escape again.","She wanted to escape.","She could escape for a while, but she couldn’t escape for the rest of her life.","There was still a long way to go.","Ye Jian got up from the bed.","She was too nervous, so when she got off the bed, she staggered.","Before Xia Jinyuan could reach out to help her, she took two steps and steadied herself.","She put on her slippers and went straight to the bathroom.","It was true that she went to the bathroom to calm herself down.","She rushed to the bathroom and saw herself in the bathroom mirror.","Her appearance! Ye Jian couldn’t help but cover her face.","This was too! Her face was red, her eyes were glazed over, and there was a red mark on her chest.","A phrase flashed past Ye Jian’s mindâ€”seductive vixen.","Didn’t that apply to her current state?","In Xia Jinyuan’s eyes, the woman he kissed awake was a beautiful woman who made him fall for her.","She had grown up.","She had really grown up.","He hadn’t hugged her for almost a year and a half, and he could finally take a good look at her.","This morning, when he gently lifted her clothes, the scenery he saw made him get a nosebleed.","Looking at her bare skin, it was smooth and tender.","After guarding her for so many years, from the age of 14 years old to the age of 21 years old, from inexperience to maturity, from weakness to strength, the woman he had been waiting for had finally grown up.","Comrade Xia, who was lying on the bed, sighed in satisfaction.","The fruit was already ripe.","Should he pluck it?","He would pluck it.","Ye Jian’s roommate with the surname Xu was smart.","If not, she wouldn’t have specially reminded the little fox to be careful before they left.","The reminder was meant to have Ye Jian pay attention to her boyfriend and not let things go overboard.","He shouldn’t pluck it!","Xia Jinyuan lifted the blanket and lowered his head.","He looked at his energetic member below.","It had been hard on him after holding it in for so long.","He couldn’t let the little fox’s roommates see through him.","He couldn’t let herself suffer either.","Hence, he chose a compromise.","Comrade Xia would have to think about the compromise himself.","Ye Jian wasn’t familiar with this aspect.","She wouldn’t be able to think of it.","After washing her face, brushing her teeth, and dawdling in the bathroom for a while, Ye Jian finally walked out of the bathroom 15 minutes later.","When she came out, she saw the man leaning against the bed with his bare upper body.","He was talking to someone on his phone.","Ye Jian saw his strong upper body and stepped back.","Seeing that she had come out, Xia Jinyuan didn’t give Ye Jian a chance to retreat.","He covered his cell phone and chuckled.","“Come here.” He patted the seat beside him and continued talking to his comrades on the other end of the cell phone.","“The few of you can play first.","I won’t be back for at least a week.","Don’t ask me where I am.","You’ve already thought of the answer.","What’s up?","Do you want to see me make a fool of myself?","F*ck, don’t even think about it.","“Where am I?","I’m outside!”"]},{"number":4166,"title":"Chapter 4166 Forget Your Friends","paragraphs":["Chapter 4166: Forget Your Friends","Chapter 4166: Forget Your Friends","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was unknown what the other party said, but Xia Jinyuan said, “Scram.” Z7 laughed until tears came out of his eyes.","He needed to end the call.","If this continued, Xia Jinyuan would probably get angry from embarrassment.","After returning to the capital city, Z7 said to his comrades who came to the capital city for a gathering, “Boss said that he doesn’t have time to talk to us now.","As for where he is now, he told us to guess.","He also said we’d surely get it right.","“As for other things, I didn’t dare to ask him.","I was afraid that he’d teach me a lesson when he got back.","So, I stopped asking.","For the sake of our future, I couldn’t ask any more questions.”","Those who came for the gathering included Yin Rong, a married man, T6, who was engaged, K7, who was more ruthless than anyone on the battlefield, and Pigeon.","Including Han Zheng, the five of them came to the capital city.","They didn’t know that their captain had returned to the country.","They only knew when they saw Major General Yang in the capital city.","They knew that their captain had gone to Xiang City.","He had chosen his woman over his friends!","His comrades were all looking forward to his return, but he ran out to look for his girlfriend.","He didn’t even want his comrades anymore.","They were really sad.","That was why there was such a call.","As for whether they were really sad or not, from the smiles on their faces, they were just joking around.","It was good that their captain was back.","The five of them returned to the guest house in a team.","Han Zheng was the host.","They changed into casual clothes and went out to play.","Xia Jinyuan specially reminded Han Zheng to play the host and bring their comrades to have fun.","No matter where they went to have fun, he would foot the bill.","He truly didn’t have the time to contact his comrades.","He hugged the woman who had obediently crawled to his side and was leaning against him with one hand.","When he saw her fingers gently touching the scar on his heart, he gently wiped the tears at the corner of her eyes and smiled disapprovingly.","“I recovered a long time ago.","It doesn’t hurt.”","How could it not hurt?","At that time, she clearly saw that he was in so much pain that his face was pale and his lips were pale.","How could it not hurt?","He just didn’t want others to know.","“Don’t do such stupid things in the future.","Even if K7’s technique is good, what if an accident had happened?” The knife wound was about three centimeters long.","It had been stitched.","After the wound healed, it left a faint pink centipede-like scar.","This three centimeters scar almost killed him at that time.","Xia Jinyuan held her hand that was touching his scar and lowered his head to kiss her forehead.","“There won’t be a next time.","This will probably only happen once in a lifetime.","One time is enough.”","Xia Jinyuan only dared to take the risk when he was cornered.","Now, Xia Jinyuan might not have the courage to do it again.","He held her hand and placed her palm close to his heart.","He slowly talked about what happened during this period of time.","There were some things he could talk about.","For instance, Luke would bring him to bars to find women to pass the time with.","He didn’t look for any and just watched from the side.","“At that time, I dared to make a bet because I had confirmed Luke’s identity.","I bet on K7’s skills and my life-or-death relationship with Luke.","He’s a very good fellow.","Unfortunately, our bond can’t go any deeper.","However, when I made my shot, I revealed my face.","I think he discovered me.","With his intelligence, he probably realized that I wasn’t dead.","As for where I went and who I am, I’m afraid he won’t be able to think of it.","“Cobra has committed too many crimes.","In the underground market he has, he only deals in one kind of ‘living goods’.","After I went there, I realized that these ‘living goods’ were all people who had been sent over somehow.","There were women, boys, and 12 or 13-year-old girls."]},{"number":4167,"title":"Chapter 4167 Your Business And Mine","paragraphs":["Chapter 4167: Your Business And Mine","Chapter 4167: Your Business And Mine Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan’s expression was still a little gloomy when he mentioned the underground places he had seen.","There were so many missing people in all parts of the world.","Some of them were reduced to the underground market and became ‘goods’ that were bought by those people with special hobbies.","In that place, you would never know how dark human nature could be.","It was a darkness that you would never be able to imagine or even know for the rest of your life.","As a soldier, Xia Jinyuan had been there once and never again.","Ye Jian listened quietly.","The danger in the past had turned into mere words.","He used his calmest tone to undermine the danger that had put his life at risk.","Everything became a story in the past.","No one knew that a soldier once used his life to complete a mission to stop the invasion of a venomous figure.","No one knew that a soldier used the bullets in his hand to exchange for the lives of countless people.","After hearing this, Ye Jian kissed his well-defined chin with red eyes.","“Captain Xia, you’re very great.","You’ll always be my idol.”","After kissing his chin, Ye Jian propped herself up with her elbow and leaned toward his upper body.","Slowly, she lowered her head and kissed the scar on his heart.","When her soft lips touched the scar, tears fell.","Her trembling lips were on his scar for a long time.","Seeing this, Xia Jinyuan touched the back of the woman he loved.","She was frightened.","She was really frightened.","He knew that the woman he loved was frightened when she saw him cough out blood.","“It’s all in the past.","It’s all in the past.","Don’t be afraid.” He touched and coaxed her gently.","Xia Jinyuan only heaved a sigh of relief when her cheek was pressed against his chest.","Ye Jian, whose upper body was on his chest, raised her hand to wipe her tears.","It was all in the past.","Fortunately, it was all in the past.","“I’ve said my piece.","Baby, tell me about you.” Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian like a tree and used a gentle voice to change the topic to Ye Jian.","He desperately wanted to know what the woman he loved had experienced in the past year.","Ye Jian, who was lying on top of him, froze very slightly.","Xia Jinyuan, who was nervous about her, immediately sensed that something had happened to her while he was away.","“What happened?","Be good and tell me.” He coaxed her, not daring to ask rashly.","After being silent for a while, Ye Jian still couldn’t control her emotions.","She said in a low and trembling voice, “Captain Xia, Uncle Chen left!”","What?!","Uncle Chen had left!","Xia Jinyuan’s gaze turned sharp.","He tightened his arms around her.","“When did this happen?","Was it an accident?”","“It was an accident.”","Ye Jian’s voice was a little choked up.","At this moment, she found someone to rely on.","All the sorrow in her heart surged out like a tide in front of Xia Jinyuan.","“Captain Xia, Uncle Chen died in an accident.","Uncle Chen came to the capital city for some reason.","As soon as he walked out of the train station, he was! killed by a sniper.”","He tightened his arms around her.","Ye Jian’s shoulders tightened.","Xia Jinyuan’s expression was no longer cold.","His voice was filled with bloodlust.","“Uncle Chen is a world-class sniper.","He was able to sense danger the moment it appeared.","In that case, the person who sniped Uncle Chen is also a world-class sniper.”","He got to the point."]},{"number":4168,"title":"Chapter 4168 Distance Of Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 4168: Distance Of Heart","Chapter 4168: Distance Of Heart Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, Ye Jian didn’t need much pity.","She needed someone to rely on to find out who killed Uncle Chen with her.","Xia Jinyuan knew her personality.","She was a woman who had walked through storms and was so strong that it made his heart ache.","He knew what she needed the most.","When Uncle Chen left, the woman he loved deeply must have been in extreme pain.","Perhaps even her faith had collapsed.","He couldn’t turn back time, and he wasn’t able to accompany her properly.","He couldn’t accompany her through the saddest times after Uncle Chen left.","He couldn’t turn back time and go back to the past.","Hence, all he could do was accompany her and find Uncle Chen’s murderer.","Everything that happened in the past could not be salvaged.","In the future, they would definitely face everything together.","Ye Jian listened to the familiar calm voice.","She wiped the tears off her face.","When she opened her mouth again, her voice was no longer as gentle as before.","There was a hint of coldness in it.","“Major General Yang and Commander Xia suspect the same thing.","It’s not that Uncle Chen didn’t notice the danger.","He noticed it and dodged accordingly.","Hence, the bullet didn’t hit Uncle Chen’s heart completely.","“But! the bullet used by the sniper wasn’t an ordinary bullet!”","“He used a dirty bullet.” Xia Jinyuan had already thought of it before she said it.","As a world-class sniper, Uncle Chen had already sensed danger and dodged without letting the bullet hit his vital points.","However, he still passed away.","There was only one possibility.","The wound expanded, causing a large area of injury.","Even if it didn’t hit a vital point, as long as it was very close to it, it would become fatal.","In other words, the person who killed Uncle Chen didn’t have much confidence.","This was because he knew Uncle Chen’s status in the sniper world.","He didn’t dare to use ordinary bullets.","In order to increase his chances of winning, the best choice was to use the internationally banned dirty bullets.","As for why Xia Jinyuan guessed that it was a dirty bullet and not another kind of internationally banned bullet, it was because of the time and place.","The train station was a densely populated place.","It was extremely lively.","Empty-pointed bullets were bullets that entered the target and quickly expanded and exploded.","The distance was very short.","The sniper, who came with the intention of winning, naturally wouldn’t choose to use empty-pointed bullets.","“Uncle Chen was most worried about me.","The doctor said that the first thing Uncle Chen said when he got into the ambulance was to get the doctor to give him an analgesic shot.","He said that he wanted to wait for his only family member to come.","“I rushed over to see Uncle Chen one last time.","Before Uncle Chen left, he didn’t forget to remind me to be careful and not take revenge for him.","“Uncle Chen knew that the murderer was a very powerful sniper.","He was afraid that I’d go seek him out for revenge.","He was afraid that I’d risk my life.","“Captain Xia, in order to let Uncle Chen leave in peace, I pretended to agree.","I just pretended to agree.","I must find Uncle Chen’s murderer.","I’ll find him later.”","Every word was as cold as ice and snow.","Xia Jinyuan knew that she was crying.","The wetness on his chest made his heart ache.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want her to cry alone.","He pursed his thin lips and hugged Ye Jian so that she could lean on his shoulder.","He lowered his head and saw all the subtle expressions on her face.","Rustling sounds came from the blanket.","Ye Jian leaned against the broad shoulder that could reassure her.","A deep and cold voice came from above her head.","“I’ll accompany you to find the murderer and avenge Uncle Chen.","I’ll accompany you and use the murderer’s blood to pay tribute to Uncle Chen.”"]},{"number":4169,"title":"Chapter 4169 I’m Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 4169: I’m Here","Chapter 4169: I’m Here Editor: Henyee Translations","“Yes.” Ye Jian nodded and buried her head in his neck.","“Commander Xia also knew that I would definitely look for the murderer.","He was afraid that I would be in danger, so he specially told me that since the opponent could kill Uncle Chen, he must be a world-class sniper as powerful as Uncle Chen.","“If I want to take revenge, I have to ask myself if I’ve reached the world-class sniping standard.","I said that I haven’t.","I haven’t reached the world-class sniping standard.","I haven’t reached the level of Uncle Chen.","Captain Xia, I can’t take revenge for Uncle Chen immediately.","I have to work harder.","Only then can I make Uncle Chen feel at ease.”","Ye Jian valued relationships, especially family.","This had a lot to do with her fate with family in her past life.","In this life, Grandpa Gen and Principal Chen were her relatives who accompanied her as she grew up and pulled her through the darkest days.","She was already uneasy that she didn’t manage to take revenge on Principal Chen.","In that case, the only thing she could do was to let herself have the ability to take revenge to comfort Uncle Chen.","Xia Jinyuan, who understood her the best, lowered his head and kissed her forehead heavily.","After a long time, his cold voice was filled with power as he said word by word, “Don’t feel guilty.","I’ll accompany you.","We’ll improve our strength together and find the murderer.","If Uncle Chen were still alive, he wouldn’t be angry.”","Yes, that was what Ye Jian thought too.","Then, she thought of the two foreigners who were taken away by the military that night.","Ye Jian raised her head and told Xia Jinyuan everything.","“What happened was too coincidental.","When Uncle Chen got into trouble, Niannian was the first to rush over.","Then, she encountered danger.","Coincidentally, there were three foreigners.","“Just after two foreigners were caught, the remaining foreigner who escaped died in a car accident.","There are so many coincidences that I really suspect that the foreigners who shot at Niannian and the murderer who sniped Uncle Chen at the train station belong to the same party.","“I told Commander Xia my guess.","He asked me to go back to school and wait for the news.","He told me to remember his advice and not show my face easily.","“It’s been so long, but there’s no new news.","Captain Xia, should I ask Commander Xia?”","Xia Jinyuan thought for a moment and didn’t agree.","“There’s no need to ask.","If there’s really news, you’ll be the first to know.","If there’s no update, it means that there’s no useful news.","“But it’s too much of a coincidence.","“The series of events might be related, but you have to think about it.","If it’s really the same group of people, the three people sent to shoot Zhou Niannian are actually just three useless chess pieces in the entire assassination plan.","“If they managed to kill Zhou Niannian, the people behind them would be happy.","If they didn’t, it wouldn’t matter.","They created another mess and made the entire matter more and more confusing.","“Ever since Uncle Chen came to the capital city, this situation has been complicated.","If you want to solve it!” Xia Jinyuan, who was analyzing calmly, stared at Ye Jian and said in a low voice, “You can tell from the moment Uncle Chen stopped you from taking revenge! that the situation is very difficult.","“Abandoning chess is called that because it has no effect or influence.”","Ye Jian felt disappointed when she heard that.","She had waited for so long but there was no news.","Actually, she had already guessed it! She just wanted to confirm it.","What if! there was news?","After Xia Jinyuan’s calm analysis, she knew that there was no ‘what if’.","Ye Jian, who was in a bad mood, didn’t say anything.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t coax her either.","His woman was very smart.","He didn’t need to coax her too much."]},{"number":4170,"title":"Chapter 4170 He’s Good Medicine","paragraphs":["Chapter 4170: He’s Good Medicine","Chapter 4170: He’s Good Medicine Editor: Henyee Translations","With Xia Jinyuan accompanying her, Ye Jian’s sorrow didn’t stay for long.","Xia Jinyuan was a good medicine for her.","The heavy topic passed.","The two of them leaned on each other and supported each other.","They quietly listened to the ticking of time until their emotions gradually calmed down.","After a while, Ye Jian pushed Xia Jinyuan gently and whispered, “I’m hungry.","Let’s go downstairs and have a meal.”","She wasn’t just hungry.","She was very hungry.","Xia Jinyuan looked at the time.","It was lunchtime.","“Let’s not go downstairs.","We’ll eat in the room.","I’ll call the hotel staff to send food over.” Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to go out at all.","The two of them were in the same room.","They were so close that they only needed to look up to see each other.","He liked this kind of time.","It was warm and reassuring.","Ye Jian didn’t want to go out either.","She liked this kind of interaction as much as he did.","There was no one else but her and him.","The hotel’s food was delivered very quickly.","Xia Jinyuan was still bathing in the bathroom when the attendant knocked on the door with the dining cart.","When he came out, Ye Jian had already placed the food neatly.","Everything was neatly done.","One look and you could tell that she was in the military unit.","Even when she was eating, she had to place the food neatly.","Hearing the commotion, Ye Jian raised her head and said, “That’s really fast.","You!” Her dark eyes widened as she stared at the man who walked out without wearing anything.","This! hooligan!","Her gaze started sliding down from his face.","Yes, it slid down uncontrollably.","It slid to his strong chest muscles and then to his sexy and powerful waist.","Then! it slid to a part that was inappropriate for children.","Ye Jian’s gaze stopped on that part for a few seconds.","She even swallowed her saliva unconsciously.","She didn’t know what other men’s members looked like, but she definitely knew that her man was well-endowed.","Even though it was flaccid, its appearance was still quite spectacular.","Xia Jinyuan was wiping his hair with a towel.","He was more sensitive to Ye Jian’s gaze than anything else.","Seeing that she had been looking at him for a long time, Hooligan Xia raised his eyebrows and teased, “You’ve been looking at me for so long.","Have you taken my measurement?","How is it?","Are you satisfied?”","This! hooligan!","Ye Jian pretended to be calm and looked away in a panic.","She said dryly, “You! You should at least put a towel around yourself.","What if the attendant hadn’t left?","Wouldn’t I have suffered a huge loss?”","Xia Jinyuan laughed heartily.","“Do you think I couldn’t hear what was happening outside?","Come, let’s hear your evaluation first.” Hooligan Xia was doing this on purpose.","He wanted to sit on the couch.","Bue he gave up after taking a look at the fabric couch that didn’t have any cushions.","It wasn’t very hygienic.","It was better to stand.","Ye Jian’s ears turned red.","She put her chopsticks aside and walked quickly to the closet.","As the clothes rustled, a bathrobe prepared by the hotel appeared in her hand.","In order to look calm, she turned around and walked toward Xia Jinyuan with steady footsteps.","She said, “Aren’t you afraid of catching a cold?","Hurry up and wear it.”","Evaluation?","This hooligan was really! acting like a hooligan!","Afraid that he wouldn’t wear it, Ye Jian lifted the bathrobe so that he could put it on.","In the end!","Xia Jinyuan looked at the clean white bathrobe and then at the couch! He decided to be naked until the end!"]},{"number":4171,"title":"Chapter 4171 So Grievous","paragraphs":["Chapter 4171: So Grievous","Chapter 4171: So Grievous Editor: Henyee Translations","The hooligan planned to place the bathrobe on the couch before sitting down.","However, this behavior was really immoral.","Ye Jian could tell what he was thinking and immediately took the initiative.","She threatened, “If you dare to stay naked, I’ll go out now and take all your clothes with me so that you’ll be forced to go out naked.”","This threat! was too effective.","The hooligan immediately changed his mind.","However, Ye Jian still underestimated the hooligan’s methods.","As long as he wanted to be a hooligan, he would always have an opportunity.","He had already put on the bathrobe, but he didn’t tie it.","When he was eating, he was bold.","The bathrobe remained parted in the middle.","Ye Jian’s mouth twitched when she saw this.","He was impossible to guard against!","Throughout the meal, Ye Jian tried her best not to look at him.","She only had eyes for food and nothing else.","Xia Jinyuan sighed repeatedly and asked shamelessly, “Am I that ugly?","Why aren’t you looking at me anymore?","You were lying on me just now.","Why did you turn against me the moment you got out of bed?","“Could it be that my charm can only be displayed in bed?","Why don’t!”","“Eat your food!","You’re saying so much nonsense!” Ye Jian’s ears hurt when she heard that.","She picked up her chopsticks and stuffed the vegetables into his open mouth.","She glared at him and said, “Stop talking.","If you say another word, I’ll go back to the hospital immediately.”","!","That worked.","Comrade Xia Jinyuan became obedient.","However, his handsome expression seemed a little aggrieved.","It was as if Ye Jian had done something that hurt him very much.","From time to time, he would glance at Ye Jian, which made his heart pound.","In the end, Ye Jian had no choice but to put down her chopsticks and wipe her mouth with a tissue.","She stood up and stood in front of Xia Jinyuan.","“Look up.”","Hooligan Xia, who was still chewing his food, raised his head.","Then, Ye Jian held his face and kissed him loudly.","“Alright, focus on eating.”","After kissing him, Ye Jian looked at him seriously.","“If you don’t focus on eating, I’ll get angry.”","After she finished speaking, Ye Jian didn’t hold back her serious praise.","She couldn’t help but lie on Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder and smile.","“Did we look like three-year-olds just now?","We were acting like fools.”","Her laughter was very relaxed without any gloominess.","Ye Jian was free from any burden and laughing like a child.","Only Xia Jinyuan could let her be this way.","Xia Jinyuan raised his hand and rubbed her head.","He laughed softly.","“I’m the captain of a special forces unit.","I’m the trump card in the hearts of my comrades.","I feel wronged to be called a three-year-old child.”","“You feel wronged?","You’re clearly taking the opportunity to be a hooligan.” Ye Jian lay on him.","Xia Jinyuan grabbed her and let her sit on his lap.","The smile on his handsome face was filled with love.","“Do you know what the definition of being a hooligan is?”","“Being a hooligan refers to making things difficult for a woman, cheating her, or teasing her.","That’s what being a hooligan is.","As for me!” His deep and dark eyes stared at the woman sitting in his arms.","“This is called normal courtship.","I’m courting with admiration.","I’m not being a hooligan at all.”","He was speaking incoherently.","Ye Jian smiled at him and said slowly, “But I said that you’re being a hooligan, so you’re being a hooligan.”","“You’re accusing me of something I didn’t do.","It would be a shame if I didn’t let myself do it.” As he spoke, he hugged Ye Jian and stood up abruptly.","His eyes made Ye Jian’s heart tremble.","“I’ll commit the crime.” As he spoke, he carried Ye Jian and walked into the suite."]},{"number":4172,"title":"Chapter 4172 Midway Point","paragraphs":["Chapter 4172: Midway Point","Chapter 4172: Midway Point Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian felt as if there was something pounding in her heart.","She felt flustered, and her hands were sweating.","She seemed so helpless.","“Really! Really?","Really?” Lying on the bed and looking at the man who was leaning over, Ye Jian bit her lip and said shyly, “Can we not do it for real?","Is there any other solution?","We can solve it in other ways.”","If it really came down to it! Well, she felt uncertain and was a little flustered.","Xia Jinyuan leaned over her and whispered something in her ear.","Ye Jian’s face turned red at a speed visible to the naked eye.","It was as if she was drunk.","It was so bright that Xia Jinyuan’s breathing became heavier.","Naturally, they couldn’t do it for real.","But they could change to another method.","They couldn’t hit homerun, but foreplay was still fine.","The two of them spent their time together loving each other.","They nibbled each other and slowly explored each other’s body.","If Ye Jian hadn’t asked Xia Jinyuan if he was done, he would have continued his battle.","Later on, Ye Jian couldn’t take it anymore.","Xia Jinyuan let Ye Jian use her hands again.","A vivid scene was unfolding fiercely.","Under Ye Jian’s relentless efforts, the man’s low voice could be heard from the room.","He seemed to be panting.","It was as if he had exploded or freed himself from something.","Then! there was a sound.","Following that, an unusual smell was injected into the hot air.","After exercising, Ye Jian was exhausted.","She was breathing heavily like a fish trapped in the shallows.","She needed oxygen urgently.","Xia Jinyuan, who was hugging her from behind, didn’t know whether to laugh or cry when he heard her panting.","“Just now, I was probably the one who exerted the most energy, right?","Why are you so limp and panting now?","You haven’t even started the actual thing and you’re already so tired?","What will happen in the future?”","He lowered his head and kissed her round and beautiful shoulder.","The teasing in his laughter made Ye Jian want to cover her face with the blanket.","Although they didn’t cross the last hurdle, she felt that they had done everything.","“You’re sweating more than me.","Nervous?","Afraid?” he asked again.","Ye Jian closed her eyes and replied with fluttering eyelashes, “Both.”","“It’s just new to you.","It’ll be fine the next time.","We won’t hit the homerun today.","The next time!” He didn’t let her turn her back to him.","He hugged her and flipped her over.","The two of them faced each other.","Seeing that Ye Jian’s face was as red as a blooming flower, Xia Jinyuan lowered his head and kissed the tip of her nose.","“Let’s rest for a while before going to wash up.”","“You go first.","And! that thing! you take care of it.”","After Ye Jian finished speaking, she closed her eyes tightly.","She didn’t even dare to open her eyes.","She was so shy that the smile in Xia Jinyuan’s eyes couldn’t be any wider.","“Silly girl, what should I do in the future?","Are you going to close your eyes and not look at me after I’m done?”","Ye Jian didn’t say anything.","She shook her head to express her rejection.","She rejected all attempts at conversation.","Now, she just wanted to be alone and calm down.","Actually, Xia Jinyuan was a little embarrassed too.","After all, he was a novice too.","He solved his problem without even entering! He was a little embarrassed too."]},{"number":4173,"title":"Chapter 4173 Improvement","paragraphs":["Chapter 4173: Improvement","Chapter 4173: Improvement Editor: Henyee Translations","However, men would always be able to accept such things faster than women.","“Okay, I’ll clean up first.","You rest for a while.” Ye Jian’s face was so red that it was about to burn.","If he continued talking to her, Xia Jinyuan was worried that she would kick him off the bed.","He might as well get off the bed obediently.","He put on his bathrobe and picked up the condom he used just now.","Comrade Xia was just short of whistling as he entered the bathroom.","After he got off the bed, Ye Jian dared to open her eyes a little.","It was not until he walked into the bathroom and closed the door that Ye Jian dared to open her eyes completely and breathe heavily like a fish returning to the water.","The sound of running water could be heard from the bathroom.","Right on the heels of that, she heard him humming.","He wasn’t humming any popular songs.","They were all military songs.","Ye Jian laughed as she listened.","Unexpectedly, Captain Xia still stopped himself in the end.","He was so impassioned that she almost thought that they would definitely cross that line, but he held it in.","“It’s not the right time.","I don’t want you to feel burdened.","I’ll just bear with it.","But doing this is good too.”","While they were rubbing against each other, she closed her eyes and heard him say to her in a low voice, “We shouldn’t do it in a hotel.","We should go to our own home.","“It’ll make for a more beautiful and unforgettable memory.","It can allow you to completely accept me.”","He spoke in a very low voice.","His voice was extremely tense, but it instantly extinguished her uneasiness.","After the two of them cleaned up and lay back on the bed, Xia Jinyuan saw the inner part of Ye Jian’s leg that was red from his rubbing.","He quickly got up from the bed and said, “I’ll be back soon.” Then, he left the room.","When he returned to the room, there was a bottle of cooling gel in his hand.","He didn’t expect her inner legs to turn so red.","The large patches of red looked like an allergic reaction.","His heart skipped a beat.","He shouldn’t have taken so long.","He shouldn’t have used so much strength.","He shouldn’t have used such a method! Xia Jinyuan suddenly regretted it.","When the cold gel was applied, the burning sensation was instantly relieved.","Ye Jian, who was sitting down, saw the man’s pursed thin lips and the frustration on his face.","She knew that his heart was aching.","“It’s nothing.","I’ll get better after sleeping for a while.” Ye Jian poked his shoulder with her finger and whispered, “It just looks scary.","It’s not a big deal.”","“There won’t be a next time.” Xia Jinyuan didn’t raise his head and replied.","His fingers continued to smear the gel on her legs.","Ye Jian didn’t know how to answer for a moment.","There wouldn’t be a next time! She would find it embarrassing if she replied with, “It’s okay.”","In the end, Ye Jian hugged the neck of the man who was feeling guilty.","She shook his arm gently.","“I want to sleep again.","After we wake up, we’ll go to the hospital to visit Jing.”","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t upset.","The little fellow had grown up.","In the past, she didn’t act coquettishly toward him.","This time, she was able to do it easily.","Afraid that she would be tired, Xia Jinyuan let her lie down properly.","Then, he gently covered the two of them with the blanket.","“I’ve applied the medicine.","Don’t rub your legs.","If your condition still isn’t better after waking up, we’ll go to the doctor and get you some medicine.","You still need to train.","You have to take care of yourself.”","A moment of greed had ruined things.","There wouldn’t be a next time.","He thought that he would be fine, but he didn’t expect to be affected.","Xia Jinyuan, who had zero experience, didn’t expect Ye Jian’s inner legs to be red because he lasted too long."]},{"number":4174,"title":"Chapter 4174 Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4174: Attack","Chapter 4174: Attack","Editor: Henyee Translations","When Ye Jian woke up, her legs were fine.","Xia Jinyuan was relieved after confirming that they weren’t red or swollen.","Ye Jian didn’t feel that there was anything wrong.","Usually, when she bumped into something during training, it was normal for her to have some swelling and redness on her body.","She would just massage it and apply some cooling gel to reduce the swelling.","She actually felt that Xia Jinyuan was making a mountain out of a molehill.","However, seeing that he was so nervous, Ye Jian felt! good.","When they left the hotel, it was already past four in the afternoon.","The two of them arrived at the hospital in high spirits.","First, they welcomed Xu Wen’s questioning looks.","Then, she winked at Ye Jian secretly.","The meaning behind it was obvious.","Ye Jian smiled and looked back at her calmly.","Because nothing substantial happened, of course, she was calm.","If something really happened, she would definitely be too embarrassed to face her roommates.","Xu Wen chuckled when she saw this.","Not bad, Ye Jian actually endured it.","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows as she replied to Xu Wen.","Xia Jinyuan noticed their gazes.","He could tell that his lover was very happy with her two roommates.","Their relationship was very deep.","They had been schoolmates for four years.","After graduating, even if they went to their respective positions and gradually lost contact with each other as they moved jobs, the memories of their four years in military school and four years as classmates would still be fresh in their minds.","Ye Jian and the other two had many topics to talk about.","Xia Jinyuan, who was sitting with them, was a loyal listener.","Occasionally, he would say a few words when Ye Jian threw the topic to him.","He would never take the initiative to interrupt.","He only had Ye Jian in his eyes.","His gentle smile and doting gaze were all for Ye Jian.","When it was Xu Wen’s and He Jing’s turn to speak, his gentle smile would turn into one of basic courtesy and he would give off a sense of distance between them.","Xia Jinyuan looked elegant, but Xu Wen and He Jing felt that he was not an easy man to get along with.","Xu Wen was afraid that Ye Jian would suffer, so she probed intentionally.","In the end, she casually said, “I really don’t understand why some people think that they can still be friends after breaking up.","If it were me, I wouldn’t be able to accept my boyfriend continuing to contact his ex-girlfriend.","I can’t help it.","I’m narrow-minded and won’t contact my ex.","So I also hope that my current boyfriend won’t contact his ex-girlfriend.”","When the topic of ‘boyfriends and girlfriends can still be friends after breaking up’ was brought up, everyone would express their opinions.","Some people felt that it didn’t matter, while others insisted that it was a problem.","In short, they had their own opinions and reasons.","The reason why Xu Wen asked this was for Ye Jian’s sake.","She didn’t want her good friend to encounter any trouble in her relationship.","That was because the three of them had talked about this topic before.","The three of them had the same opinion.","After breaking up, for the sake of their future partner, they shouldn’t continue to be friends with their ex.","Xu Wen threw out the topic because she wanted to hear what Xia Jinyuan’s stance was.","Ye Jian tilted her head and smiled.","This question wasn’t a problem for Captain Xia at all.","Also, with Captain Xia’s sharpness, he could see Xu Wen’s plan clearly.","If she wanted to make things difficult for him! Compared to Captain Xia, it was like Xu Wen was still in kindergarten while he was already out in society.","They were not on the same level at all.","Captain Xia could even resolve Commander Xia’s attack easily, let alone Xu Wen’s kindergarten-level attack."]},{"number":4175,"title":"Chapter 4175 A Tough Answer","paragraphs":["Chapter 4175: A Tough Answer","Chapter 4175: A Tough Answer","Editor: Henyee Translations","How could the smiling Xia Jinyuan fail to see that among the three roommates, Xu Wen was the one with the most ideas?","Hearing that, he smiled and said, “Jian and I are both each other’s first loves, so we don’t have any exes.","However, my opinion is that since an ex is an ex, we should cut off all ties.","Maintaining a broken relationship is harmful to the current one.","After all, we would’ve been intimate before.","“My father said that if I didn’t marry Jian, he wouldn’t want me anymore and would directly acknowledge Jian as his daughter.","My grandparents have also said that other than Jian, no other woman can step into my family.","Even my uncles, aunts, cousins, and cousins-in-law told me that since there were so many men in the family, one less wouldn’t affect anything.”","!","This answer was a strong enough counter-attack.","Xu Wen’s following questions were like bubbles.","They could be easily poked to resolve.","If she understood correctly, Ye Jian had already met her boyfriend’s father, grandparents, uncles, cousins, and cousins-in-law!","She had received the high recognition of her boyfriend’s entire family! If the man in front of her didn’t marry Ye Jian, he wouldn’t even be able to go home.","Xu Wen felt that! She patted Ye Jian’s shoulder heavily and said seriously, “As expected of Jian.","You’re top-notch in all aspects.","Well done!”","She was so beautiful that the man’s family said that they didn’t want the man and only wanted the woman.","Ye Jian was amazing!","He Jing was also shocked.","In the morning, she told Xu Wen that she didn’t know if Ye Jian had met her boyfriend’s family or if she had the chance to get to know them.","She understood that dating was a matter between the couple, but marriage was really between the two families.","If the man’s family was unhappy or the woman’s family was unhappy, it was easy for problems to arise between the two of them.","Hence, she didn’t stop Xu Wen from probing just now.","She just wanted to know Ye Jian’s boyfriend’s attitude.","Unexpectedly, Ye Jian had already met his family.","She was only one step away from success!","She didn’t expect Xia Jinyuan to be Ye Jian’s first love either.","He Jing found it unbelievable.","The handsome man was actually Ye Jian’s first love.","It was hard to tell.","Xu Wen said, “You’re a young master from the capital city.","You’re not bad-looking and your family background isn’t bad either.","It’s admirable that you’re Jian’s first love.","“Your answer to the topic of being friends with your ex is not bad either.","The three of us have discussed it before and agreed that we would never contact our exes after breaking up.","Of course, this has nothing to do with Jian because she has never had a boyfriend and you’re her first love.","“However, you know as well that our Jian is an outstanding girl.","There are a ton of male students wooing her!”","Ye Jian exclaimed and asked her, “Where did you get this data?","From the male students who speak to me?”","“Besides training and studying, your life is like that of a nun.","It’s normal that you don’t know about these things.","Anyway, He Jing and I know.”","He Jing expressed that! she didn’t know either.","Xu Wen gave her a look.","He Jing didn’t react, but they had developed a tacit understanding over the years.","She just needed to answer affirmatively now.","However, her reaction was half a beat too slow.","She exclaimed first and then said, “Oh, that’s right.” The credibility in her words instantly decreased."]},{"number":4176,"title":"Chapter 4176 Sweet Daily","paragraphs":["Chapter 4176: Sweet Daily","Chapter 4176: Sweet Daily Editor: Henyee Translations","Xu Wen was so angry that she felt her chest hurting.","Did her comrades not realize that she was putting pressure on Xia Jinyuan?","Xia Jinyuan smiled and shook his head.","The male students who had a crush on his lover! He didn’t need to think about it to be aware of these things.","However, compared to Qin Xiu, he didn’t take them seriously.","Without her roommates’ cooperation, Xu Wen endured it to the end and said to Xia Jinyuan seriously, “So, please treat our Jian well.","You can’t let her suffer any grievances.","We’re all Jian’s family.","If you dare to treat her badly, our family will definitely find trouble with you.”","This conversation was undoubtedly heart-warming.","Ye Jian held Xu Wen’s hand gently and said in a low voice, “Don’t worry.","If he dares to bully me, my family won’t have to do anything.","I’ll deal with him myself.”","“I will deal with myself first,” Xia Jinyuan replied as he looked at her gently.","Xu Wen said, “Alright, alright.","Let’s end our conversation here.” This couple was simply! so sweet that she felt as though she was drenched in honey.","However! there wasn’t much time left for such sweet days.","They couldn’t count them by ‘days’.","They had to count them by hours.","Tomorrow morning, He Jing would be discharged from the hospital.","It was already six in the evening.","They needed to report back to school before 2:00 pm tomorrow.","They still had 14 hours of interaction, including the time to send Jian back to school.","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan planned to invite the two of them out for a meal, but they were rejected.","Then, Xu Wen asked them to leave the ward.","This time, Xu Wen didn’t remind the two of them to be ‘cautious’.","From today’s conversation, she could tell that the man called Xia Jinyuan loved Ye Jian.","A man who knew how to love and protect his girlfriend had to be a good man.","Jian had found a good boyfriend!","Xia Jinyuan walked out of the hospital and smiled at Ye Jian.","“Not bad.","I have the urge to introduce the two of them to the bachelors in the team.”","This suggestion was not bad.","However, Xu Wen said that she would not find a husband who would not go home all year round because she did not want her husband to be like her father.","As for Jing, she hoped to be in the same city as her husband because she would be able to take care of both sides of their families during the holidays in the future.","Xia Jinyuan was just saying it casually.","He wouldn’t really put it into action.","After dinner, the two of them didn’t return to the hotel immediately.","It was rare for them to spend time with each other.","They even went to walk on the streets together.","This time, Ye Jian wasn’t wearing the military uniform.","The two of them held hands and enjoyed their time together like an ordinary couple.","This was the first time the two of them went out shopping hand-in-hand after confirming their relationship for three and a half years.","They even went shopping in the women’s wear area.","Xia Jinyuan smiled and accompanied Ye Jian the entire time.","When she was trying on the clothes, he waited quietly.","When she came out, he praised her sincerely.","Seeing this, another woman who was trying on clothes even secretly pinched her boyfriend’s waist.","The two of them were too outstanding.","There were many people during the holidays, and they were almost misunderstood as a celebrity couple.","In the end, the two of them walked out of the mall empty-handed without buying any clothes.","That was because they couldn’t wear casual clothes many times throughout the year.","They wore their military uniforms in spring, summer, autumn, and winter.","Ye Jian felt that it was a waste to buy casual clothes.","No matter how beautiful the clothes were, they had to be kept in the closet.","The two of them held hands and walked on the streets.","However, they didn’t know that Demon King Li had already walked out of the airport.","He got into a taxi that went straight to Ye Jian’s military school."]},{"number":4177,"title":"Chapter 4177 Happily","paragraphs":["Chapter 4177: Happily","Chapter 4177: Happily Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, who had been in love for a few years, held hands and shopped like an ordinary couple until 11:00 pm.","They even went to the snack street for supper.","Ye Jian, who was sitting on a lounge chair by the street and resting her head on Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder, felt like she was dreaming.","She didn’t dare to believe that she and Xia Jinyuan could enjoy such a comfortable night together.","It was really like a dream.","Ye Jian lowered her eyes slightly and looked at her hand that was held tightly by the man beside her.","Then, she raised her head and looked at his side profile.","Under the streetlamp, Ye Jian saw a smile on his side profile.","He was obviously as happy as her.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but say softly, “How blissful.","I hope that we’ll be able to have another night like tonight in the future.”","She couldn’t bear to go back to the hotel now.","She was a little greedy and wanted time to last longer so that the two of them could spend more time alone together.","It was the same for couples who came and went on the streets.","Perhaps they didn’t think that it would be difficult for the two of them to hold hands and walk around the streets.","They only needed a phone call and a thought to immediately ask each other out.","Then, they could hold hands and go shopping together.","This way of life was within reach, so they didn’t cherish it as much.","If there was a day when their love wasn’t as passionate, even if their memories contained countless days of holding each other’s hands and shopping together, they wouldn’t think much of them.","To Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian, the memory of them holding hands and shopping together today would remain vivid in their minds for the rest of their lives.","When they were old, they would still remember it vividly as if it was just yesterday.","That was because there was too little time for the two of them to hold hands and go shopping together.","They had been in love with each other for a few years, but tonight was their first time going shopping together like an ordinary couple.","Hearing her soft voice, Xia Jinyuan felt guilty.","He held her hand and placed it by his mouth to kiss the back of her hand.","He replied in a low voice, “I’m sorry to have made you suffer grievances.","I can’t give us too many days of holding hands and shopping.","Please forgive me.”","He couldn’t give her the life of an ordinary couple.","He felt guilty.","He could only love her deeply every minute and every second of each day and let her know that he would always be by her side and would never go far.","Ye Jian didn’t feel wronged.","She didn’t think that her man needed to apologize to her either.","Hearing this, she smiled and said, “Captain Xia, I’m very happy.","Really, I’m truly happy.”","With him by her side, no matter how hard it was or how tired she was, or how hard it was to persevere alone, she was still happy.","‘Because you’re my Captain Xia, the only man I love deeply.","Because I understand you and myself, I’m really happy.’","“I’m happy that I got to be so relaxed tonight.","But if I really lead such a life every day, I’ll feel uneasy.","I’ll think that it’s a waste and regret it.","“It’s enough to experience days like this once or twice.","I can think back on these days in the future when I’m tired and sweep away all my fatigue.”","Ye Jian said in a low voice.","The smile in her eyes was deep and happy.","Xia Jinyuan tilted his head slightly and looked at the woman beside him.","Listening to her answer, he felt that his life was worth it.","Finding her and having her was really worth it.","Xia Jinyuan let go of her hand and hugged her shoulders tightly.","He said gently, “As long as I have time, I’ll definitely spend more time with you like tonight.","“We also need to relax and occasionally return to our normal lives.","We can hold hands and shop like ordinary lovers.","We’ll have more and more of such days in the future.”"]},{"number":4178,"title":"Chapter 4178 Secretly Happy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4178: Secretly Happy","Chapter 4178: Secretly Happy Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan’s voice was like a melodious cello.","Every word he said was like a musical note.","It was so light and wonderful that it knocked on Y eJian’s heart, making her so happy.","Ye Jian looked around with a smile in her eyes.","Then, while there were people coming and going, she quickly raised her head and secretly kissed Xia Jinyuan’s cheek.","After kissing him, she buried her head in his shoulder and secretly laughed.","Although she was a little embarrassed, she was very happy.","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but laugh softly.","He rubbed the back of her head and kissed the top of her head calmly.","He smiled gently and said, “In the future, we’ll walk and shop like the other couples.","We can have those days too, but they just won’t be a priority for us.”","After the secret kiss, Ye Jian laughed and laid on Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder again.","Her gaze was calm and distant as she looked at the crowd on the streets at 11:00 pm.","Ye Jian saw a young couple who didn’t know what to say but had sweet smiles on their faces.","She saw a few women holding plushies that were won from playing games.","She saw a few guys laughing as they walked.","She looked at them, and the smile on her face got deeper.","Under the colorful neon lights, Ye Jian looked at the man beside her.","The colorful lights were reflected in her dark yet bright eyes.","When she smiled, the colors of the lights dimmed.","Only her smile was bright and beautiful.","“I’ll wait for the next time we go shopping together, but Captain Xia, the life I want is not a comfortable one.","The days I want aren’t like this either.","Although tonight is a luxury for you and me, it’s not what I want.","“That’s why you don’t have to feel guilty for not being able to accompany me.","Our lives are not focused on this.","There’s nothing to feel guilty about.”","Her words filled Xia Jinyuan’s chest, making him feel satisfied.","He held her shoulders tightly, letting the two of them snuggle up even more.","A soft sigh escaped from his mouth.","This was his woman.","Just like what Old Master Xia said, the stubbornness in her bones and the courage in her blood were like a natural-born soldier’s.","She would feel happy over a short period of happiness, and she would feel satisfied because of companionship.","However, she would never indulge in the long-term and seek comfort.","After a long time, Xia Jinyuan kissed her forehead and said in a low voice, “We have a long way to go together.”","“Yes, definitely.” Ye Jian nodded.","She believed that she and Captain Xia would be able to go far.","There were a lot of people here.","Although it was late at night, the streets were still lively.","The two of them stood up and gave their seats to another couple.","It was past 11:00 pm.","They had to return to the hotel to rest.","The two of them took a taxi back to the hotel and walked into the hotel lobby.","Just as they reached the middle of the lobby, Xia Jinyuan, who was lowering his head to speak, frowned.","His gaze swept across the couch in the corner of the lobby like an arrow.","Seeing his cousin-in-law sitting on the couch and looking at him coldly, Comrade Xia Jinyuan immediately turned his sharp gaze into something as gentle as the spring breeze.","He whispered to Ye Jian, “This time, your real family member is here.","Five o’clock, single-seater couch.”","His cousin-in-law, who was not to be trifled with, was here.","If Li Jinnian’s gaze could materialize, it would definitely be like an ax that flickered with a cold light.","The ax would cut off his hand that was holding Ye Jian tightly."]},{"number":4179,"title":"Chapter 4179 Disobedient, Looking For A Beating","paragraphs":["Chapter 4179: Disobedient, Looking For A Beating","Chapter 4179: Disobedient, Looking For A Beating Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian followed Xia Jinyuan’s words and reacted quickly.","She looked in the direction of the couch, and her eyes lit up.","She held Xia Jinyuan’s hand tightly and ran toward her cousin, who was smiling at her.","“Don’t run.","The floor just got waxed.” Li Jinnian got up when he saw his cousin running over.","He hurriedly reminded her, “Be careful not to fall.”","Xia Jinyuan grabbed his girlfriend in time.","All her attention was on her cousin.","He felt a little! jealous.","His cousin-in-law was here to take up his little fox’s time.","Most importantly! he wouldn’t be able to sleep with his little fox tonight.","At the thought of this, Lieutenant Colonel Xia felt as if he had been struck by lightning.","Tomorrow, the little fox would have to go back to school.","There wasn’t much time for them to hold hands and walk together like today.","He had planned to just chat under the blanket tonight.","He wouldn’t do anything else.","Unexpectedly!","Man proposed, God disposed.","With his cousin-in-law around, he couldn’t even think about chatting with Ye Jian under the blanket.","Before they became legal husband and wife, his cousin-in-law would never allow the two of them to stay in the same room and sleep on the same bed!","Ye Jian was overjoyed because of her cousin’s appearance.","How could she think too much?","She quickly walked in front of Li Jinnian and smiled.","“Cousin, when did you come?","Did you wait for a long time?”","She didn’t ask Li Jinnian how he found the hotel she was staying in.","There was no need to ask.","As long as Li Jinnian wanted to know, he would definitely know.","Li Jinnian glanced at Xia Jinyuan coldly.","When he looked at Ye Jian, Demon King Li’s expression was like a spring breeze.","There was a faint smile on his handsome face.","“Not long.”","As he spoke, he raised his head and rubbed Ye Jian’s head.","This action! Xia Jinyuan liked it, and Li Jinnian liked it too.","The difference was that one did it out of love, while the other did it out of kinship.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at the hand that was rubbing his girlfriend’s head from the corners of his eyes.","He smiled and greeted his cousin-in-law, “Long time no see.”","“Yes, long time no see.”","Li Jinnian greeted him simply.","He glanced at the two of them who were still holding hands and said calmly, “Did you go out to play?","Are you tired?","Sit down and rest for a while.”","“We went to the commercial streets for a walk.","I’m almost graduating, and this is the first time I’ve been to such places.","It was very lively.","Many shops stay open until early in the morning,” Ye Jian replied truthfully.","Then, she asked Li Jinnian, “Cousin, are you on holiday?","How many days of rest do you have?","Did you go home?”","She asked questions one after another.","Li Jinnian pointed at the single-seater couch he was sitting on earlier and smiled.","“Even if you’re not tired, let’s sit down and chat.","I want to see you sit before I answer your three questions.”","Actually, he had asked three questions consecutively too.","Every question had a hidden meaning.","With a cousin-in-law like this, Xia Jinyuan could only be honest.","If he dared to be dishonest?","Hah!","He would suffer internal injuries in the hands of his cousin-in-law.","Hence, Xia Jinyuan said considerately, “You’re right.","Even if you’re not tired, you should sit down.","You guys chat first.","I’ll order some drinks.","What do you want to drink?”","He let Ye Jian sit on the single sofa and asked his cousin-in-law, Demon King Li.","Demon King Li was much colder to Xia Jinyuan, the person who snatched his cousin away.","He said politely, “A glass of water, thanks.”","Ye Jian wanted water too.","Xia Jinyuan walked straight to the attendant.","Seeing that the cousins were already chatting, Xia Jinyuan narrowed his eyes and walked to the front desk.","He needed to hurry up and book two rooms."]},{"number":4180,"title":"Chapter 4180 Devil Cousin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4180: Devil Cousin","Chapter 4180: Devil Cousin Editor: Henyee Translations","If he were to enter the same room as the little fox when they went upstairs later, a fight would probably break out tonight considering Li Jinnian’s temper.","Li Jinnian said, “I’m not on holiday.","I came to participate in a meeting at your military school.","We need a batch of technical talents, and we plan to choose a batch from your school.”","In 2003, China’s maritime air defense was at a disadvantage, especially after the big event that happened on the first day of April 2001.","A pilot sacrificed his life to protect China’s maritime air defense.","Amidst the sorrow of the entire country, the military issued three red documents in a row.","That was how the southern sea guarded by Li Jinnian and the rest entered the construction phase.","Construction required talents to be imported.","They needed to start importing talents from the military school.","Together, they would complete two of the three red documents.","These were secrets of the navy and the air force.","Li Jinnian naturally couldn’t reveal them to Ye Jian.","He only said that he needed a group of people to recruit him.","Ye Jian naturally wouldn’t ask in detail.","When she heard that he was going to her school, her eyes lit up.","“Will you be staying in our school too?”","“Of course.","Your school provides accommodation.","Why should I stay outside?” Li Jinnian saw that she was so happy about his arrival.","He, who had always been serious and cold, shed his coldness and said in a warm voice, “I can take this opportunity to take a good look at your performance in school.","You have to be vigilant.","If I find out that there’s a problem, I won’t show mercy.”","This sentence was very familiar.","Ye Jian instantly remembered that year when Captain Xia brought her to her cousin’s team.","That was when she saw her cousin, who was called a ‘demon’ by the water ghosts.","On the first day of training, he only said to her, “I won’t show mercy.” After that, he didn’t give any instructions and only glanced at her occasionally.","Ye Jian still remembered that gaze! It was filled with distrust!","At that time, she was also provoked by his gaze.","She didn’t dare to show it and only competed in secret.","After a week, she received personal guidance from her cousin.","Now, her cousin was saying again that he wouldn’t show mercy.","That meant he really wouldn’t.","Ye Jian heard familiar footsteps and looked up instinctively.","She saw her handsome boyfriend coming over with three glasses of water.","As she looked at him, Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile.","“Why are you laughing?” She suddenly laughed.","Li Jinnian, who didn’t understand, asked, “Do you think I’m joking?”","“No, no, no.” Ye Jian smiled and sighed.","“I’m laughing because you and Captain Xia take such good care of me.","But during training, the two of you are the most ruthless to me.","“During the underwater training, I didn’t have the time to rush out of the water.","Cousin, do you remember how you treated me at that time?","You raised your leg directly.","You didn’t even use your hands.","You stepped on my head and pressed it into the water.”","!","Why wouldn’t he remember?","Li Jinnian’s breathing quickened.","He adjusted his sitting position unnaturally and said calmly, “I don’t remember.","I treat everyone equally during training.","I don’t have an impression of that happening.”","That time, when he raised his leg and stepped on the water, he remembered that the person he stepped on wasn’t a male soldier in the team.","It was! a female soldier.","Unfortunately, his reaction was a little slow.","When he realized it, he had already stepped on her.","Thus, he simply didn’t retract his foot.","Ye Jian felt that it was impossible for her cousin not to have any impression of it.","She still remembered that when she surfaced again, the water ghosts from the observation team ran over to pull her out.","Big Shark even secretly told her not to take offense.","When Demon King stepped on her, he almost fell into the water too."]},{"number":4181,"title":"Chapter 4181 Confrontation","paragraphs":["Chapter 4181: Confrontation","Chapter 4181: Confrontation Editor: Henyee Translations","However, it was also possible to forget.","Just like what her cousin said, he treated everyone equally during training.","That day, when he stepped into the water, he might have thought that he was stepping on a male soldier.","Hence, Ye Jian didn’t probe further.","She smiled casually and said, “Since you forgot, never mind, then.","I’m afraid it’s hard for me to forget.","That stomp was unforgettable.”","Li Jinnian nodded and said casually, “There are many unforgettable things during training.","It’s normal.","I have those unforgettable memories too.”","As he spoke, he jerked his chin slightly to the front.","“I’ll go and help him.","He’s bringing over three glasses of water alone.","I don’t want him to knock the glasses over.”","Xia Jinyuan, who was walking over with water, was Demon King Li’s savior.","After he finished speaking, he immediately stood up to go and help Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan, who didn’t know what was going on, was shocked when he saw his cousin-in-law coming to help him get the water personally.","Ye Jian wanted to say there was no need, but her cousin stood up quickly and strode out.","Why did it look like! he was running away?","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes slightly.","She quickly understood.","He was running away!","Her cousin didn’t forget that he stepped on her head, forcing her into the water back then.","When she suddenly mentioned it, her cousin felt so awkward that he didn’t dare to face her.","Hence! he escaped.","At this moment, Li Jinnian’s gaze softened as he looked at Xia Jinyuan.","Since a good excuse had appeared, Li Jinnian naturally welcomed Xia Jinyuan.","After taking one of the glasses of water, Li Jinnian thanked him and sat back on the couch.","When Xia Jinyuan sat down, Demon King Li said calmly, “Just now, my cousin said that you were also quite ruthless to her during training.","I only know about that one instance.","Could it be that you’ve done things that are more ruthless?”","This time, it was Xia Jinyuan’s turn to adjust his sitting position slightly.","His instincts told him that his cousin-in-law must have talked about some sensitive topics, particularly their ruthless treatment toward the little fox.","Especially when Li Jinnian said that Xia Jinyuan was also quite ruthless to Ye Jian during training.","The word ‘also’ was the most important part.","It could be understood that in the past, his cousin-in-law was very harsh on the little fox during training.","That was why he said ‘also’ when he asked him.","In the blink of an eye, Xia Jinyuan had already thought of the crux of the matter.","Hence, he smiled and said, “I was quite ruthless.","That year, when she came back from your hands, she told me that there’s another person aside from me who’s also ruthless to her.","“Back then, when I sent her to your team, I think you were probably more ruthless than me given your boldness.","After all, your unit was just established.","You had to be ruthless.”","“That’s why my cousin said that we were ruthless to her during training.” Li Jinnian finished his sentence calmly and threw the problem back.","“I wonder how ruthless you were to my cousin?","I’ll have a good chat with her later.”","If the cousin-in-law and the boyfriend competed, the cousin-in-law was sure to win.","Although Xia Jinyuan had lost to his future cousin-in-law, he was calm.","He even smiled and said, “Why don’t we chat together tonight?","We haven’t seen each other for a long time.","I can’t bear to spend time sleeping.”","So be it.","Xia Jinyuan wanted to see how long Li Jinnian could talk for.","Li Jinnian nodded.","“Sure.","Do you want to talk in your room?","Or my cousin’s room?”","Hearing that, Ye Jian adjusted her sitting position slightly.","She and Captain Xia weren’t staying in different rooms.","The two of them slept in the same room."]},{"number":4182,"title":"Chapter 4182 Expert, Captain Xia","paragraphs":["Chapter 4182: Expert, Captain Xia","Chapter 4182: Expert, Captain Xia Editor: Henyee Translations","After the moment of happiness passed, Ye Jian started to feel uneasy.","How was she going to explain to her cousin later?","She couldn’t say that she only came today.","No, no, no.","She couldn’t say that.","Since her cousin went to the hotel to wait for her, he should already know that she and Captain Xia slept in the hotel last night.","In that case, did her cousin also know that she slept in the same room as Captain Xia last night?","He probably didn’t know.","If he did, he wouldn’t have asked which room they would go to.","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief.","It was fine if he didn’t know.","In order not to expose herself, she would just say that they would go to Captain Xia’s room.","“Both are fine.","Our rooms are on the same floor.” Xia Jinyuan smiled.","“One is 1608 and the other is 1601.","They’re very close.”","Huh?","Huh?","Two rooms?","Ye Jian blinked and glanced at the man.","When did he book two rooms?","Last night?","That was impossible.","Last night, she only saw one room key card in his hand.","Li Jinnian didn’t see Ye Jian’s small actions.","He only stared at Xia Jinyuan.","Based on his understanding of Xia Jinyuan! Would a fellow who was never honest and would bite a piece of bone when he saw it book two rooms?","Hah!","When they entered the hotel just now, Xia Jinyuan clearly wished that he could cling to his cousin.","He held her hand and hugged her shoulders.","He made so many cheap tricks.","How could he have booked two rooms?","Li Jinnian, who didn’t believe it, saw the messy bed and the cup on the coffee table in Room 1601, as well as two pairs of unopened disposable slippers.","Then, he saw the same situation in Room 1608.","He finally believed that Xia Jinyuan had indeed booked two rooms.","Standing in Room 1608, which was the room where the two of them slept together last night, Ye Jian would have thought that she slept in Room 1601 last night instead of Room 1608 if she didn’t see the glass of beverage that she didn’t finish during lunch.","The two rooms! It looked like the two of them slept in separate rooms last night!","Li Jinnian’s room was Room 1613.","He was carrying a travel bag in his hand.","He took the room key card from Xia Jinyuan and said to Ye Jian, “I’ll go back to my room to wash up before coming back.","If you want to sleep, go back to your room to sleep.","I have something to talk to him about.”","Ye Jian’s room was Room 1601.","Hearing this, she shook her head and said, “I woke up quite late today.","I don’t want to sleep.","Let’s have a chat later.","I haven’t seen you in a long time.","I want to talk.”","“Alright.” Li Jinnian smiled and rubbed Ye Jian’s head.","He rubbed Ye Jian’s short hair into a bird’s nest before stopping.","“I’ll be back in five minutes.”","Xia Jinyuan said, “Okay, we’ll wait for you.”","What could he do in five minutes?","At most, Xia Jinyuan could only make a cheap shot.","Demon King Li, who was protecting his cousin, chuckled and left the room.","With her cousin gone, Ye Jian patted her chest and exclaimed, “I was so nervous.” Just as Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but laugh, she asked, “Why are there two rooms?","There wasn’t the second room before.","The second room even looks like someone has slept in it.","How did you do it?","Did you expect my cousin to come?","Don’t tell me you’re participating in the talent recruitment meeting too?","“Dealing with this is just a small matter.” Ye Jian’s nervous appearance successfully made Lieutenant Colonel Xia laugh continuously.","He hugged her and explained to her in detail, “When I went to get water, I hurriedly booked a room at the front desk.","I also got an attendant to go to Room 1601 and mess up the shoes and towels.","I told them to make it seem like someone has slept in Room 1601.”","“When we were chatting downstairs, the attendant on the 16th floor was helping us to mess up the room.","In their line of work, they know how to make it look like someone has slept in the room.","Hence, Room 1601 became what you saw just now.”"]},{"number":4183,"title":"Chapter 4183 Amazing Captain Xia","paragraphs":["Chapter 4183: Amazing Captain Xia","Chapter 4183: Amazing Captain Xia Editor: Henyee Translations","Such a small matter was not a problem for Xia Jinyuan at all.","With just a few words, he resolved Ye Jian’s nervousness.","After listening to his arrangements, Ye Jian felt that these special forces soldiers were really capable of doing bad things.","They were on par with each other!","Just now, even her cousin, who was also a special forces soldier, was fooled.","Ye Jian gave her man a thumbs-up.","“You actually did such a huge thing in the time it took to pour water.","You’re a prophet, Captain Xia.”","Her cousin had once reminded her not to let Captain Xia have his way with her, lest she suffered.","In the end!","After seeing Captain Xia, she immediately forgot about her cousin’s advice.","Uh! That wasn’t right.","She had never taken her cousin’s advice to heart.","Whether she saw Captain Xia or not, she would’ve forgotten about it all the same.","Hence, when her cousin mentioned going to Captain Xia’s room, her heart was so tense that she was about to run out of oxygen.","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief.","Her entire body went limp as she fell into Xia Jinyuan’s arms.","She heaved a sigh of relief.","Xia Jinyuan, who was hugging her tightly, smiled and said, “Wrong.","I’m not a prophet.","I just know myself and my enemy to ensure I win every battle.","Based on my understanding of Demon King Li, his expression will turn gloomy even if I hold your hand.","If he knows that the two of us are staying in a hotel outside, he definitely won’t let me off easily.","“In order to prevent trouble, I had to make preparations in advance.","As expected, he inadvertently launched an attack.","Fortunately, I was already prepared for combat and was waiting for my cousin-in-law to fire at any time.”","Xia Jinyuan smiled.","An evil look appeared on his face again.","One should not forget who Xia Jinyuan was.","When he was young and ignorant, he was a famous little tyrant in the city.","He was full of mischievous ideas and caused many small troubles.","Old Xia, who led an army, was so angry that he almost had heart disease because of his trouble-making son.","However, because he couldn’t find a big mistake to deal with Xia Jinyuan, Xia Jinyuan managed to get away from it.","This kind of small matter didn’t require intelligence.","It could be settled easily.","It was a small matter!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect to receive the little fox’s admiration.","What a surprise.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who kissed Ye Jian’s face, raised his eyebrows and asked proudly, “Do you admire your future husband?","Am I good?”","He even called himself! her husband.","Ye Jian raised her leg and pressed her heel against the tip of his shoe.","Caught off guard, Xia Jinyuan felt the pain and loosened his grip on her.","Ye Jian, who was stepping on him, took the opportunity to get out of his embrace.","After taking a few steps, she winked playfully and snorted.","“You’re taking advantage of me with your mouth again?","Husband?","Are we married?","Have we registered our marriage?","You haven’t even proposed!”","“I can kneel on one knee to propose, but I can’t do anything about the marriage certificate.","I haven’t even sent the application report, and your school doesn’t allow me to send such an application report.","Why don’t I propose first?”","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was as smooth as ever, tidied his clothes and looked like he was going to propose immediately.","Ye Jian, the one who brought it up, panicked.","She stammered, “You! Don’t do it.","I don’t want an insincere proposal!”","After she finished speaking, she turned around and fled faster than a rabbit.","Fortunately, she had Room 1601’s room key card.","If not, she would have to come back to get it.","Xia Jinyuan looked at the fleeing figure and laughed happily.","He was in a good mood.","Li Jinnian, who had finished washing up in five minutes, knocked on Room 1608.","Xia Jinyuan, who had only taken three minutes to shower, was wearing the casual clothes that the old madam had prepared for him.","He came over to open the door as he wiped his hair.","Ye Jian wasn’t around.","Li Jinnian, who came in and sat down, thought for a moment and asked in a cold voice, “You know that Uncle Chen has left, right?”"]},{"number":4184,"title":"Chapter 4184 High Risk","paragraphs":["Chapter 4184: High Risk","Chapter 4184: High Risk Editor: Henyee Translations","As soon as Li Jinnian spoke, Xia Jinyuan realized that this wasn’t an ordinary chat.","It was a targeted chat that concerned Uncle Chen.","Could it be that he had some news?","As soon as this thought flashed past his mind, Xia Jinyuan denied it.","Li Jinnian might know about Uncle Chen’s passing, but as a navy soldier, he couldn’t know about the army’s military mission unless the two armies cooperated.","Xia Jinyuan’s facial expression turned cold instantly because of the topic.","He said, “I only found out less than 48 hours ago.","Ye Jian told me personally that he was killed by a sniper.","The other party is also a world-class sniper.","If we want to find him, we can first list the snipers from various countries who took on an assassination mission.”","He paused for a moment and added, “Ye Jian lacks experience, so she didn’t think of understanding these snipers first.","I plan to!” His cold gaze met Li Jinnian’s cold facial expression.","Xia Jinyuan’s voice was a little tense.","“I plan to apply to the military to send her to study at the Weirui Inferno Camp during the summer vacation.","“If she wants to take revenge for Uncle Chen personally, she has to come into contact with more world-class snipers.","Uncle Chen was a world-class sniper from the early 1970s to the early 1980s.","However, almost 20 years have passed.","Although Ye Jian was trained by him, she has to learn more if she wants to improve.","“The level of sniping skills 20 years ago and the level of sniping skills 20 years later are different.","The standard of sniping is changing day by day.","If she wants to break through, she has to stand on a wider horizon to learn.”","The Weirui Inferno Camp was different from the Weirui Demon King Camp.","The Weirui Demon King Camp was a legal representative sent by the military of the various countries.","However, the Weirui Inferno Camp was different.","There were high-risk people from all over the world gathered here.","Among them, there were legal and illegal identities.","In the early 1970s, the serial murders that shocked the entire world in the United States were said to be committed by someone from the Weirui Inferno Camp.","To this day, the murderer was still at large and hadn’t been caught.","There was a rumor that the murderer returned to the Weirui Inferno Camp and became a training instructor.","Later, he was killed by the special forces soldiers who infiltrated the training camp.","In the 1980s, the Weirui Inferno Camp established a new rule.","Any high-risk people who entered the camp could not kill each other.","Once they were found out, even if the culprit had already left the training camp, they would be hunted down.","Someone had breached this rule before and died in a car accident in less than half a year.","After that, there were no more killings in the Weirui Inferno Camp.","The reason why Xia Jinyuan suggested letting Ye Jian go to such a terrifying place was because almost half of the people on the sniper rankings came from the Weirui Inferno Camp.","If she wanted to find out who killed Uncle Chen as soon as possible, entering the training camp was a good choice.","Although the Weirui Inferno Camp was an illegal place, there were many soldiers who trained there.","Xia Jinyuan was one of them.","Demon King Li! was also one of them.","The two of them trained there for half a year.","When they came back, they suffered from multiple injuries.","Demon King Li, who went three months before Xia Jinyuan, came back to take on the heavy responsibility of forming a maritime amphibious navy special forces unit.","Xia Jinyuan, who came back half a year later, parachuted into the Xueyu unit and became the captain of the unit.","Li Jinnian had experienced all kinds of cruel training that exceeded his mind and body.","Hearing that, he held his breath and subconsciously said in a low voice, “I don’t agree!”"]},{"number":4185,"title":"Chapter 4185 Argument","paragraphs":["Chapter 4185: Argument","Chapter 4185: Argument Editor: Henyee Translations","That was hell.","As a male soldier, he was there for half a year.","The first month, his mind and body suffered unprecedented damage.","It was not an exaggeration to say that his soul had to be reconstructed.","There was only coldness and darkness there.","Even if you stood under the sun, your heart would still be cold.","Those who could get through it all graduated successfully.","Those who couldn’t! Well, some went crazy, some were disabled, and some committed suicide.","“She won’t give up on finding Uncle Chen’s murderer.","Demon King, if she wants to retaliate, she has to strengthen herself.","It’s time for Ye Jian to break through her bottleneck.","“The summer vacation will only last for two months.","With her perseverance, she’ll be able to survive even if it takes a few more months.","“Demon King, the opponent she’s going to face is not an ordinary person.","I believe that you don’t want to hear any bad news about her one day, right?","“I don’t want to.","That’s why I have to be ruthless.”","This was Xia Jinyuan.","When he was ruthless to his girlfriend, Ye Jian, other people would tremble in fear.","Other people wouldn’t understand Xia Jinyuan’s painstaking efforts.","They wouldn’t understand what kind of struggle Xia Jinyuan experienced every time he made a decision.","Others didn’t understand.","As a soldier, Li Jinnian understood.","They were all people closest to the Grim Reaper.","If they didn’t have the ability, the Grim Reaper’s scythe would have fallen long ago.","They all knew that the enemies they faced were very powerful.","If they wanted to defeat powerful enemies, they had to be stronger than their strong opponents to come back alive.","Uncle Chen’s murderer was indeed not an ordinary murderer.","How did Li Jinnian know that Uncle Chen was killed?","A few days ago, Li Jinnian received a document that required his team to strengthen their coastal patrol.","Once they discovered suspicious people on the sea, they would immediately subdue them regardless of whether there was really a problem.","He asked the navy commander-in-chief why he suddenly issued the red document.","He only found out about this from the commander-in-chief.","When he heard Uncle Chen’s real name, ‘Chen Dongfeng’, he didn’t realize that it was the same Uncle Chen who raised his cousin, Ye Jian.","He only felt that the name was a little familiar and he seemed to have heard it somewhere before.","When he returned to the dormitory, he suddenly saw the photo placed on the desk.","He sobered up when he saw his cousin smiling like a flower in the photo.","Chen Dongfeng was Principal Chen, the Uncle Chen his cousin had always kept in her heart.","She even said that she wanted to bring Uncle Chen to the capital city.","She also said that when Uncle Chen really retired in the future, she would bring him to the capital city to live out his remaining days..","His uncle and grandpa had both mentioned bringing Uncle Chen to their house.","Due to time constraints, they couldn’t do it.","Who knew that it would become a lifelong regret?","If it wasn’t for this red document, Li Jinnian wouldn’t have known that his cousin had experienced a heart-wrenching calamity.","The room fell silent.","It was not until the doorbell rang that the heavy atmosphere was broken.","Xia Jinyuan stood up and opened the door for Ye Jian.","Li Jinnian pursed his lips and said, “We can’t make a decision for her.","I don’t want her to go to that kind of place either.” It was a place that could drive people crazy.","He didn’t want his cousin to suffer inhumane treatment.","Xia Jinyuan, who was walking to open the door, paused in his footsteps.","He seemed to want to say something, but in the end, he didn’t.","He pursed his thin lips and strode over to open the door for Ye Jian.","Ye Jian had already washed up and was wearing a sporty short-sleeved shirt and shorts that were used as pajamas in the military school.","Li Jinnian saw that her fair and tender legs were green and purple in several places.","Her arms were the same.","At a glance, most of her skin was bruised.","These were all injuries from the three days of outdoor survival training as well as the injuries from the previous training.","Nevertheless, she had rested for two days and recovered a lot."]},{"number":4186,"title":"Chapter 4186 Angry","paragraphs":["Chapter 4186: Angry","Chapter 4186: Angry Editor: Henyee Translations","For Ye Jian and the rest, their skin wouldn’t get any better all year round.","In Xu Wen’s words, other than their chests, there was nothing good on their bodies.","Li Jinnian saw that Ye Jian’s calves and arms were green and purple.","The already cold atmosphere became much lower.","It was so low that Ye Jian panicked.","She thought that her cousin had discovered something.","“Don’t think too much.” Xia Jinyuan smiled softly.","“Why have you become timid?","It’s something else that made your cousin a little unhappy.”","That was good.","That was good.","When Ye Jian heard that her cousin hadn’t discovered that they had slept together, the vigilance on her face disappeared.","She walked over and said to Li Jinnian, “Brother, why are you in a bad mood?","What did you guys talk about just now?","Can you tell me?”","Li Jinnian glanced at the guy who was sitting down beside his cousin and then looked at Ye Jian.","His cold aura warmed up.","“You don’t want to sleep?","Did you really come over to chat with us?”","“I slept too much during the day, so now I want to chat.","What did you guys talk about just now?","The atmosphere is a little off.","Were you talking about me?","Why are the two captains angry?”","Ye Jian, who was smiling as she spoke, wanted to ease the low atmosphere.","In the end, her efforts backfired.","The atmosphere that she had painstakingly eased instantly became tense again.","She saw the coldness in her cousin’s eyes, making her heart palpitate.","“It can’t be! Were you guys really talking about me?","Nothing has happened to me recently.”","Ye Jian, who was explaining herself, faced the two captains who trained her hard in the past.","Even though one was her family member and the other was her boyfriend, her attitude was still upright and she was still aware of her identity.","She didn’t speak casually just because their relationship was different.","A soldier was a soldier.","Since they were talking about serious matters, they had to act like soldiers.","Her facial expression turned serious.","Xia Jinyuan held her hand that was placed on his knee.","He interlocked their fingers and clenched hers tightly.","He said gently, “There’s no problem.","Everything’s good.","Demon King Li and I just have different opinions and can’t agree on something.”","“Q King, I don’t want to talk about this anymore.” Li Jinnian’s voice was cold.","“I don’t agree.”","Xia Jinyuan’s gaze turned cold.","“It’s not a matter of whether you agree with me or not.","It’s a matter of formality.","It’s not up to us to make the decision.","In the end, it’s up to her.","I’m just suggesting.","I won’t force her.","“The analysis of the pros and cons is in her hands.”","“Ha, you have a huge influence on my cousin.","My words might not be effective, but your words will definitely work.","Since you brought it up, she knows that you must have thought about it carefully.","Otherwise, you wouldn’t have brought it up.","You said that the choice is in my cousin’s hands, but in fact, my cousin will have already made her choice the moment you open your mouth.”","These words were extremely sharp.","Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face was as cold as ice.","Under the ice, the abyss was endless.","No one knew what he was thinking.","Sensing the hostility, Ye Jian looked at the two of them and pursed her lips.","“I’m the person involved in your topic, right?","As the person involved, don’t I have the right to know?","“The two of you have said so much, but I’m the only one who doesn’t know anything.","Shouldn’t you tell me what’s going on first?”","Ye Jian’s voice was a little cold too.","She could listen to them and not interrupt, but now that they were talking about her and there was the smell of gunpowder, she had the right to know.","Li Jinnian could tell that his cousin was a little angry and immediately regretted it.","He took a deep breath and calmed down before saying, “We were talking about Uncle Chen just now, but I don’t agree with Xia Jinyuan’s suggestion.”"]},{"number":4187,"title":"Chapter 4187 The Brave Wins","paragraphs":["Chapter 4187: The Brave Wins","Chapter 4187: The Brave Wins Editor: Henyee Translations","Principal Chen was a sore spot that Ye Jian couldn’t touch at the moment.","Even though a few months had passed, her heart was still bleeding.","Hearing this, Ye Jian’s cold expression turned a little dark.","“Speak.","I’m listening.","And don’t argue.","I have my own judgment.”","The person who made the suggestion would naturally make things clear to Ye Jian.","Xia Jinyuan looked at his cousin-in-law, whose expression was as cold as ice.","He sighed in his heart and slowly told Ye Jian his suggestion.","He was Ye Jian’s boyfriend.","As her boyfriend, how could he want his girlfriend to suffer in a place without warmth?","If not for their identities, Xia Jinyuan would be the first to stand up and beat up whoever dared to ask the little fox to go to the Weirui Inferno Camp.","He would beat them up until they could forget about speaking for the rest of their lives.","Even though it was only for two months, it would feel like a year.","Every minute and second would be agony.","However, it was undeniable that as long as one endured it, one’s soul would be tempered.","One would be able to remain calm when facing missions that required challenging one’s mentality.","Just like him, he had lurked by Cobra’s side for almost a year and a half.","Xia Jinyuan was so cunning that even until his death, Cobra didn’t know who shot him.","“It’s a place that can’t even be warmed by the sun.","As long as you step into that training camp, all your rights will be taken away.","You’ll no longer be you.","You’ll only be you after you walk out of the training camp.","You’ll have to change your codename as well.","“There, you can come into contact with top weapons.","Besides internationally banned weapons, you can come into contact with anything that flies in the sky, swims in the sea, or runs on land.","“Half of the snipers in the current rankings came from the Weirui Inferno Camp.","There are also those snipers who don’t show their faces at all but can kill accurately when they act.","They serve their country like ghosts and carry out the highest-level missions.","“Sniper training is different from the training we underwent, but I don’t know how different it is.","You’ll only know what’s different about sniper training if you go.","“Just now, I told the Demon King that the person who killed Uncle Chen must be a world-class sniper.","If you want to find the murderer as soon as possible, you might be able to gain something by interacting with those first-rate snipers.","More importantly!”","Ignoring Li Jinnian’s darkening expression, Xia Jinyuan stared at his lover.","“More importantly, your sniping skills will improve greatly.","Ye Jian, when you meet the murderer one day, I only want you to win!”","Why did he want to send her to such a cruel place?","Because he didn’t want to lose her!","He would rather be cruel now than regret it in the future!","Ye Jian, who had never heard of the Weirui Inferno Camp, was so shocked that she didn’t come back to her senses for a long time even after Xia Jinyuan finished speaking.","There was actually such a gray area.","A group of high-risk people could actually gather and train together.","In that case, who would win on the battlefield?","Just like that, Xia Jinyuan opened a new door for Ye Jian to peek at the dark corner of the world.","He let her know that there was such an illegal establishment that was tacitly approved by the various countries.","As it turned out, the outside world was very wide.","There were too many things she didn’t know.","“I originally planned to mention the Weirui Inferno Camp to you after you graduated.","Now, it’s brought forward.","If you have any thoughts, you can raise them now.","Demon King Li and I are both here.","You can express your opinions.”","Xia Jinyuan added.","Li Jinnian said, “You can raise your thoughts and questions, but I don’t suggest you make a decision immediately.","There’s still some time before the summer vacation.”"]},{"number":4188,"title":"Chapter 4188 I’m Scared","paragraphs":["Chapter 4188: I’m Scared","Chapter 4188: I’m Scared Editor: Henyee Translations","It was not a small matter to go to Weirui Inferno Camp.","Xia Jinyuan could understand Li Jinnian’s worry.","Xia Jinyuan, who was staring at Ye Jian quietly, said in a low voice, “That’s a place that’s so cold that you can die at any time.","The cruel training ground is a battlefield.","High-risk people undergo high-risk training.","Although the rules state that members can’t kill each other, there’s nothing they can do if you die during training.","“Most importantly, if you die during training, you won’t even be conferred third-class honors, let alone be given a martyr title.","You’ll just be a number there.","“Demon King Li is right.","Don’t make a decision immediately.","You can also ask us more about the Weirui Inferno Camp.","We’ll give you detailed answers for your reference.”","Ye Jian lowered her eyes slightly.","She didn’t dare to look at her cousin, Li Jinnian, because she already had an answer in her heart.","She didn’t dare to look, which made Li Jinnian’s heart sink.","He fell into a bottomless abyss, and his eyes were filled with sorrow.","“I’ve been through this dark training and know how cruel it is.","It wasn’t easy for me to make it back.","It wasn’t easy for Grandpa and Uncle to attain their current happiness.","I really don’t want to break this hard-earned happiness.”","Li Jinnian was no longer sitting upright.","He leaned against the back of the couch and raised his head.","His handsome jaw was tense, and his neck was so tense that one could see the light green blood vessels under his skin.","“Ye Jian, you’re already a special forces soldier who undertakes high-risk missions.","What if something happens during the inhumane and cruel high-risk training?","“Grandpa is old and only hopes that his grandchildren will be safe.","Grandpa has experienced too many things.","He lost many sons when he was young and was imprisoned for no reason.","Later on, Grandma passed away.","Although Grandpa didn’t say anything, every incident gouged his heart.","“Cousin, I’m just worried that something might happen to you there.","Cold sweat is already breaking out on my back.","“I can’t imagine what will happen to Grandpa and Uncle if something were to really happen to you.","I don’t dare to think too deeply about it.","I’m afraid.”","Even if he was just imagining it, Li Jinnian was afraid.","How could he agree to let Ye Jian go to that kind of place where she might not be able to return?","Even if it could greatly improve the abilities of a special forces soldier, he didn’t want his cousin to go.","He also knew how influential Xia Jinyuan’s words would be to his cousin.","Hence, he didn’t object vehemently.","He just asked his cousin not to make a decision immediately and to consider it carefully.","Xia Jinyuan pursed his thin lips into a straight line.","Old Master Fu and his future father-in-law! These two elders were the closest relatives of the little fox.","They were her deepest concern.","Blood ties might make her want to back out.","If the little fox retreated now, he would show her his support.","However! before entering the Xueyu unit, he would definitely let her undergo training.","If it was between the Weirui Demon King Camp or the Weirui Inferno Camp, he was more inclined to the Weirui Inferno Camp.","White Crane, who had gone to Weirui Inferno Camp, was about to return after a year.","At that time, he could have a chat with the little fox.","Xia Jinyuan pursed his thin lips and smiled faintly.","He said to his lover, who had been silent for a long time, “Why aren’t you saying anything?","Are you still thinking about the questions you want to ask?","“Don’t be anxious.","Think about it slowly.","I don’t need your answer now.”"]},{"number":4189,"title":"Chapter 4189 Nirvana","paragraphs":["Chapter 4189: Nirvana","Chapter 4189: Nirvana Editor: Henyee Translations","This time, Ye Jian didn’t agree immediately.","She lowered her head and nodded.","She wasn’t thinking about whether she should agree or not.","She was thinking about how to reassure her cousin.","She had her own judgment.","Through Xia Jinyuan’s and Li Jinnian’s introduction of Weirui Inferno Camp, she knew how dangerous that place was.","It was so dangerous that there was a chance she might lose her life in every training.","However, this wasn’t a strong enough reason for her not to go.","She really, really wanted to go.","That was because there were world-class snipers training there.","That was because she could come into contact with more world-class snipers.","If she trained there, she might become a world-class sniper one day.","Now, she was still a long way from becoming a world-class sniper.","In the past two years, she had also felt a bottleneck in her sniping.","She felt that she hadn’t improved for a long time.","She felt that she hadn’t grasped any new knowledge for a long time.","Although it was dangerous, it still attracted her deeply.","She really wanted to go.","She didn’t say anything.","The two captains from the special forces couldn’t figure it out.","Besides sitting there quietly, there was nothing else they could do.","Xia Jinyuan naturally wouldn’t persuade Ye Jian to go.","That was because he was still considering whether he should let the woman he loved go there.","Damn it, he couldn’t bear it.","But if she didn’t go, he was afraid of losing her.","Between the two, the latter had the upper hand.","In the end, the choice was in her hands.","Whether she went or not was up to her.","“Let me think about it.","Cousin, you’re right.","Grandpa is old and can’t take the stimulation.","If I really go, I can’t guarantee that I’ll be safe.","If something really happens to me, Grandpa will definitely not be able to accept it.","“It’s the same for Dad.","Dad has been looking for my mother for more than 20 years.","My mother has passed away and left me to accompany my father.","If something happens to me, I’m afraid my father will leave with us.”","Ye Jian’s reply didn’t reassure Li Jinnian.","When she heard Xia Jinyuan say that half of the snipers in the rankings came from the Weirui Inferno Camp, a glint had flashed past her eyes.","Even though it was short, he could see it clearly.","She would remember this and decide to go.","Li Jinnian, who was leaning against the back of the couch, strained his neck.","After a long time, he said, “I can’t stop you from wanting to go.","Even Grandpa and Uncle can’t stop you.","“The high altitude and strong winds that you’re used to will help you.","I know that you want to go.","Your gaze just now told me that you want to go.”","Li Jinnian, who was not used to talking too much, pursed his lips.","He was a little tired and wanted to go back to his room to rest.","“Think about it carefully.","I’m! a little tired.” Li Jinnian sat up straight and looked calmly at his cousin, who was starting to feel uneasy because of his words.","The corners of his lips twitched as he smiled helplessly.","“Make your own decision.","If you go! tell me so that I can hide it from Grandpa and Uncle when I get home.","“I will guard Grandpa and Uncle’s happiness until you come back.”","“Cousin!”","Ye Jian’s voice choked up instantly.","“I’m sorry! I’m sorry.","I want to take revenge for Uncle Chen so badly.","I can’t let the murderer get away with it.","Uncle Chen shouldn’t have left like that.","The other party is too ruthless, too ruthless!","“If I want to find the murderer, I have to live well with Grandpa, Dad, and all of you.","If I want to live, I have to work harder.","“I’m afraid of death too.","I’m also afraid that I won’t be able to see you again.","That’s why I’ll definitely work hard to live well and not let anything happen to me.","“Cousin, just believe me this time.","You’ve trained me before.","You should know that I’ll definitely be able to survive.”"]},{"number":4190,"title":"Chapter 4190 Forever","paragraphs":["Chapter 4190: Forever","Chapter 4190: Forever Editor: Henyee Translations","“That’s right.","I trained you and know that you’ll be able to survive, so that’s why I’m letting you decide.","I’ll take care of Grandpa and Uncle!”","Li Jinnian smiled bitterly and shook his head.","His cold voice was filled with resignation.","“Actually, I can’t take care of them much.","Uncle Fu has always been taking care of Grandpa.","But Grandpa has something to look forward to now.","He wants to watch over us and return safely.","“Grandpa, who’s used to waiting alone, and Uncle, who’s used to entering the base alone to study! Their biggest source of happiness is your safe return.","“I just hope that you’ll remember that Grandpa and Uncle are waiting for you to come back while you’re focused on taking revenge for Uncle Chen.”","“I know, I know.","I’ve always remembered it.","I remember it all the time.","Cousin, don’t worry.","I won’t make Grandpa and Dad sad or disappoint you.”","Ye Jian kept nodding as she replied.","She felt guilty, but she would definitely persevere.","“I’ll remember what you said today.","I hope you’ll remember it too.” Li Jinnian stood up.","He needed to be alone.","He didn’t want to continue chatting for the time being.","Just as Li Jinnian turned around and left, Xia Jinyuan, who had been listening to the cousins’ conversation silently, said in a low voice, “Demon King Li, before Uncle Chen left, he told Ye Jian not to take revenge for him.","Why did Uncle Chen give her this reminder?”","Li Jinnian, who paused, stood with his back facing the two of them for a while.","After a while, he clenched his fists and turned around.","He glanced at Xia Jinyuan coldly.","“Because it’s very dangerous.","With my cousin’s current strength, he doesn’t think she’s capable enough of defeating the murderer.”","“That’s right.","That’s why Ye Jian has to face unknown dangers if she wants to become stronger.","I know that it’s cruel, but I’d rather be cruel to her than lose her!”","“I know.","Good night.”","Li Jinnian replied to him and said to Ye Jian, “I’ll send you to school tomorrow.” Ye Jian only had time to say ‘good night’ before he strode away.","After the door closed, Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian from behind and sighed.","“I’ve offended my cousin-in-law badly.","Alas, I need to think of a way to make up for it.”","“You can’t make up for it.","The moment you opened your mouth just now, my cousin probably wanted to kill you.” Ye Jian touched Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face.","Her choked voice was filled with melancholy.","“My cousin is doing this for my own good.","He knows that it’s very dangerous there and is afraid that something might happen to me.","That’s why he wanted to stop me.","“But he knows that if he really stops me, he’ll regret it for the rest of his life if something bad were to happen.","Between fear and regret, he chose fear.”","The fear would only last a while, but regret would last a lifetime.","And there would be no hope at all.","Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian’s slender waist tightly from behind.","He hunched his body and rested his chin on her neck.","He didn’t say anything.","The two of them stood there and hugged each other.","The atmosphere in the room was so quiet that they didn’t want to break it.","After some time, Xia Jinyuan’s deep voice became a little strange.","It was like a broken string, making people’s hearts sink.","“This path is too difficult, but I won’t let go.","I’ll always pull you along.","No matter how bitter or tired I am, I won’t let go.”","“Then don’t let go.","Just hold my hand tightly and occasionally give me guidance.","Captain Xia, I walked so much so that I could reach your side.","If you let go, what should I do?”","She spoke in a low voice and played with the strings in his heart.","He was touched by her every word.","“I won’t let go.","Since I’ve decided to hold your hand, I’ll hold it tightly for the rest of my life.","I definitely won’t let go of your hand.” He kissed her neck lightly.","A teardrop silently fell into her collar."]},{"number":4191,"title":"Chapter 4191 Request","paragraphs":["Chapter 4191: Request","Chapter 4191: Request Editor: Henyee Translations","Who didn’t want to live a peaceful life?","Who didn’t want to be with their loved ones?","Who didn’t want to avoid getting injured?","Who didn’t want to have their safe return ensured?","It was the same for everyone.","However, there were some things that had to be done, completed, and carried out.","These were the people who wore olive green.","Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan, and Li Jinnian were such people.","It was because of this that they understood each other.","No matter how worried they were, they would still feel at ease when it was time to let go.","After Xia Jinyuan sent Ye Jian back to Room 1601 to rest, he sat by the bed alone.","After a long time, he took out his phone and sent a message.","It was already one o’clock in the morning.","After sending the message, Xia Jinyuan placed his phone under the blanket and lay on the bed.","He spread his hands and legs and closed his eyes.","His elegant and noble facial expression remained stiff.","Less than a minute after the message was sent, the phone on the blanket vibrated.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t open his eyes.","He touched the blanket with his long hand and reached for the phone.","Then, he opened his eyes to see who was calling.","“Dad, why aren’t you resting?”","“I received your message as soon as I returned to the house.” Commander Xia took off his military cap and placed it on the coat rack.","He asked the guard to pour him a glass of water.","He walked straight to the couch in the living room and sat down.","“Your decision is very sudden.","Tell me your reason.”","Lying on the bed, Xia Jinyuan got up and sat down.","He said in a low voice, “Dad, you caught someone but there’s no follow-up.","What’s going on?","Ye Jian thinks that there’s no useful information, which is why she hasn’t been informed of any news.","“This doesn’t suit your style of doing things.","If there’s no news, you’d definitely inform her rather than not mention anything.”","As his son, Xia Jinyuan knew his father well.","Xia Jinyuan’s thoughts differed from Ye Jian’s.","Although he told her that there was no news, he had already planned to go back to the capital city to ask about it.","Now, he did it in advance.","Commander Xia took the glass of water from the guard.","He raised his head and drank half of it in one go.","He put down the glass and pondered for a moment before saying calmly, “There’s a problem, but we didn’t find any useful information.","“Someone in the underworld paid money to kill a member of the Zhou family.","It doesn’t matter who it is.","Once we find this person, the clues will end there.","“That means that Little Ye’s suspicion is unfounded.","The two cases are not done by the same group of people.","The two men are still locked up.","As for when they’ll be released, it’s unknown.","“I didn’t tell Little Ye because!” Commander Xia paused for a moment and sighed.","“The military has always been protecting Principal Chen.","Who knew that something would happen under their noses?","Little Six, the military can’t give Little Ye an explanation.","I don’t know how to communicate with Little Ye either.","“You’re her boyfriend.","You’re the most suitable person to communicate with her.","The military will definitely catch the murderer.","No matter what the price is, we must bring the murderer back to the country.","Don’t worry about this.”","This was Commander Xia’s promise to Ye Jian on behalf of the military.","Xia Jinyuan hummed in a low voice and asked about the message he sent.","“You can make the arrangements now.","If she wants to improve her sniping skills, she needs to go to more cruel places to undergo training.”","“Is that the only reason?” Commander Xia asked.","“No.","Uncle Chen’s murderer is also a world-class sniper.","If Ye Jian wants to take revenge, she needs to improve her ability first.”","“Second, half of the world-class snipers are from the Weirui Inferno Camp.","Since the murderer is also a world-class sniper, Ye Jian might gain something when she goes over.”","“Third, I don’t want anything to happen to her.”"]},{"number":4192,"title":"Chapter 4192 Demon King Is A Third Wheel","paragraphs":["Chapter 4192: Demon King Is A Third Wheel","Chapter 4192: Demon King Is A Third Wheel Editor: Henyee Translations","There was silence on the other end of the cell phone for a long time.","Xia Jinyuan, who had always been patient, waited quietly.","This decision couldn’t be made in an instant.","Tonight, he only told his father about his and Ye Jian’s future plans.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect to get his old man’s agreement immediately.","As expected, Commander Xia, who had been silent for a while, said, “Little Ye agreed, but the military needs to consider it carefully before making a decision.","It wasn’t easy to groom a female special forces soldier, especially since Little Ye is extremely talented.","The military is still waiting for her to graduate before entrusting her with a heavy responsibility.","I can’t give you an answer now.”","“I know.","I just want to tell you that you can discuss it with Major General Yang and the other chiefs.","We can decide whether she can go or not.","It’ll depend on the military’s arrangements.","“It’s getting late.","Have an early rest.","Good night.”","“Good night.”","After ending the call, Commander Xia finished the glass of water in one gulp.","He placed his cell phone and cup on the coffee table and sat alone.","His facial expression was a little serious.","It was unknown what he was thinking.","At five o’clock in the morning the next day, Xia Jinyuan, Ye Jian, and Li Jinnian opened their room doors almost at the same time.","They were even dressed in the same uniform.","The three of them looked at each other.","Ye Jian was the first to say good morning.","Li Jinnian and Xia Jinyuan greeted her back.","The three of them, who were used to waking up early, entered the elevator together and completed a ten-kilometer morning run.","Then, they returned to the hotel drenched in sweat.","It was seven o’clock sharp when they sat in the dining hall of the hotel to have breakfast.","There were not many people there.","The three of them took their breakfast and chose a dining table in the corner where no one would notice them.","They sat down and ate together.","The three of them didn’t communicate during their meal.","They maintained their discipline in the military unit and kept quiet until the meal was over.","The three of them avoided topics about the military and only talked about their personal lives.","After chatting for a while, they realized that the three of them didn’t have much personal things to talk about.","They spent all their time in the military unit.","What kind of personal lives could they have?","Ye Jian decided to talk about the interesting things she encountered during her training and the difficulties she encountered during her studies.","But she wasn’t good at chatting, so the three of them fell silent again.","They looked at each other.","In the end, even Li Jinnian, who didn’t like to smile, couldn’t help but rub his forehead.","“Let’s go back to our room to talk.","It’s not convenient here.”","He and Xia Jinyuan were used to chatting in the military unit.","Sitting in the public dining hall made it an unsuitable place to talk about the military unit.","As for their personal lives, there was nothing to talk about.","“Let’s go back to the room.","I was angered by the two of you last night and forgot to say something.”","Ye Jian hurriedly admitted her mistake.","“There’s no right or wrong.","It all boils down to a choice.","You’ll be returning to school at 2:00 pm.","You still have to go to the hospital later, right?","Let’s go to the hospital together after we talk.” Li Jinnian stood up and walked in front of the two of them.","His cousin had grown up.","When she was having breakfast, she would exchange glances with Xia Jinyuan from time to time.","As her cousin! he had become a third wheel.","He might as well go back to the room and talk about serious matters.","Li Jinnian knew that he had become their third wheel, but he had never thought of leaving.","Xia Jinyuan hadn’t seen Ye Jian for a long time, but he hadn’t seen Ye Jian for a long time too.","Give the couple some space?","He couldn’t do that!","Xia Jinyuan, who was a few steps behind, quickly reached out and held Ye Jian’s hand.","He teased her in a low voice, “When he gets a girlfriend in the future, I plan to follow him around.”"]},{"number":4193,"title":"Chapter 4193 Declaring Sovereignty","paragraphs":["Chapter 4193: Declaring Sovereignty","Chapter 4193: Declaring Sovereignty Editor: Henyee Translations","“How petty.” Ye Jian knew why the man beside her said that.","It was because her cousin had been accompanying them and preventing Xia Jinyuan from having a chance to be alone with her.","“It’ll be a big feat if my cousin ever finds a girlfriend.","If you dare to do that, I’ll ignore you.”","She smiled as she spoke, especially when she glanced sideways.","Her eyes were glassy, making Xia Jinyuan’s heart itch.","He wanted to kiss her!","Xia Jinyuan, who had always been a man of action, looked around.","At this moment, there were a lot more people eating in the dining hall.","A few gazes landed on them.","They weren’t on him and Li Jinnian.","They were all on! his girlfriend!","Xia Jinyuan, who was narrow-minded, changed his mind when he saw this.","He secretly held Ye Jian’s hand and hugged her shoulders openly.","What were these people looking at?","She was taken!","Ye Jian was shocked when he hugged her.","She didn’t struggle and just whispered, “Aren’t you afraid of being taught a lesson by my cousin?”","“I’m not afraid.","Cousin-in-law knows about our relationship.” Xia Jinyuan looked at his cousin-in-law who was walking in front.","He deliberately slowed down and narrowed his steps.","This way, he managed to pull a distance between them.","He said, “Not only do I want to hug you, but I also want to kiss you.”","A real kiss.","And it wasn’t just a kiss on the forehead or anywhere else but on the lips.","The gazes that landed on Ye Jian disappeared.","The men in casual clothes retracted their gazes and stopped looking at the woman who made their eyes light up.","When Xia Jinyuan lowered his head and kissed her, Ye Jian widened her eyes.","She wasn’t taken aback by the kiss.","It was because! her cousin, who was walking in front, had turned around.","His expression was dark as he stared coldly at the back of Captain Xia’s head.","If his gaze were bullets, Captain Xia’s head would have already been blown to pieces.","Xia Jinyuan’s gaze was cold and sharp.","He felt a chill on the back of his head.","He stood up and continued to hug Ye Jian’s shoulders.","He looked back at his cousin-in-law calmly and smiled elegantly.","Li Jinnian narrowed his eyes and warned Xia Jinyuan not to push his luck.","After receiving the warning, Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian tightly and walked over calmly.","Then, he smiled and said, “I can’t help myself.","Cousin-in-law, when you get a girlfriend in the future, you’ll definitely understand why I’m impulsive.”","“My surname is Li, and your surname is Xia.","Let’s not address each other as cousins.”","Li Jinnian’s gaze was like iron nails as he looked at Xia Jinyuan’s hand around Ye Jian’s shoulders.","Xia Jinyuan felt the back of his hand hurting.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled.","She didn’t reject Captain Xia kissing her when there were people around.","Seeing her cousin’s dark expression, Ye Jian smiled and said, “Cousin, let’s go.","We’re blocking the corridor of the dining hall.”","She! Her perspective had become skewed!","Li Jinnian felt suffocated.","His cousin didn’t have any objections, so what else could he say?","No!","He still had to say something.","“Don’t be too accommodating or he’ll push his luck.”","Receiving her cousin’s reminder, Ye Jian smiled and said, “I won’t let him push his luck.","If he dares to be unruly, won’t you be around to deal with him?”","“Really?","Aren’t you afraid that I’ll beat him up?”","“No, I’m not afraid.”","“You’re stubborn.” Li Jinnian couldn’t do anything to Ye Jian.","He glared at her with a smile before walking forward."]},{"number":4194,"title":"Chapter 4194 Entrust","paragraphs":["Chapter 4194: Entrust","Chapter 4194: Entrust Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Jinnian, who had his biological mother protecting him, did have a carefree time when he was young.","Later on, when his biological mother passed away, Second Old Madam Li’s true colors were revealed.","A child without their biological mother’s protection became as lonely as a blade of grass.","Second Old Madam Li made sure to weed him out.","Less than half a year after his biological mother passed away, Li Jinnian’s smile disappeared.","Fortunately, he was smart.","The somewhat mature child could see the fierceness hidden underneath Second Old Madam Li’s kind face.","In addition, he would suffer in front of Du Jiayi and her brother from time to time.","Li Jinnian’s personality got colder and colder, and he became more and more reticent.","Until his biological father married Second Old Madam Li, Li Jinnian would only show his face when he ate at home.","The rest of the time, he would lock himself in his room.","Later on, when he was boarding in junior high, Li Jinnian developed a temper and became accustomed to being cold.","He even became cold-blooded.","Old Madam Fu would visit him from time to time, and Old Master Fu would write him many letters.","Later on, his uncle, Fu Yusheng, and Old Madam Fu personally brought him back to the Fu family.","If not for them, Li Jinnian, who had gotten used to being alone, probably wouldn’t even have entered the Fu family’s house.","Li Jinnian, who lost his ‘home’ since he was young, received all the love of the elders of the Fu family.","He gave the only warmth he had to the Fu family.","Now, he had his cousin, Ye Jian.","He wasn’t good at expressing himself, so he used his own method to protect Ye Jian.","He felt that his cousin, Ye Jian, was still young and needed to be taken care of.","He couldn’t let Xia Jinyuan take advantage of her.","He had always thought like this, but he couldn’t stop Ye Jian from liking Xia Jinyuan.","Seeing that she didn’t resist Xia Jinyuan’s intimacy at all, Li Jinnian didn’t stop them.","He couldn’t force the two of them apart.","Appropriate intimacy was fine, but nothing else!","After returning to the room, Li Jinnian said to the two of them seriously, “Uncle and Grandpa don’t want you to get married and have children too early.","You have to know your limits when you’re together.”","This sentence was to remind the two of them.","Then, he said to Xia Jinyuan, “You’re six years older than my cousin and know more than her.","I hope you’ll think about her and not let your greed affect her.","“You’ve been through the military school’s discipline, so I won’t say much.","I don’t object to the two of you getting together.","However, if my cousin is harmed because of your greed, Xia Jinyuan, I’ll stop the two of you from getting together even if it means I’ll have to be the evil person.","“A man who doesn’t care about the big picture and doesn’t think about the future is not worth entrusting my cousin’s life to.”","At first, Ye Jian blushed when she heard her cousin’s words.","Slowly, she hid her shyness and listened attentively.","She knew that her cousin was saying this for her sake.","Xia Jinyuan listened attentively.","He had to listen to his cousin-in-law.","His cousin-in-law’s expression was already dark when he kissed Ye Jian secretly.","If Xia Jinyuan didn’t listen to Li Jinnian now, he would definitely be chased out of the room.","He expressed his stance, “I’ve waited for her for so many years.","I won’t ruin our lives for just a moment.","Don’t worry about this.”","“Grandpa has always been at ease with you.","Uncle has never said anything, but since he didn’t stop you from dating my cousin, it shows that he thinks that you’re worthy of my cousin’s life.","“As for me! I think you make too many cheap shots in front of me.","I’ll wait and see for now.” Li Jinnian glanced at Xia Jinyuan, whom Li Jinnian felt was not honest.","After saying that calmly, he changed the topic and didn’t give Comrade Xia Jinyuan a chance to explain himself."]},{"number":4195,"title":"Chapter 4195 Dislike","paragraphs":["Chapter 4195: Dislike","Chapter 4195: Dislike Editor: Henyee Translations","Comrade Xia thought for a moment and decided not to explain.","That was because he suddenly understood why his cousin-in-law’s expression was gloomy when he saw him being intimate with the little fox.","Just like in the past, when Hou Zi and Xia Yiwei were in a relationship, he secretly wanted to break Hou Zi’s hand with a stick every time he saw Hou Zi, who was still a hooligan at that time, holding Xia Yiwei’s hand.","Why did he have such thoughts?","It was because he felt that Hou Zi was bullying Xia Yiwei.","Li Jinnian’s current mentality was probably similar to his in the past.","He didn’t object, but he just didn’t like Hou Zi.","Li Jinnian didn’t like Xia Jinyuan either.","It didn’t matter.","He just needed to get used to it.","After hearing his cousin-in-law’s reprimand, Comrade Xia nodded, indicating that he understood.","He didn’t let go of Ye Jian’s hand.","Li Jinnian, who had changed the topic, saw this and suppressed his smile.","“The Li family didn’t stop at Li Chuhai’s death.","Old Master Li has always been investigating Li Chuhai’s death.","I know that Li Chuhai is the murderer who harmed Aunt and have been paying attention to the Li family.","At the end of last year, I returned to the Li family and found out that Old Master Li used his connections to investigate Li Chuhai’s death.","Be careful and don’t let the Li family catch you.”","Old Master Li knew that Li Chuhai was executed, but he didn’t know where it took place or who killed him.","Hence, when Li Jinnian returned home at the end of last year, he didn’t tell Xia Jinyuan immediately.","Of course, at that time, he couldn’t find Xia Jinyuan or Ye Jian.","He didn’t tell her in advance, and Ye Jian’s pupils constricted.","No one knew better than her who killed Li Chuhai because! he was her personal enemy.","“Did Old Master Li find anything?” Ye Jian clenched her left hand tightly and pretended to be very natural.","“I don’t think he found anything.","Li Chuhai’s death is a military secret.","Very few people know about it.","Old Master Li shouldn’t have been able to find anything.”","Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian didn’t notice Ye Jian’s abnormality immediately.","Xia Jinyuan said, “I know that Li Chuhai escaped, but I don’t know who killed him.","“When I was still in the country, I once thought of killing Li Chuhai with Ye Jian.","However, I thought that Li Chuhai might recognize us, so I gave up.","“Why would Old Master Li use his connections to investigate a criminal who deserved it?","Why?","Could it be that he wants to take revenge for Li Chuhai?”","Ye Jian pursed her lips.","She was on the mission to kill Li Chuhai with her comrades from the Xueyu unit.","The person who killed Li Chuhai was none other than her.","Captain Xia was overseas when she carried out this mission.","Captain Xia, who didn’t participate in the mission directly, naturally didn’t know.","Pigeon, who was on the mission with her, couldn’t tell Captain Xia about their mission.","It was a military secret, so they couldn’t tell even Captain Xia.","Li Jinnian said coldly, “That should be the case.","If not, he wouldn’t have investigated.","I suspect that Old Master Li knows that the military investigated Li Chuhai because of Aunt.","If he continues investigating this clue, he’ll find Ye Jian sooner or later.","At that time, he might take his anger out on Ye Jian.","“Ye Jian, pay attention to Shuikou Village and see if any strangers have entered Shuikou Village to ask about Aunt.","“Xia Jinyuan, please ask Commander Xia to check if anyone leaked the news.","I’m more than 70% sure that Old Master Li already knows the reason for Li Chuhai’s death.”"]},{"number":4196,"title":"Chapter 4196 A Storm Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4196: A Storm Appears","Chapter 4196: A Storm Appears Editor: Henyee Translations","This piece of news made Xia Jinyuan’s eyes darken.","“Okay, I’ll get the higher-ups to investigate immediately.","But the net is a little big.","We can’t rule out the possibility that Old Master Li found out through other channels.","“The main point now is not that Old Master Li knows the reason for Li Chuhai’s death.","It’s that he’ll find out about Ye Jian.","Once he finds any clues, he’ll investigate deeply and won’t give up easily.","“If he finds out Ye Jian’s identity, Ye Jian will be in danger.”","Xia Jinyuan’s eyes were dark.","Old Master Li was like a wolf that had become a demon.","He was ruthless and cunning.","That was why he was able to retreat safely in the end without hurting himself.","If he found Ye Jian, the situation would indeed become very serious.","What he was most worried about was that if Old Master Li couldn’t find out who killed Li Chuhai, he would take revenge on the little fox in a fit of anger.","This wasn’t impossible!","Ye Jian pursed her lips.","She said to Xia Jinyuan, “Captain Xia, can you report this to Commander Xia immediately?","If the military knows about this, they’ll be wary of Old Master Li.”","“Okay!” Xia Jinyuan immediately moved.","Commander Xia was his father, so it was much more convenient to contact him.","It wasn’t time to rest now.","Xia Jinyuan called the duty room and got transferred to Commander Xia’s office through the landline.","Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian were worried that Old Master Li would find out about Ye Jian because of Li Chuhai’s death.","Not long after Li Chuhai died, Old Master Fu was worried that the Li family would find out why Li Chuhai died and find out about the only child left behind by his daughter-in-law, who was also the granddaughter of the Fu family.","Hence, he looked for Old Master Xia and asked the Xia family to protect his granddaughter.","Little Ye was the granddaughter-in-law of the Xia family.","Since Li Zhengrong dared to deal with the granddaughter-in-law of the Xia family, the Xia family would be the first to not forgive him!","Hence, Li Jinnian and Xia Jinyuan guessed that Commander Xia had made preparations more than a year ago so that Old Master Li wouldn’t be able to find out that the martyr, Red Plum, had a daughter.","Commander Xia, who was reviewing the documents, said calmly, “I was already prepared more than a year ago.","The Li family has indeed been investigating it.","They haven’t stopped until now.”","“It looks like Old Master Li won’t stop until he dies.” Xia Jinyuan sneered and said, “He has a spy on his side.","Once he finds out who killed Li Chuhai, Dad, you and the military have to protect the hero who helped the people.”","!","Commander Xia put down his fountain pen and said something that shocked Xia Jinyuan.","He suddenly looked up at Ye Jian.","Ye Jian was enlightened and immediately guessed why he was looking at her in shock.","She smiled gently.","That was her and Pigeon’s mission.","Captain Xia, who hadn’t participated in the mission, didn’t have the right to know.","“The hero who got rid of evil for the people is none other than the person by your side.","It’s good for you to know this.","If Li Jinnian discovers anything on his side in the future, the two of you can be on guard together.”","These were Commander Xia’s words.","As soon as the call ended, Xia Jinyuan raised his hand and rubbed Ye Jian’s head while she was smiling.","“You’re really bold when I’m not around.","Did you really go over to take revenge personally?”","Li Jinnian was shocked.","Ye Jian pushed away the hand that was still on top of her head and complained with a smile, “Why do you and Cousin like to rub my head?","Stop it.","If you keep doing it, I’ll become bald.”"]},{"number":4197,"title":"Chapter 4197 Good Job","paragraphs":["Chapter 4197: Good Job","Chapter 4197: Good Job Editor: Henyee Translations","With Commander Xia’s advance notice, Ye Jian didn’t have much to worry about.","However, she didn’t tell them the entire mission.","She only said that she and her comrade had worked together at sea and successfully took revenge.","“It was a coincidence.","When you suddenly went away, I thought that you were going to get rid of the power behind Li Chuhai.","I was very worried, and my spirits were average.","Coincidentally, my father was going to Jin City for a meeting, and there were representatives sent by the various military schools.","Commander Xia simply arranged for me to go with my father.”","At this point, there was a hint of viciousness in Ye Jian’s beautiful eyes.","“At night, I went to the port with a few students from various military schools to take a look at the assignments of the ship’s personnel.","Who knew that we would coincidentally discover a problem?","“It was probably predestined.","In the end, we realized that this freighter was carrying ‘goods’ along with it.","The goods they were carrying that night were none other than Li Chuhai.” Ye Jian smiled.","The corners of her lips curled up, but her gaze was serious.","“Old Master Li was eager to save his son and arranged for Li Chuhai to leave the country on the freighter.","He couldn’t have expected that the daughter of the martyr who was secretly harmed by Li Chuhai was also on the ship.","“I waited until Li Chuhai arrived.","In the end, I personally shot the man who wanted to escape.","I thought that it would take a long time to chase after Li Chuhai, just like how I waited for Ye Zhifan to fall.","Who knew that I would finish him off in one night?","The process was so fast that I almost thought that Li Chuhai had gotten another substitute.","“Fortunately, that wasn’t the case.","It was indeed Li Chuhai.","He had escaped for so long and thought that the rumors had passed.","He thought that no one knew what he had done in the past.","He even forgot about the martyr he killed, Red Plum.","It was not until I appeared and told him that I was Red Plum’s daughter that he remembered that he had done such a thing.","“He thought that it was a small matter.","As long as he was comfortable and didn’t suffer grievances, destroying someone and a family was a small matter.","It was a small matter to make him happy.”","That night, Ye Jian saw Li Chuhai’s gaze.","Before he died, he didn’t think that he was in the wrong.","He didn’t repent at all.","There wasn’t an apologetic expression on his face, which caused Ye Jian’s anger to burn in her chest.","She wanted to kill him.","She had to kill him.","If such a person was left alive and got off the ship, many innocent families would be harmed by him.","Ye Jian fired her gun and didn’t give Li Chuhai a chance to get off the ship alive.","Such a person wasn’t worthy of being a human.","He would be tortured in hell.","The dangers of that night faded away in Ye Jian’s voice.","She didn’t mention the dangers during combat.","She only said how she felt at that time.","After more than a year, Ye Jian was still angry.","She was furious because Li Chuhai disregarded human lives and felt that he was right to be arrogant.","Xia Jinyuan held her hand and rubbed the back of her hand gently with his thumb.","He listened quietly with Li Jinnian, letting her vent her remaining anger and unwillingness.","During his absence, his little fox had faced life-threatening danger again and again.","She relied on her strength to survive again and again.","His little fox, the woman he loved deeply, had grown up to be independent.","Now, she relied on herself to face the storms that tested her.","She used her indomitable spirit to pass through the storms and welcome rainbows again and again.","Good job, female soldier!"]},{"number":4198,"title":"Chapter 4198 Siblings","paragraphs":["Chapter 4198: Siblings","Chapter 4198: Siblings Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan was especially proud.","The woman he had been waiting for had finally grown up.","He could feel more at ease letting her face more storms alone.","Including the matter of her going to the Weirui Inferno Camp, he felt more at ease about it.","Li Jinnian, who was clenching his fists, felt as though there was a ferocious beast roaring in his chest.","His heart hurt so much that it seemed to have shattered.","It was so painful that even his face turned pale.","His cousin suffered so much because of his nominal uncle, Li Chuhai.","Li Chuhai harmed his uncle’s family and caused his cousin to suffer so much.","She almost couldn’t return to the Fu family alive to reunite.","At this moment, Li Jinnian hated the surname that he shared with Li Chuhai.","When he was young, he struggled and wanted to leave the Li family’s iron prison.","It looked magnificent, but its insides were rotten to the point where it distorted his personality.","He struggled and suffered until Fu Yusheng told him that life could be more exciting than what he had been experiencing so far.","As long as the door of the iron prison was not welded shut, he would have a lot of chances to leave.","Later on, Li Jinnian finally left and cut off his connection with the Li family bit by bit.","He didn’t even think of himself as a member of the Li family.","He just had the same surname as them.","He did not treat himself as a member of the Li family, nor did he admit that he was a member of the Li family.","He just happened to have the surname ‘Li’.","Now, he felt that the Li family had nothing to do with him, Li Jinnian!","Hence, after Ye Jian finished speaking, Li Jinnian said in a cold voice, “As long as the Li family isn’t eliminated, the threat will always be there.","The best way is to take down the Li family before they find out the truth.”","After talking about the past, Ye Jian, who needed to adjust her emotions, suddenly heard her cousin’s harsh words.","Her pupils constricted, and she stared at him intently.","She blurted out, “Cousin, don’t interfere!”","Her cousin was from the Li family.","She didn’t want to make things difficult for her cousin.","“I promised Grandpa and Uncle that I would protect you.” Li Jinnian took a deep breath.","His cold gaze was filled with fear that he would implicate his only cousin.","He said in a low voice, “If you’re worried because my surname is Li, you can rest assured.","I’m just surnamed Li.","I have nothing to do with the Li family.”","“But!” Ye Jian wanted to say something, but Xia Jinyuan pinched her hand.","He said in a low voice, “I have my own plans.","Just watch.”","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t surprised at all when Li Jinnian said this.","His cousin-in-law didn’t have any kinship with the Li family, especially now that he knew that Old Master Li might harm the little fox.","How could his cousin-in-law, who treated the little fox like a treasure and protected her, side with the Li family?","He would naturally stand on the little fox’s side and think about how to bring down the Li family.","“It’s not easy to take down the Li family.","Otherwise, others would’ve pulled Old Master Li down a few years ago.","In recent years, Old Master Li knows that he has made many enemies in the past.","He’s always living in seclusion without showing his face.","As for what he did in the past, he has already cleaned up the traces.","It’s very difficult to find any evidence against Old Master Li.”","As the Xia family and the Du family didn’t have a good relationship, Xia Jinyuan would occasionally pay attention to the Li family.","He also learned about the Li family from Grandpa Xia.","He knew that Old Master Li was very capable.","His ruthlessness, wrist, and schemes were all extraordinary.","Xia Jinyuan agreed with what his cousin-in-law said about bringing down the Li family, but it was very difficult."]},{"number":4199,"title":"Chapter 4199 Never Afraid","paragraphs":["Chapter 4199: Never Afraid","Chapter 4199: Never Afraid Editor: Henyee Translations","It wasn’t easy to take down the Li family.","Li Jinnian knew that too.","However, if they didn’t make a move, he was afraid that Li Chuhai would harm his uncle and aunt’s relationship even in the afterlife and his nominal grandpa would harm Ye Jian.","“There will always be an opportunity,” he said in a low voice.","He lowered his eyes to hide the gloominess in them.","He would definitely find something to use against the Li family.","Ye Jian was very worried.","She didn’t want her cousin to be infamous because of her.","Her cousin didn’t acknowledge his blood ties to the Li family, but what about the people outside?","The people outside wouldn’t think so.","“Cousin, don’t be too pessimistic.","It’s been more than a year, but Old Master Li hasn’t found me.","It’s obvious that Old Master Li doesn’t know of my existence.","As soon as Ye Jian finished speaking, Li Jinnian shook his head and said, “It’s not that he doesn’t know.","He mentioned the Fu family, which means that he must know why Li Chuhai was investigated and the relationship between Aunt and Uncle.","If not, he wouldn’t have mentioned the Fu family.","“You grew up in Shuikou Village.","Everyone knows Aunt and you.","Once his men go to Shuikou Village, your identity will be exposed.”","“That might not be the case.","My father spent 20 years looking for my mother, but he couldn’t find her.","He even has my mother’s photo.","It’ll be difficult for Old Master Li to find me!”","“So what if he knows about my mother’s relationship with my father?","My mother used a code name back then.","The military unit has also erased all of my mother’s information.","I think it’ll be difficult for Old Master Li to investigate now.”","Ye Jian analyzed calmly, and Xia Jinyuan nodded slightly.","That was right.","Li Chuhai was very ruthless and didn’t leave behind any trail.","In the end, this had made it hard for Old Master Li to find clues about Li Chuhai’s matter.","Just like what the little fox said, Xia Jinyuan’s future father-in-law spent 20 years looking for Red Plum but to no avail.","He didn’t believe that Old Master Li could find Ye Jian so easily.","“Your analysis is correct.","Cousin’s analysis makes sense too.","I’ll ask my family to keep an eye on things.","If they notice anything amiss, they’ll take action immediately.","The military will protect Ye Jian too.","With the military’s ability, they can definitely do this.”","Xia Jinyuan looked at the time.","It was already past 10:00 am.","It was getting late.","It was time to check out and rush to the hospital.","After the three of them conversed, they had an idea of what to do.","Before the topic ended, Ye Jian continued, “If Old Master Li really finds out about me, Cousin, you don’t have to worry too much.","My social circle is very small.","Old Master Li won’t have a chance to do anything to me.”","In short, she wasn’t afraid at all.","The soldiers would deal with whatever came their way.","If a problem really came, she would face it!","She didn’t believe that she wouldn’t be able to survive.","The optimistic Ye Jian made Li Jinnian smile.","His cousin had always been so positive.","If she wasn’t optimistic, she wouldn’t have been able to survive under Ye Zhifan’s family’s pressure.","There were so many storms.","He should believe that his cousin would face them tenaciously.","In the end, the victory would still belong to her.","He should believe in his cousin like Xia Jinyuan.","The topic started with a heavy heart and ended lightheartedly.","Ye Jian, who was optimistic, arrived at the hospital with the two handsome men.","The three of them stood in the elevator like the most beautiful scenery.","Many people who came in took notice of them."]},{"number":4200,"title":"Chapter 4200 Hello, Chief","paragraphs":["Chapter 4200: Hello, Chief","Chapter 4200: Hello, Chief Editor: Henyee Translations","He Jing’s ward was on the 18th floor.","As it was almost noon, there were many people taking the elevator.","While the three of them were waiting to arrive on their floor, they were forced to press their backs against the elevator wall.","Xia Jinyuan wanted to block for Ye Jian a few times, but in the end, this ruthless soldier on the battlefield could only give in in front of the commoners.","Ye Jian looked at the two men who were almost clinging to the wall of the elevator.","She pursed her lips and smiled unkindly.","When they reached the eighth floor, a pot-bellied man squeezed in.","As the elevator made a long beeping sound, the people in the elevator were squeezed by the man again.","Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian were already squeezed against the wall.","This was probably the first time they were squeezed like this in an elevator.","For a moment, their facial expressions were tense as if they were in chaos.","Ye Jian, who was holding back her laughter, felt that her stomach was about to cramp.","The two men, hahaha! Hahaha, it was really funny!","The elevator was so crowded that it was as if they were facing a formidable enemy.","In the end, the pot-bellied man was ‘invited’ out by the others in the elevator.","The alarm had already sounded.","How could he still come in?","Wasn’t he afraid that the elevator would fall?","There were fewer people in the elevator by the time it reached the 18th floor.","The two special forces soldiers heaved a sigh of relief when they walked out of the elevator.","Taking the elevator made them nervous.","This was the first time they encountered something like this!","The two of them had a tacit understanding not to mention such an embarrassing matter.","On the other hand, Ye Jian’s shoulders were still shaking as she walked in front.","She held back her laughter.","In the ward, He Jing and Xu Wen had already packed up.","They had even settled the discharge procedures.","They were just waiting for the nurse to send over the medicine before they would head back to school.","When Ye Jian came in, the two of them looked over at the same time.","Xu Wen’s smile was so meaningful..","Before she could finish laughing, she stopped abruptly.","Xu Wen saw Xia Jinyuan.","Then, right on the heels of that, she saw! another unfamiliar man whose aura was so cold that she didn’t dare to look into his eyes.","Who was this expert?","Why were the people her Little Jian knew all experts?","“My cousin.” Ye Jian held Li Jinnian’s wrist and raised her chin slightly.","She looked much prouder than when she introduced her boyfriend, Xia Jinyuan.","Cousin?","That was amazing!","That was right, having a cousin was amazing.","Xu Wen and He Jing immediately tensed up.","When Li Jinnian reached out his hand and was about to shake hands with the two women to show his courtesy, the two of them reflexively saluted.","They were just short of greeting the chief.","The actions of the two didn’t change Li Jinnian’s facial expression.","He naturally returned the military salute to the two of them and resolved the awkwardness.","It was so awkward.","They didn’t know why they saluted Ye Jian’s cousin when they saw him moving his arm.","It made them salute instinctively.","They were now certain that Ye Jian’s cousin was a soldier.","Good God!","Her boyfriend was a soldier, and her cousin was a soldier too.","‘Ye Jian, do you plan to be in the military unit in the future?","Is your home a military unit too?’","Li Jinnian didn’t let the women introduce themselves to him first.","After the salute, he tried his best to calm down and introduced himself.","“Hello, I’m Ye Jian’s cousin, Li Jinnian.","If you don’t mind, you can address me casually.”"]}]);
